@ ElmsLab <= ElmsLab
Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmText_Intro:
	.string "ELM: {PLAYER}!\nThere you are!\pI needed to ask\nyou a favor.\pI'm conducting new\nPOKéMON research\pright now. I was\nwondering if you\pcould help me with\nit, {PLAYER}.\pYou see…\pI'm writing a\npaper that I want\pto present at a\nconference.\pBut there are some\nthings I don't\pquite understand\nyet.\pSo!\pI'd like you to\nraise a POKéMON\pthat I recently\ncaught.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmText_Accepted:
	.string "Thanks, {PLAYER}!\pYou're a great\nhelp!$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmText_Refused:
	.string "But… Please, I\nneed your help!$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmText_ResearchAmbitions:
	.string "When I announce my\nfindings, I'm sure\pwe'll delve a bit\ndeeper into the\pmany mysteries of\nPOKéMON.\pYou can count on\nit!$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmText_GotAnEmail:
	.string "Oh, hey! I got an\ne-mail!\p<……><……><……>\nHm… Uh-huh…\pOkay…$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmText_MissionFromMrPokemon:
	.string "Hey, listen.\pI have an acquain-\ntance called MR.\nPOKéMON.\pHe keeps finding\nweird things and\praving about his\ndiscoveries.\pAnyway, I just got\nan e-mail from him\psaying that this\ntime it's real.\pIt is intriguing,\nbut we're busy\pwith our POKéMON\nresearch…\pWait!\pI know!\p{PLAYER}, can you\ngo in our place?$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmText_ChooseAPokemon:
	.string "I want you to\nraise one of the\pPOKéMON contained\nin these BALLS.\pYou'll be that\nPOKéMON's first\npartner, {PLAYER}!\pGo on. Pick one!$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmText_LetYourMonBattleIt:
	.string "If a wild POKéMON\nappears, let your\nPOKéMON battle it!$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_LabWhereGoingText:
	.string "ELM: Wait! Where\nare you going?$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_TakeCyndaquilText:
	.string "ELM: You'll take\nCYNDAQUIL, the\nfire POKéMON?$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_TakeTotodileText:
	.string "ELM: Do you want\nTOTODILE, the\nwater POKéMON?$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_TakeChikoritaText:
	.string "ELM: So, you like\nCHIKORITA, the\ngrass POKéMON?$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_DidntChooseStarterText:
	.string "ELM: Think it over\ncarefully.\pYour partner is\nimportant.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ChoseStarterText:
	.string "ELM: I think\nthat's a great\nPOKéMON too!$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ReceivedStarterText:
	.string "{PLAYER} received\n{STR_VAR_3}!$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmDirectionsText1:
	.string "MR.POKéMON lives a\nlittle bit beyond\pCHERRYGROVE, the\nnext city over.\pIt's almost a\ndirect route\pthere, so you\ncan't miss it.\pBut just in case,\nhere's my phone\pnumber. Call me if\nanything comes up!$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmDirectionsText2:
	.string "If your POKéMON is\nhurt, you should\pheal it with this\nmachine.\pFeel free to use\nit anytime.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmDirectionsText3:
	.string "{PLAYER}, I'm\ncounting on you!$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_GotElmsNumberText:
	.string "{PLAYER} got ELM's\nphone number.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmDescribesMrPokemonText:
	.string "MR.POKéMON goes\neverywhere and\nfinds rarities.\pToo bad they're\njust rare and\nnot very useful…$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmPokeBallText:
	.string "It contains a\nPOKéMON caught by\nPROF.ELM.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmsLabHealingMachineText1:
	.string "I wonder what this\ndoes?$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmsLabHealingMachineText2:
	.string "Would you like to\nheal your POKéMON?$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmAfterTheftText1:
	.string "ELM: {PLAYER}, this\nis terrible…\pOh, yes, what was\nMR.POKéMON's big\ndiscovery?$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmAfterTheftText2:
	.string "{PLAYER} handed\nthe MYSTERY EGG to\nPROF.ELM.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmAfterTheftText3:
	.string "ELM: This?$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmAfterTheftText4:
	.string "But… Is it a\nPOKéMON EGG?\pIf it is, it is a\ngreat discovery!$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmAfterTheftText5:
	.string "ELM: What?!?\pPROF.OAK gave you\na POKéDEX?\p{PLAYER}, is that\ntrue? Th-that's\nincredible!\pHe is superb at\nseeing the poten-\ntial of people as\ntrainers.\pWow, {PLAYER}. You\nmay have what it\ptakes to become\nthe CHAMPION.\pYou seem to be\ngetting on great\nwith POKéMON too.\pYou should take\nthe POKéMON GYM\nchallenge.\pThe closest GYM\nwould be the one\nin VIOLET CITY.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmAfterTheftText6:
	.string "…{PLAYER}. The\nroad to the\pchampionship will\nbe a long one.\pBefore you leave,\nmake sure that you\ntalk to your mom.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmStudyingEggText:
	.string "ELM: Don't give\nup! I'll call if\pI learn anything\nabout that EGG!$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmAideHasEggText:
	.string "ELM: {PLAYER}?\nDidn't you meet my\nassistant?\pHe should have met\nyou with the EGG\pat VIOLET CITY's\nPOKéMON CENTER.\pYou must have just\nmissed him. Try to\ncatch him there.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmWaitingEggHatchText:
	.string "ELM: Hey, has that\nEGG changed any?$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmThoughtEggHatchedText:
	.string "{PLAYER}? I thought\nthe EGG hatched.\pWhere is the\nPOKéMON?$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ShowElmTogepiText1:
	.string "ELM: {PLAYER}, you\nlook great!$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ShowElmTogepiText2:
	.string "What?\nThat POKéMON!?!$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ShowElmTogepiText3:
	.string "The EGG hatched!\nSo, POKéMON are\nborn from EGGS…\pNo, perhaps not\nall POKéMON are.\pWow, there's still\na lot of research\nto be done.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmGiveEverstoneText1:
	.string "Thanks, {PLAYER}!\nYou're helping\punravel POKéMON\nmysteries for us!\pI want you to have\nthis as a token of\nour appreciation.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmGiveEverstoneText2:
	.string "That's an\nEVERSTONE.\pSome species of\nPOKéMON evolve\pwhen they grow to\ncertain levels.\pA POKéMON holding\nthe EVERSTONE\nwon't evolve.\pGive it to a POKé-\nMON you don't want\nto evolve.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmText_CallYou:
	.string "ELM: {PLAYER}, I'll\ncall you if any-\nthing comes up.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_AideText_AfterTheft:
	.string "…sigh… That\nstolen POKéMON.\pI wonder how it's\ndoing.\pThey say a POKéMON\nraised by a bad\pperson turns bad\nitself.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmGiveMasterBallText1:
	.string "ELM: Hi, {PLAYER}!\nThanks to you, my\presearch is going\ngreat!\pTake this as a\ntoken of my\nappreciation.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmGiveMasterBallText2:
	.string "The MASTER BALL is\nthe best!\pIt's the ultimate\nBALL! It'll catch\pany POKéMON with-\nout fail.\pIt's given only to\nrecognized POKéMON\nresearchers.\pI think you can\nmake much better\puse of it than I\ncan, {PLAYER}!$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmGiveTicketText1:
	.string "ELM: {PLAYER}!\nThere you are!\pI called because I\nhave something for\nyou.\pSee? It's an\nS.S.TICKET.\pNow you can catch\nPOKéMON in KANTO.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmGiveTicketText2:
	.string "The ship departs\nfrom OLIVINE CITY.\pBut you knew that\nalready, {PLAYER}.\pAfter all, you've\ntraveled all over\nwith your POKéMON.\pGive my regards to\nPROF.OAK in KANTO!$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmsLabMonEggText:
	.string "It's the POKéMON\nEGG being studied\nby PROF.ELM.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_AideText_GiveYouPotion:
	.string "{PLAYER}, I want\nyou to have this\nfor your errand.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_AideText_AlwaysBusy:
	.string "There are only two\nof us, so we're\nalways busy.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_AideText_TheftTestimony:
	.string "There was a loud\nnoise outside…\pWhen we went to\nlook, someone\nstole a POKéMON.\pIt's unbelievable\nthat anyone would\ndo that!\p…sigh… That\nstolen POKéMON.\pI wonder how it's\ndoing.\pThey say a POKéMON\nraised by a bad\pperson turns bad\nitself.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_AideText_GiveYouBalls:
	.string "{PLAYER}!\pUse these on your\nPOKéDEX quest!$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_AideText_ExplainBalls:
	.string "To add to your\nPOKéDEX, you have\nto catch POKéMON.\pThrow POKé BALLS\nat wild POKéMON\nto get them.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmsLabOfficerText1:
	.string "I heard a POKéMON\nwas stolen here…\pI was just getting\nsome information\nfrom PROF.ELM.\pApparently, it was\na young male with\nlong, red hair…\pWhat?\pYou battled a\ntrainer like that?\pDid you happen to\nget his name?$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmsLabOfficerText2:
	.string "OK! So <RIVAL>\nwas his name.\pThanks for helping\nmy investigation!$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmsLabWindowText1:
	.string "The window's open.\pA pleasant breeze\nis blowing in.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmsLabWindowText2:
	.string "He broke in\nthrough here!$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmsLabTravelTip1Text:
	.string "{PLAYER} opened a\nbook.\pTravel Tip 1:\pPress START to\nopen the MENU.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmsLabTravelTip2Text:
	.string "{PLAYER} opened a\nbook.\pTravel Tip 2:\pRecord your trip\nwith SAVE!$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmsLabTravelTip3Text:
	.string "{PLAYER} opened a\nbook.\pTravel Tip 3:\pOpen your PACK and\npress SELECT to\nmove items.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmsLabTravelTip4Text:
	.string "{PLAYER} opened a\nbook.\pTravel Tip 4:\pCheck your POKéMON\nmoves. Press the\pA Button to switch\nmoves.$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmsLabTrashcanText:
	.string "The wrapper from\nthe snack PROF.ELM\nate is in there…$"

Crystal_ElmsLab_ElmsLabPCText:
	.string "OBSERVATIONS ON\nPOKéMON EVOLUTION\p…It says on the\nscreen…$"

