@ Route29 <= Route29
Crystal_Route29_CatchingTutorialBoxFullText:
	.string "POKéMON hide in\nthe grass. Who\pknows when they'll\npop out…$"

Crystal_Route29_CatchingTutorialIntroText:
	.string "I've seen you a\ncouple times. How\pmany POKéMON have\nyou caught?\pWould you like me\nto show you how to\ncatch POKéMON?$"

Crystal_Route29_CatchingTutorialDebriefText:
	.string "That's how you do\nit.\pIf you weaken them\nfirst, POKéMON are\neasier to catch.$"

Crystal_Route29_CatchingTutorialDeclinedText:
	.string "Oh. Fine, then.\pAnyway, if you\nwant to catch\pPOKéMON, you have\nto walk a lot.$"

Crystal_Route29_CatchingTutorialRepeatText:
	.string "Huh? You want me\nto show you how to\ncatch POKéMON?$"

Crystal_Route29_Route29YoungsterText:
	.string "Yo. How are your\nPOKéMON?\pIf they're weak\nand not ready for\pbattle, keep out\nof the grass.$"

Crystal_Route29_Route29TeacherText:
	.string "See those ledges?\nIt's scary to jump\noff them.\pBut you can go to\nNEW BARK without\pwalking through\nthe grass.$"

Crystal_Route29_Route29FisherText:
	.string "I wanted to take a\nbreak, so I saved\pto record my\nprogress.$"

Crystal_Route29_Route29CooltrainerMText_WaitingForDay:
	.string "I'm waiting for\nPOKéMON that\pappear only in the\ndaytime.$"

