Crystal_CherrygroveCity_GuideGentIntroText:
	.string "You're a rookie\ntrainer, aren't\nyou? I can tell!\pThat's OK! Every-\none is a rookie\nat some point!\pIf you'd like, I\ncan teach you a\nfew things.$"

Crystal_CherrygroveCity_GuideGentTourText1:
