	.string "If you prevail on\nthis harsh trek,\pthe truth will be\nrevealed!\pHeh, sorry, I just\nwanted to say\nsomething cool.$"

Crystal_Route27_CooltrainermBrianSeenText:
	.string "Hm? You're good,\naren't you?$"

Crystal_Route27_CooltrainermBrianBeatenText:
	.string "Just as I thought!$"

Crystal_Route27_CooltrainermBrianAfterBattleText:
	.string "A good trainer can\nrecognize other\ngood trainers.$"

Crystal_Route27_CooltrainerfReenaSeenText:
	.string "You shouldn't\nunderestimate the\pwild POKéMON in\nthese parts.$"

Crystal_Route27_CooltrainerfReenaBeatenText:
	.string "Oh! You're much\ntoo strong!$"

Crystal_Route27_CooltrainerfReenaAfterBattleText:
	.string "You're just a kid,\nbut you're not to\pbe underestimated\neither.$"

