	.string "Oh! You're really\nstrong!$"

Crystal_Route27_CooltrainerfMeganAfterBattleText:
	.string "I'm checking out\npre- and post-\nevolution POKéMON.\pEvolution really\ndoes make POKéMON\nstronger.\pBut evolved forms\nalso learn moves\nlater on.$"

Crystal_Route27_PsychicGilbertSeenText:
	.string "Don't say a thing!\pLet me guess what\nyou're thinking.\pMmmmmmm…\pI got it! You're\non the POKéMON\nLEAGUE challenge!$"

Crystal_Route27_PsychicGilbertBeatenText:
