@ MrPokemonsHouse <= MrPokemonsHouse
Crystal_MrPokemonsHouse_MrPokemonIntroText1:
	.string "Hello, hello! You\nmust be {PLAYER}.\pPROF.ELM said that\nyou would visit.$"

Crystal_MrPokemonsHouse_MrPokemonIntroText2:
	.string "This is what I\nwant PROF.ELM to\nexamine.$"

Crystal_MrPokemonsHouse_MrPokemonsHouse_GotEggText:
	.string "{PLAYER} received\nMYSTERY EGG.$"

Crystal_MrPokemonsHouse_MrPokemonIntroText3:
	.string "I know a couple\nwho run a POKéMON\nDAY-CARE service.\pThey gave me that\nEGG.\pI was intrigued,\nso I sent mail to\nPROF.ELM.\pFor POKéMON evolu-\ntion, PROF.ELM is\nthe authority.$"

Crystal_MrPokemonsHouse_MrPokemonIntroText4:
	.string "Even PROF.OAK here\nrecognizes that.$"

Crystal_MrPokemonsHouse_MrPokemonIntroText5:
	.string "If my assumption\nis correct, PROF.\nELM will know it.$"

Crystal_MrPokemonsHouse_MrPokemonsHouse_MrPokemonHealText:
	.string "You are returning\nto PROF.ELM?\pHere. Your POKéMON\nshould have some\nrest.$"

Crystal_MrPokemonsHouse_MrPokemonText_ImDependingOnYou:
	.string "I'm depending on\nyou!$"

Crystal_MrPokemonsHouse_MrPokemonText_AlwaysNewDiscoveries:
	.string "Life is delight-\nful! Always, new\pdiscoveries to be\nmade!$"

Crystal_MrPokemonsHouse_MrPokemonsHouse_OakText1:
	.string "OAK: Aha! So\nyou're {PLAYER}!\pI'm OAK! A POKéMON\nresearcher.\pI was just visit-\ning my old friend\nMR.POKéMON.\pI heard you were\nrunning an errand\pfor PROF.ELM, so I\nwaited here.\pOh! What's this?\nA rare POKéMON!\pLet's see…\pHm, I see!\pI understand why\nPROF.ELM gave you\pa POKéMON for this\nerrand.\pTo researchers\nlike PROF.ELM and\pI, POKéMON are our\nfriends.\pHe saw that you\nwould treat your\pPOKéMON with love\nand care.\p…Ah!\pYou seem to be\ndependable.\pHow would you like\nto help me out?\pSee? This is the\nlatest version of\nPOKéDEX.\pIt automatically\nrecords data on\pPOKéMON you've\nseen or caught.\pIt's a hi-tech\nencyclopedia!$"

Crystal_MrPokemonsHouse_MrPokemonsHouse_GetDexText:
	.string "{PLAYER} received\nPOKéDEX!$"

Crystal_MrPokemonsHouse_MrPokemonsHouse_OakText2:
	.string "Go meet many kinds\nof POKéMON and\pcomplete that\nPOKéDEX!\pBut I've stayed\ntoo long.\pI have to get to\nGOLDENROD for my\nusual radio show.\p{PLAYER}, I'm\ncounting on you!$"

Crystal_MrPokemonsHouse_MrPokemonText_GimmeTheScale:
	.string "Hm? That SCALE!\nWhat's that?\nA red GYARADOS?\pThat's rare! \nI, I want it…\p{PLAYER}, would you\ncare to trade it?\pI can offer this\nEXP.SHARE I got\nfrom PROF.OAK.$"

Crystal_MrPokemonsHouse_MrPokemonText_Disappointed:
	.string "That's disappoint-\ning. That happens\nto be very rare.$"

Crystal_MrPokemonsHouse_MrPokemonsHouse_ForeignMagazinesText:
	.string "It's packed with\nforeign magazines.\pCan't even read\ntheir titles…$"

Crystal_MrPokemonsHouse_MrPokemonsHouse_BrokenComputerText:
	.string "It's a big com-\nputer. Hmm. It's\nbroken.$"

Crystal_MrPokemonsHouse_MrPokemonsHouse_StrangeCoinsText:
	.string "A whole pile of\nstrange coins!\pMaybe they're from\nanother country…$"

