@ CherrygroveGymSpeechHouse <= CherrygroveGymSpeechHouse
Crystal_CherrygroveGymSpeechHouse_CherrygroveGymSpeechHousePokefanMText:
	.string "You're trying to\nsee how good you\pare as a POKéMON\ntrainer?\pYou better visit\nthe POKéMON GYMS\pall over JOHTO and\ncollect BADGES.$"

Crystal_CherrygroveGymSpeechHouse_CherrygroveGymSpeechHouseBugCatcherText:
	.string "When I get older,\nI'm going to be a\nGYM LEADER!\pI make my POKéMON\nbattle with my\pfriend's to make\nthem tougher!$"

@ GuideGentsHouse <= GuideGentsHouse
Crystal_GuideGentsHouse_GuideGentsHouseGuideGentText:
	.string "When I was a wee\nlad, I was a hot-\nshot trainer!\pHere's a word of\nadvice: Catch lots\nof POKéMON!\pTreat them all\nwith kindness!$"

@ CherrygroveEvolutionSpeechHouse <= CherrygroveEvolutionSpeechHouse
Crystal_CherrygroveEvolutionSpeechHouse_CherrygroveEvolutionSpeechHouseYoungsterText:
	.string "POKéMON gain expe-\nrience in battle\pand change their\nform.$"

Crystal_CherrygroveEvolutionSpeechHouse_CherrygroveEvolutionSpeechHouseLassText:
	.string "POKéMON change?\pI would be shocked\nif one did that!$"

@ Route31 <= Route31
Crystal_Route31_Route31CooltrainerMText:
	.string "DARK CAVE…\pIf POKéMON could\nlight it up, I'd\nexplore it.$"

Crystal_Route31_BugCatcherWade1SeenText:
	.string "I caught a bunch\nof POKéMON. Let me\nbattle with you!$"

Crystal_Route31_BugCatcherWade1BeatenText:
	.string "Awwwww…$"

Crystal_Route31_BugCatcherWade1AfterText:
	.string "You can catch\nPOKéMON even if\pyou have six with\nyou.\pIf you catch one,\nit'll go to your\nBOX automatically.$"

Crystal_Route31_Text_Route31SleepyMan:
	.string "… Hnuurg… Huh?\pI walked too far\ntoday looking for\nPOKéMON.\pMy feet hurt and\nI'm sleepy…\pIf I were a wild\nPOKéMON, I'd be\neasy to catch…\p…Zzzz…$"

Crystal_Route31_Text_Route31SleepyManGotMail:
	.string "…Zzzz… Huh?\pWhat's that? You\nhave MAIL for me?$"

Crystal_Route31_Text_Route31HandOverMailMon:
	.string "{PLAYER} handed\nover the POKéMON\nholding the MAIL.$"

Crystal_Route31_Text_Route31ReadingMail:
	.string "Let's see…\p…DARK CAVE leads\nto another road…\pThat's good to\nknow.\pThanks for bring-\ning this to me.\pMy friend's a good\nguy, and you're\nswell too!\pI'd like to do\nsomething good in\nreturn too!\pI know! I want you\nto have this!$"

Crystal_Route31_Text_Route31DescribeNightmare:
	.string "TM50 is NIGHTMARE.\pIt's a wicked move\nthat steadily cuts\pthe HP of a sleep-\ning enemy.\pOoooh…\nThat's scary…\pI don't want to\nhave bad dreams.$"

Crystal_Route31_Text_Route31WrongMail:
	.string "This MAIL isn't\nfor me.$"

Crystal_Route31_Text_Route31MissingMail:
	.string "Why is this POKé-\nMON so special?\pIt doesn't have\nany MAIL.$"

Crystal_Route31_Text_Route31DeclinedToHandOverMail:
	.string "What? You don't\nwant anything?$"

Crystal_Route31_Text_Route31CantTakeLastMon:
	.string "If I take that\nPOKéMON from you,\pwhat are you going\nto use in battle?$"

Crystal_Route31_Route31YoungsterText:
	.string "I found a good\nPOKéMON in DARK\nCAVE.\pI'm going to raise\nit to take on\nFALKNER.\pHe's the leader of\nVIOLET CITY's GYM.$"

Crystal_Route31_Route31SignText:
	.string "ROUTE 31\pVIOLET CITY -\nCHERRYGROVE CITY$"

Crystal_Route31_DarkCaveSignText:
	.string "DARK CAVE$"

@ Route31VioletGate <= Route31VioletGate
Crystal_Route31VioletGate_Route31VioletGateOfficerText:
	.string "Hi there!\nDid you visit\nSPROUT TOWER?$"

Crystal_Route31VioletGate_Route31VioletGateCooltrainerFText:
	.string "I came too far\nout. I'd better\nphone home!$"

@ VioletCity <= VioletCity
Crystal_VioletCity_Text_EarlAsksIfYouBeatFalkner:
	.string "Hello!\nYou are trainer?\pBattle GYM LEADER,\nwin you did?$"

Crystal_VioletCity_Text_VeryNiceIndeed:
	.string "Ooh, la la!\nVery indeed nice!$"

Crystal_VioletCity_Text_FollowEarl:
	.string "Is that so? Then\nstudy shall you!\nFollow me!$"

Crystal_VioletCity_Text_HereTeacherIAm:
	.string "Here, teacher I\nam. Good it is\nyou study here!$"

Crystal_VioletCity_VioletCityLassText:
	.string "Ghosts are rumored\nto appear in\nSPROUT TOWER.\pThey said normal-\ntype POKéMON moves\phad no effect on\nghosts.$"

Crystal_VioletCity_VioletCitySuperNerdText:
	.string "Hey, you're a\nPOKéMON trainer?\pIf you beat the\nGYM LEADER here,\pyou'll be ready\nfor prime time!$"

Crystal_VioletCity_VioletCityGrampsText:
	.string "FALKNER, from the\nVIOLET POKéMON\pGYM, is a fine\ntrainer!\pHe inherited his\nfather's gym and\phas done a great\njob with it.$"

Crystal_VioletCity_VioletCityYoungsterText:
	.string "I saw a wiggly\ntree up ahead!\pIf you touch it,\nit squirms and\ndances! Cool!$"

Crystal_VioletCity_VioletCitySignText:
	.string "VIOLET CITY\pThe City of\nNostalgic Scents$"

Crystal_VioletCity_VioletGymSignText:
	.string "VIOLET CITY\nPOKéMON GYM\nLEADER: FALKNER\pThe Elegant Master\nof Flying POKéMON$"

Crystal_VioletCity_SproutTowerSignText:
	.string "SPROUT TOWER\pExperience the\nWay of POKéMON$"

Crystal_VioletCity_EarlsPokemonAcademySignText:
	.string "EARL'S POKéMON\nACADEMY$"

