@ VioletMart <= VioletMart
Crystal_VioletMart_VioletMartGrannyText:
	.string "When you first\ncatch a POKéMON,\nit may be weak.\pBut it will even-\ntually grow to be\nstrong.\pIt's important to\ntreat POKéMON with\nlove.$"

Crystal_VioletMart_VioletMartCooltrainerMText:
	.string "POKéMON can hold\nitems like POTION\nand ANTIDOTE.\pBut they don't\nappear to know how\pto use manmade\nitems.$"

@ VioletPokecenter1F <= VioletPokecenter1F
Crystal_VioletPokecenter1F_VioletPokecenterElmsAideFavorText:
	.string "{PLAYER}, long\ntime, no see.\pPROF.ELM asked me\nto find you.\pHe has another\nfavor to ask.\pWould you take the\nPOKéMON EGG?$"

Crystal_VioletPokecenter1F_VioletPokecenterElmsAideGiveEggText:
	.string "We discovered that\na POKéMON will not\phatch until it\ngrows in the EGG.\pIt also has to be\nwith other active\nPOKéMON to hatch.\p{PLAYER}, you're\nthe only person\nwe can rely on.\pPlease call PROF.\nELM when that EGG\nhatches!$"

Crystal_VioletPokecenter1F_VioletCityElmsAideFullPartyText:
	.string "Oh, no. You can't\ncarry any more\nPOKéMON with you.\pI'll wait here\nwhile you make\nroom for the EGG.$"

Crystal_VioletPokecenter1F_VioletPokecenterElmsAideRefuseText:
	.string "B-but… PROF.ELM\nasked for you…$"

Crystal_VioletPokecenter1F_VioletPokecenterElmsAideAskEggText:
	.string "{PLAYER}, will you\ntake the EGG?$"

Crystal_VioletPokecenter1F_VioletPokecenterFarawayLinkText:
	.string "I've been thinking\nit'd be great to\pbe able to link up\nand battle with my\pfriends who live\nfar away.$"

Crystal_VioletPokecenter1F_VioletPokecenterMobileAdapterText:
	.string "I just battled a\nfriend in CIANWOOD\nover a link.\pIf you connect a\nMOBILE ADAPTER,\pyou can link with\na friend far away.$"

Crystal_VioletPokecenter1F_VioletPokecenter1FGameboyKidText:
	.string "A guy named BILL\nmade the POKéMON\nPC storage system.$"

Crystal_VioletPokecenter1F_VioletPokecenter1FGentlemanText:
	.string "It was around\nthree years ago.\pTEAM ROCKET was up\nto no good with\nPOKéMON.\pBut justice pre-\nvailed--a young\nkid broke 'em up.$"

Crystal_VioletPokecenter1F_VioletPokecenter1FYoungsterText:
	.string "POKéMON are smart.\nThey won't obey a\ptrainer they don't\nrespect.\pWithout the right\nGYM BADGES, they\pwill just do as\nthey please.$"

