@ VioletKylesHouse <= VioletKylesHouse
Crystal_VioletKylesHouse_VioletKylesHousePokefanMText:
	.string "A POKéMON you get\nin a trade grows\nquickly.\pBut if you don't\nhave the right GYM\pBADGE, they may\ndisobey you.$"

@ VioletNicknameSpeechHouse <= VioletNicknameSpeechHouse
Crystal_VioletNicknameSpeechHouse_VioletNicknameSpeechHouseTeacherText:
	.string "She uses the names\nof her favorite\nthings to eat.\pFor the nicknames\nshe gives to her\nPOKéMON, I mean.$"

Crystal_VioletNicknameSpeechHouse_VioletNicknameSpeechHouseLassText:
	.string "I call my PIDGEY\nSTRAWBERRY!$"

Crystal_VioletNicknameSpeechHouse_VioletNicknameSpeechHouseBirdText:
	.string "STRAWBERRY: Pijji!$"

@ VioletGym <= VioletGym
Crystal_VioletGym_FalknerIntroText:
	.string "I'm FALKNER, the\nVIOLET POKéMON GYM\nleader!\pPeople say you can\nclip flying-type\pPOKéMON's wings\nwith a jolt of\nelectricity…\pI won't allow such\ninsults to bird\nPOKéMON!\pI'll show you the\nreal power of the\pmagnificent bird\nPOKéMON!$"

Crystal_VioletGym_FalknerWinLossText:
	.string "…Darn! My dad's\ncherished bird\nPOKéMON…\pAll right.\nTake this.\pIt's the official\nPOKéMON LEAGUE\nZEPHYRBADGE.$"

Crystal_VioletGym_ReceivedZephyrBadgeText:
	.string "{PLAYER} received\nZEPHYRBADGE.$"

Crystal_VioletGym_FalknerZephyrBadgeText:
	.string "ZEPHYRBADGE\nraises the attack\npower of POKéMON.\pIt also enables\nPOKéMON to use\pFLASH, if they\nhave it, anytime.\pHere--take this\ntoo.$"

Crystal_VioletGym_FalknerTMMudSlapText:
	.string "By using a TM, a\nPOKéMON will\pinstantly learn a\nnew move.\pThink before you\nact--a TM can be\nused only once.\pTM31 contains\nMUD-SLAP.\pIt reduces the\nenemy's accuracy\pwhile it causes\ndamage.\pIn other words, it\nis both defensive\nand offensive.$"

Crystal_VioletGym_FalknerFightDoneText:
	.string "There are POKéMON\nGYMS in cities and\ntowns ahead.\pYou should test\nyour skills at\nthese GYMS.\pI'm going to train\nharder to become\pthe greatest bird\nmaster!$"

Crystal_VioletGym_BirdKeeperRodSeenText:
	.string "The keyword is\nguts!\pThose here are\ntraining night and\pday to become bird\nPOKéMON masters.\pCome on!$"

Crystal_VioletGym_BirdKeeperRodBeatenText:
	.string "Gaaah!$"

Crystal_VioletGym_BirdKeeperRodAfterBattleText:
	.string "FALKNER's skills\nare for real!\pDon't get cocky\njust because you\nbeat me!$"

Crystal_VioletGym_BirdKeeperAbeSeenText:
	.string "Let me see if you\nare good enough to\nface FALKNER!$"

Crystal_VioletGym_BirdKeeperAbeBeatenText:
	.string "This can't be\ntrue!$"

Crystal_VioletGym_BirdKeeperAbeAfterBattleText:
	.string "This is pathetic,\nlosing to some\nrookie trainer…$"

Crystal_VioletGym_VioletGymGuideText:
	.string "Hey! I'm no train-\ner but I can give\nsome advice!\pBelieve me!\nIf you believe, a\pchampionship dream\ncan come true.\pYou believe?\nThen listen.\pThe grass-type is\nweak against the\pflying-type. Keep\nthis in mind.$"

Crystal_VioletGym_VioletGymGuideWinText:
	.string "Nice battle! Keep\nit up, and you'll\pbe the CHAMP in no\ntime at all!$"

@ SproutTower1F <= SproutTower1F
Crystal_SproutTower1F_SageChowSeenText:
	.string "We stand guard in\nthis tower.\pHere, we express\nour gratitude to\nhonor all POKéMON.$"

Crystal_SproutTower1F_SageChowBeatenText:
	.string "Th-Thank you!$"

Crystal_SproutTower1F_SageChowAfterBattleText:
	.string "All living beings\ncoexist through\ncooperation.\pWe must always be\nthankful for this.$"

Crystal_SproutTower1F_SproutTower1FSage1Text:
	.string "Only if you reach\nthe top will you\nobtain an HM.$"

Crystal_SproutTower1F_SproutTower1FSage2Text:
	.string "SPROUT TOWER was\nbuilt long ago\pas a place for\nPOKéMON training.$"

Crystal_SproutTower1F_SproutTower1FGrannyText:
	.string "A BELLSPROUT over\n100 feet tall…\pPeople say that it\nbecame the center\npillar here.$"

Crystal_SproutTower1F_SproutTower1FTeacherText:
	.string "See the pillar\nshaking?\pPeople are train-\ning upstairs.$"

Crystal_SproutTower1F_SproutTower1FStatueText:
	.string "A POKéMON statue…\pIt looks very\ndistinguished.$"

@ SproutTower2F <= SproutTower2F
Crystal_SproutTower2F_SageNicoSeenText:
	.string "However hard we\nbattle, the TOWER\nwill stand strong.$"

Crystal_SproutTower2F_SageNicoBeatenText:
	.string "I fought hard but\nI'm too weak.$"

Crystal_SproutTower2F_SageNicoAfterBattleText:
	.string "The flexible pil-\nlar protects the\pTOWER, even from\nearthquakes.$"

Crystal_SproutTower2F_SageEdmondSeenText:
	.string "…Sway like leaves\nin the wind…$"

Crystal_SproutTower2F_SageEdmondBeatenText:
	.string "Oh, I'm weak!$"

Crystal_SproutTower2F_SageEdmondAfterBattleText:
	.string "I tried to copy\nBELLSPROUT's\pgentle movements\nfor battle…\pBut I didn't train\nwell enough.$"

Crystal_SproutTower2F_SproutTower2FStatueText:
	.string "A POKéMON statue…\pIt looks very\ndistinguished.$"

@ SproutTower3F <= SproutTower3F
Crystal_SproutTower3F_SproutTowerElderLecturesRivalText:
	.string "ELDER: You are in-\ndeed skilled as a\ntrainer.\pAs promised, here\nis your HM.\pBut let me say\nthis: You should\ptreat your\nPOKéMON better.\pThe way you battle\nis far too harsh.\pPOKéMON are not\ntools of war…$"

Crystal_SproutTower3F_SproutTowerRivalOnlyCareAboutStrongText:
	.string "…\n…Humph!\pHe claims to be\nthe ELDER but\nhe's weak.\pIt stands to\nreason.\pI'd never lose to\nfools who babble\pabout being nice\nto POKéMON.\pI only care about\nstrong POKéMON\nthat can win.\pI really couldn't\ncare less about\nweak POKéMON.$"

Crystal_SproutTower3F_SproutTowerRivalUsedEscapeRopeText:
	.string "<RIVAL> used an\nESCAPE ROPE!$"

Crystal_SproutTower3F_SageLiSeenText:
	.string "So good of you to\ncome here!\pSPROUT TOWER is a\nplace of training.\pPeople and POKéMON\ntest their bonds\pto build a bright\nfuture together.\pI am the final\ntest.\pAllow me to check\nthe ties between\pyour POKéMON and\nyou!$"

Crystal_SproutTower3F_SageLiBeatenText:
	.string "Ah, excellent!$"

Crystal_SproutTower3F_SageLiTakeThisFlashText:
	.string "You and your POKé-\nMON should have\pno problem using\nthis move.\pTake this FLASH\nHM.$"

Crystal_SproutTower3F_SageLiFlashExplanationText:
	.string "FLASH illuminates\neven the darkest\nof all places.\pBut to use it out\nof battle, you\pneed the BADGE\nfrom VIOLET's GYM.$"

Crystal_SproutTower3F_SageLiAfterBattleText:
	.string "I hope you learn\nand grow from your\njourney.$"

Crystal_SproutTower3F_SageJinSeenText:
	.string "I train to find\nenlightenment in\nPOKéMON!$"

Crystal_SproutTower3F_SageJinBeatenText:
	.string "My training is\nincomplete…$"

Crystal_SproutTower3F_SageJinAfterBattleText:
	.string "As POKéMON grow\nstronger, so does\nthe trainer.\pNo, wait. As the\ntrainer grows\pstronger, so do\nthe POKéMON.$"

Crystal_SproutTower3F_SageTroySeenText:
	.string "Let me see how\nmuch you trust\nyour POKéMON.$"

Crystal_SproutTower3F_SageTroyBeatenText:
	.string "Yes, your trust is\nreal!$"

Crystal_SproutTower3F_SageTroyAfterBattleText:
	.string "It is not far to\nthe ELDER.$"

Crystal_SproutTower3F_SageNealSeenText:
	.string "The ELDER's HM\nlights even pitch-\nblack darkness.$"

Crystal_SproutTower3F_SageNealBeatenText:
	.string "It is my head that\nis bright!$"

Crystal_SproutTower3F_SageNealAfterBattleText:
	.string "Let there be light\non your journey.$"

Crystal_SproutTower3F_SproutTower3FPaintingText:
	.string "It's a powerful\npainting of a\nBELLSPROUT.$"

Crystal_SproutTower3F_SproutTower3FStatueText:
	.string "A POKéMON statue…\pIt looks very\ndistinguished.$"

