@ Route32 <= Route32
Crystal_Route32_Route32CooltrainerMText_WhatsTheHurry:
	.string "Wait up!\nWhat's the hurry?$"

Crystal_Route32_Route32CooltrainerMText_AideIsWaiting:
	.string "{PLAYER}, right?\nSome guy wearing\pglasses was look-\ning for you.\pSee for yourself.\nHe's waiting for\pyou at the POKéMON\nCENTER.$"

Crystal_Route32_Route32CooltrainerMText_UnusedSproutTower:
	.string "Have you gone to\nSPROUT TOWER?\pIf you ever visit\nVIOLET CITY, \pthey'll expect you\nto train there.\pThat's basic for\ntrainers. Go to\nSPROUT TOWER!$"

Crystal_Route32_Route32CooltrainerMText_VioletGym:
	.string "Have you gone to\nthe POKéMON GYM?\pYou can test your\nPOKéMON and your-\nself there.\pIt's a rite of\npassage for all\ntrainers!$"

Crystal_Route32_Route32CooltrainerMText_HaveThisSeed:
	.string "You have some good\nPOKéMON there.\pIt must be from\nthe training you\pgave them around\nVIOLET CITY.\pThe training at\nthe GYM must have\pbeen especially\nhelpful.\pAs a souvenir of\nVIOLET CITY, take\nthis.\pIt increases the\npower of grass-\ntype moves.$"

Crystal_Route32_Route32CooltrainerMText_ExperiencesShouldBeUseful:
	.string "Your experiences\nin VIOLET CITY\pshould be useful\nfor your journey.$"

Crystal_Route32_Text_MillionDollarSlowpokeTail:
	.string "How would you like\nto have this\ptasty, nutritious\nSLOWPOKETAIL?\pFor you right now,\njust ¥1,000,000!\pYou'll want this!$"

Crystal_Route32_Text_ThoughtKidsWereLoaded:
	.string "Tch! I thought\nkids these days\nwere loaded…$"

Crystal_Route32_Text_RefusedToBuySlowpokeTail:
	.string "You don't want it?\nThen scram. Shoo!$"

Crystal_Route32_FisherJustinSeenText:
	.string "Whoa!\pYou made me lose\nthat fish!$"

Crystal_Route32_FisherJustinBeatenText:
	.string "Sploosh!$"

Crystal_Route32_FisherJustinAfterText:
	.string "Calm, collected…\nThe essence of\pfishing and POKé-\nMON is the same.$"

Crystal_Route32_FisherRalph1SeenText:
	.string "I'm really good at\nboth fishing and\nPOKéMON.\pI'm not about to\nlose to any kid!$"

Crystal_Route32_FisherRalph1BeatenText:
	.string "Tch! I tried to\nrush things…$"

Crystal_Route32_FisherRalphAfterText:
	.string "Fishing is a life-\nlong passion.\pPOKéMON are life-\nlong friends!$"

Crystal_Route32_FisherRalphSwarmText:
	.string "One, two, three…\nMuahahaha, what a\pgreat haul!\nI'm done! Go ahead\pand catch as many\nas you can, kid!$"

Crystal_Route32_Route32UnusedFisher1SeenText:
	.string "I keep catching\nthe same POKéMON…\pMaybe a battle\nwill turn things\naround for me.$"

Crystal_Route32_Route32UnusedFisher1BeatenText:
	.string "Nothing ever goes\nright for me now…$"

Crystal_Route32_Route32UnusedFisher1AfterText:
	.string "How come the guy\nnext to me catches\ngood POKéMON?$"

Crystal_Route32_Route32UnusedFisher2SeenText:
	.string "Heh, I'm on a roll\ntoday. How about a\nbattle, kid?$"

Crystal_Route32_Route32UnusedFisher2BeatenText:
	.string "Oof. I wasn't\nlucky that time.$"

Crystal_Route32_Route32UnusedFisher2AfterText:
	.string "You have to have a\ngood ROD if you\pwant to catch good\nPOKéMON.$"

Crystal_Route32_FisherHenrySeenText:
	.string "My POKéMON?\nFreshly caught!$"

Crystal_Route32_FisherHenryBeatenText:
	.string "SPLASH?$"

Crystal_Route32_FisherHenryAfterText:
	.string "Freshly caught\nPOKéMON are no\pmatch for properly\nraised ones.$"

Crystal_Route32_YoungsterAlbertSeenText:
	.string "I haven't seen you\naround before.\pSo you think you\nare pretty tough?$"

Crystal_Route32_YoungsterAlbertBeatenText:
	.string "You're strong!$"

Crystal_Route32_YoungsterAlbertAfterText:
	.string "I'm going to try\nto be the best\nwith my favorites.\pI'm not using the\nsame tough POKéMON\nas everyone else.$"

Crystal_Route32_YoungsterGordonSeenText:
	.string "I found some good\nPOKéMON in the\ngrass!\pI think they'll do\nit for me!$"

Crystal_Route32_YoungsterGordonBeatenText:
	.string "Darn. I thought I\ncould win.$"

Crystal_Route32_YoungsterGordonAfterText:
	.string "The grass is full\nof clingy things.$"

Crystal_Route32_CamperRolandSeenText:
	.string "That glance…\nIt's intriguing.$"

Crystal_Route32_CamperRolandBeatenText:
	.string "Hmmm. This is\ndisappointing.$"

Crystal_Route32_CamperRolandAfterText:
	.string "If you don't want\nto battle, just\navoid eye contact.$"

Crystal_Route32_PicnickerLiz1SeenText:
	.string "Uh-huh. Yeah, and\nyou know…\pPardon? Battle?\nI'm on the phone.\pOh, all right. But\nmake it fast.$"

Crystal_Route32_PicnickerLiz1BeatenText:
	.string "Oh! I've got to\nrelieve my anger!$"

Crystal_Route32_PicnickerLiz1AfterText:
	.string "I was having a\nnice chat too.$"

Crystal_Route32_BirdKeeperPeterSeenText:
	.string "That BADGE! It's\nfrom VIOLET CITY!\pYou beat FALKNER?$"

Crystal_Route32_BirdKeeperPeterBeatenText:
	.string "I know what my\nweaknesses are.$"

Crystal_Route32_BirdKeeperPeterAfterText:
	.string "I should train\nagain at the GYM\nin VIOLET CITY.$"

Crystal_Route32_Route32UnusedText:
	.string "The fishermen\nyelled at me for\nbugging them…$"

Crystal_Route32_Text_RoarIntro:
	.string "WROOOOAR!\nPEOPLE RUN WHEN I\pROAR! BUT YOU\nCAME LOOKING!\pTHAT PLEASES ME!\nNOW TAKE THIS!$"

Crystal_Route32_Text_RoarOutro:
	.string "WROOOAR!\nIT'S ROAR!\pEVEN POKéMON RUN\nFROM A GOOD ROAR!$"

Crystal_Route32_MeetFriedaText:
	.string "FRIEDA: Yahoo!\nIt's Friday!\pI'm FRIEDA of\nFriday!\pNice to meet you!$"

Crystal_Route32_FriedaGivesGiftText:
	.string "Here's a POISON\nBARB for you!$"

Crystal_Route32_FriedaGaveGiftText:
	.string "FRIEDA: Give it to\na POKéMON that has\npoison-type moves.\pOh!\pIt's wicked!\pYou'll be shocked\nhow good it makes\npoison moves!$"

Crystal_Route32_FriedaFridayText:
	.string "FRIEDA: Hiya! What\nday do you like?\pI love Friday. No\ndoubt about it!\pDon't you think\nit's great too?$"

Crystal_Route32_FriedaNotFridayText:
	.string "FRIEDA: Isn't it\nFriday today?\pIt's so boring\nwhen it's not!$"

Crystal_Route32_Route32SignText:
	.string "ROUTE 32\pVIOLET CITY -\nAZALEA TOWN$"

Crystal_Route32_Route32RuinsSignText:
	.string "RUINS OF ALPH\nEAST ENTRANCE$"

Crystal_Route32_Route32UnionCaveSignText:
	.string "UNION CAVE\nAHEAD$"

