@ Route32Pokecenter1F <= Route32Pokecenter1F
Crystal_Route32Pokecenter1F_Route32Pokecenter1FFishingGuruText_Question:
	.string "This is a great\nfishing spot.\pYou saw people\nfishing? How\nabout you?\pWould you like one\nof my RODS?$"

Crystal_Route32Pokecenter1F_Route32Pokecenter1FFishingGuruText_Yes:
	.string "Heh, that's good\nto hear.\pNow you're an\nangler too!$"

Crystal_Route32Pokecenter1F_Route32Pokecenter1FFishingGuruText_GiveOldRod:
	.string "Fishing is great!\pIf there's water,\nbe it the sea or a\pstream, try out\nyour ROD.$"

Crystal_Route32Pokecenter1F_Route32Pokecenter1FFishingGuruText_No:
	.string "Oh. That's rather\ndisappointing…$"

Crystal_Route32Pokecenter1F_Route32Pokecenter1FFishingGuruText_After:
	.string "Yo, kid. How are\nthey biting?$"

Crystal_Route32Pokecenter1F_Route32Pokecenter1FCooltrainerFText:
	.string "What should I make\nmy POKéMON hold?\pMaybe an item that\nincreases ATTACK\npower…$"

@ Route32RuinsOfAlphGate <= Route32RuinsOfAlphGate
Crystal_Route32RuinsOfAlphGate_Route32RuinsOfAlphGateOfficerText:
	.string "RUINS OF ALPH\pA Look-and-Touch\nTourist Site\pTry the sliding\nstone panels!$"

Crystal_Route32RuinsOfAlphGate_Route32RuinsOfAlphGatePokefanMText:
	.string "You're studying\nthe RUINS?\pI see a scientist\nin the making.$"

Crystal_Route32RuinsOfAlphGate_Route32RuinsOfAlphGateYoungsterText:
	.string "There are drawings\non stone panels.\pI tried moving\nthem. I wonder\nwhat they are.$"

@ UnionCave1F <= UnionCave1F
Crystal_UnionCave1F_HikerRussellSeenText:
	.string "You're headed to\nAZALEA, are you?\pLet my POKéMON see\nif you are good\nenough to battle.$"

Crystal_UnionCave1F_HikerRussellBeatenText:
	.string "Oh, oh, oh!$"

Crystal_UnionCave1F_HikerRussellAfterBattleText:
	.string "All right, then!\nI've decided.\pI'm not leaving\nuntil my POKéMON\nget tougher!$"

Crystal_UnionCave1F_PokemaniacLarrySeenText:
	.string "I roam far and\nwide in search of\nPOKéMON.\pAre you looking\nfor POKéMON too?\pThen you're my\ncollecting rival!$"

Crystal_UnionCave1F_PokemaniacLarryBeatenText:
	.string "Ugh. My poor POKé-\nMON…$"

Crystal_UnionCave1F_PokemaniacLarryAfterBattleText:
	.string "Every Friday, you\ncan hear POKéMON\proars from deep\ninside the cave.$"

Crystal_UnionCave1F_HikerDanielSeenText:
	.string "Whoa! What a\nsurprise!\pI didn't expect to\nsee anyone here!$"

Crystal_UnionCave1F_HikerDanielBeatenText:
	.string "Whoa! I'm beaten\nbig time!$"

Crystal_UnionCave1F_HikerDanielAfterBattleText:
	.string "I was conned into\nbuying a SLOWPOKE-\nTAIL.\pI feel sorry for\nthe poor POKéMON.$"

Crystal_UnionCave1F_FirebreatherBillSeenText:
	.string "ZUBAT's SUPERSONIC\nkeeps confusing\nmy POKéMON.\pI'm seriously\nupset about that!$"

Crystal_UnionCave1F_FirebreatherBillBeatenText:
	.string "I flamed out!$"

Crystal_UnionCave1F_FirebreatherBillAfterBattleText:
	.string "On weekends, you\ncan hear strange\proars from deep in\nthe cave.$"

Crystal_UnionCave1F_FirebreatherRaySeenText:
	.string "If it's light, a\ncave isn't scary.\pIf you're strong,\nPOKéMON aren't\nscary.$"

Crystal_UnionCave1F_FirebreatherRayBeatenText:
	.string "FLASH!$"

Crystal_UnionCave1F_FirebreatherRayAfterBattleText:
	.string "It's my POKéMON's\nfire that lights\nup this cave.$"

Crystal_UnionCave1F_UnionCave1FUnusedSignText:
	.string "UNION CAVE$"

@ UnionCaveB1F <= UnionCaveB1F
Crystal_UnionCaveB1F_HikerPhillipSeenText:
	.string "It's been a while\nsince I last saw\nanother person.\pDon't be shy.\nLet's battle!$"

Crystal_UnionCaveB1F_HikerPhillipBeatenText:
	.string "Uurggh…$"

Crystal_UnionCaveB1F_HikerPhillipAfterBattleText:
	.string "I've been lost for\na long time…\pI don't mind it\nhere, but I am\nsoooo hungry!$"

Crystal_UnionCaveB1F_HikerLeonardSeenText:
	.string "What do you know!\nA visitor!$"

Crystal_UnionCaveB1F_HikerLeonardBeatenText:
	.string "Wahahah! You're a\nfeisty one!$"

Crystal_UnionCaveB1F_HikerLeonardAfterBattleText:
	.string "I live down here.\pYou can, too, if\nyou'd like.\pThere's plenty of\nroom, you see.$"

Crystal_UnionCaveB1F_PokemaniacAndrewSeenText:
	.string "Who's there?\pLeave me and my\nPOKéMON alone!$"

Crystal_UnionCaveB1F_PokemaniacAndrewBeatenText:
	.string "Go…\nGo away!$"

Crystal_UnionCaveB1F_PokemaniacAndrewAfterBattleText:
	.string "Just me and my\nPOKéMON. I'm de-\nlirious with joy.$"

Crystal_UnionCaveB1F_PokemaniacCalvinSeenText:
	.string "I came all the way\nhere to conduct my\nPOKéMON research.\pLet me demonstrate\nmy findings in a\nreal battle!$"

Crystal_UnionCaveB1F_PokemaniacCalvinBeatenText:
	.string "You demonstrated\non me!$"

Crystal_UnionCaveB1F_PokemaniacCalvinAfterBattleText:
	.string "I should compile\nand announce my\nstudy findings.\pI might even be-\ncome famous like\nPROF.ELM.$"

@ UnionCaveB2F <= UnionCaveB2F
Crystal_UnionCaveB2F_CooltrainermNickSeenText:
	.string "There are two\nkinds of people.\pThose who have\nstyle, and those\nwho don't.\pWhat kind of\nperson are you?$"

Crystal_UnionCaveB2F_CooltrainermNickBeatenText:
	.string "You've got\ndazzling style!$"

Crystal_UnionCaveB2F_CooltrainermNickAfterBattleText:
	.string "Your POKéMON style\nis stunning and\ncolorful, I admit.\pYou'll just keep\ngetting better!$"

Crystal_UnionCaveB2F_CooltrainerfGwenSeenText:
	.string "I'm in training.\nCare for a round?$"

Crystal_UnionCaveB2F_CooltrainerfGwenBeatenText:
	.string "Aww, no! You're\ntoo good for me.$"

Crystal_UnionCaveB2F_CooltrainerfGwenAfterBattleText:
	.string "I'm going to train\nby myself until I\nimprove.$"

Crystal_UnionCaveB2F_CooltrainerfEmmaSeenText:
	.string "If the POKéMON I\nliked were there,\nI'd go anywhere.\pThat's what a real\ntrainer does.$"

Crystal_UnionCaveB2F_CooltrainerfEmmaBeatenText:
	.string "I'd rather pet my\nbabies than this!$"

Crystal_UnionCaveB2F_CooltrainerfEmmaAfterBattleText:
	.string "Just once a week,\na POKéMON comes to\nthe water's edge.\pI wanted to see\nthat POKéMON…$"

@ Route33 <= Route33
Crystal_Route33_HikerAnthony2SeenText:
	.string "I came through the\ntunnel, but I\pstill have plenty\nof energy left.$"

Crystal_Route33_HikerAnthony2BeatenText:
	.string "Whoa! You've got\nmore zip than me!$"

Crystal_Route33_HikerAnthony2AfterText:
	.string "We HIKERS are at\nour best in the\nmountains.$"

Crystal_Route33_HikerAnthonyDunsparceText:
	.string "Hey, did you get a\nDUNSPARCE?\pI caught one too.\pTake a look at it\nin the light. It's\ngot a funny face!$"

Crystal_Route33_Route33LassText:
	.string "Pant, pant…\pI finally got\nthrough that cave.\pIt was much bigger\nthan I'd expected.\pI got too tired to\nexplore the whole\pthing, so I came\noutside.$"

Crystal_Route33_Route33SignText:
	.string "ROUTE 33$"

@ AzaleaTown <= AzaleaTown
Crystal_AzaleaTown_AzaleaTownRivalBeforeText:
	.string "…Tell me some-\nthing.\pIs it true that\nTEAM ROCKET has\nreturned?\pWhat? You beat\nthem? Hah! Quit\nlying.\pYou're not joking?\nThen let's see how\ngood you are.$"

Crystal_AzaleaTown_AzaleaTownRivalWinText:
	.string "… Humph! Useless\nPOKéMON!\pListen, you. You\nonly won because\pmy POKéMON were\nweak.$"

Crystal_AzaleaTown_AzaleaTownRivalAfterText:
	.string "I hate the weak.\pPOKéMON, trainers.\nIt doesn't matter\nwho or what.\pI'm going to be\nstrong and wipe\nout the weak.\pThat goes for TEAM\nROCKET too.\pThey act big and\ntough in a group.\pBut get them\nalone, and they're\nweak.\pI hate them all.\pYou stay out of my\nway. A weakling\plike you is only a\ndistraction.$"

Crystal_AzaleaTown_AzaleaTownRivalLossText:
	.string "…Humph! I knew\nyou were lying.$"

Crystal_AzaleaTown_AzaleaTownRocket1Text:
	.string "It's unsafe to go\nin there, so I'm\nstanding guard.\pAren't I a good\nSamaritan?$"

Crystal_AzaleaTown_AzaleaTownRocket2Text:
	.string "Do you know about\nSLOWPOKETAIL? I\nheard it's tasty!\pAren't you glad I\ntold you that?$"

Crystal_AzaleaTown_AzaleaTownGrampsTextBefore:
	.string "The SLOWPOKE have\ndisappeared from\ntown…\pI heard their\nTAILS are being\nsold somewhere.$"

Crystal_AzaleaTown_AzaleaTownGrampsTextAfter:
	.string "The SLOWPOKE have\nreturned.\pKnowing them, they\ncould've just been\pgoofing off some-\nwhere.$"

Crystal_AzaleaTown_AzaleaTownTeacherText:
	.string "Did you come to\nget KURT to make\nsome BALLS?\pA lot of people do\njust that.$"

Crystal_AzaleaTown_AzaleaTownYoungsterText:
	.string "Cut through AZALEA\nand you'll be in\nILEX FOREST.\pBut these skinny\ntrees make it\pimpossible to get\nthrough.\pThe CHARCOAL MAN's\nPOKéMON can CUT\ndown trees.$"

Crystal_AzaleaTown_AzaleaTownSlowpokeText1:
	.string "SLOWPOKE: …\p<……> <……> <……>$"

Crystal_AzaleaTown_AzaleaTownSlowpokeText2:
	.string "<……> <……>Yawn?$"

Crystal_AzaleaTown_WoosterText:
	.string "WOOSTER: Gugyoo…$"

Crystal_AzaleaTown_AzaleaTownKurtText1:
	.string "ILEX FOREST is\nrestless!\pWhat is going on?$"

Crystal_AzaleaTown_AzaleaTownKurtText2:
	.string "{PLAYER}, here's\nyour GS BALL back!$"

Crystal_AzaleaTown_AzaleaTownKurtText3:
	.string "Could you go see\nwhy ILEX FOREST is\nso restless?$"

Crystal_AzaleaTown_AzaleaTownSignText:
	.string "AZALEA TOWN\nWhere People and\pPOKéMON Live in\nHappy Harmony$"

Crystal_AzaleaTown_KurtsHouseSignText:
	.string "KURT'S HOUSE$"

Crystal_AzaleaTown_AzaleaGymSignText:
	.string "AZALEA TOWN\nPOKéMON GYM\nLEADER: BUGSY\pThe Walking\nBug POKéMON\nEncyclopedia$"

Crystal_AzaleaTown_SlowpokeWellSignText:
	.string "SLOWPOKE WELL\pAlso known as the\nRAINMAKER WELL.\pLocals believe\nthat a SLOWPOKE's\nyawn summons rain.\pRecords show that\na SLOWPOKE's yawn\pended a drought\n400 years ago.$"

Crystal_AzaleaTown_CharcoalKilnSignText:
	.string "CHARCOAL KILN$"

Crystal_AzaleaTown_AzaleaTownIlexForestSignText:
	.string "ILEX FOREST\pEnter through the\ngate.$"

