@ AzaleaPokecenter1F <= AzaleaPokecenter1F
Crystal_AzaleaPokecenter1F_AzaleaPokecenter1FGentlemanText:
	.string "Do your POKéMON\nknow HM moves?\pThose moves can\nbe used even if\pyour POKéMON has\nfainted.$"

Crystal_AzaleaPokecenter1F_AzaleaPokecenter1FUnusedText:
	.string "This BILL guy\ncreated the system\pfor storing\nPOKéMON in a PC.\pBILL's PC can\nstore up to 20\nPOKéMON per BOX.$"

Crystal_AzaleaPokecenter1F_AzaleaPokecenter1FFishingGuruText:
	.string "BILL's PC can\nstore up to 20\nPOKéMON per BOX.$"

Crystal_AzaleaPokecenter1F_AzaleaPokecenter1FPokefanFText:
	.string "Do you know about\nAPRICORNS?\pCrack one open,\nhollow it out and\pfit it with a\nspecial device.\pThen you can catch\nPOKéMON with it.\pBefore POKé BALLS\nwere invented,\peveryone used\nAPRICORNS.$"

@ AzaleaMart <= AzaleaMart
Crystal_AzaleaMart_AzaleaMartCooltrainerMText:
	.string "There's no GREAT\nBALL here. POKé\pBALLS will have\nto do.\pI wish KURT would\nmake me some of\nhis custom BALLS.$"

Crystal_AzaleaMart_AzaleaMartBugCatcherText:
	.string "A GREAT BALL is\nbetter for catch-\ning POKéMON than a\nPOKé BALL.\pBut KURT's might\nbe better some-\ntimes.$"

@ AzaleaGym <= AzaleaGym
Crystal_AzaleaGym_BugsyText_INeverLose:
	.string "I'm BUGSY!\nI never lose when\pit comes to bug\nPOKéMON.\pMy research is\ngoing to make me\pthe authority on\nbug POKéMON!\pLet me demonstrate\nwhat I've learned\nfrom my studies.$"

Crystal_AzaleaGym_BugsyText_ResearchIncomplete:
	.string "Whoa, amazing!\nYou're an expert\non POKéMON!\pMy research isn't\ncomplete yet.\pOK, you win. Take\nthis BADGE.$"

Crystal_AzaleaGym_Text_ReceivedHiveBadge:
	.string "{PLAYER} received\nHIVEBADGE.$"

Crystal_AzaleaGym_BugsyText_HiveBadgeSpeech:
	.string "Do you know the\nbenefits of HIVE-\nBADGE?\pIf you have it,\nPOKéMON up to L30\pwill obey you,\neven traded ones.\pPOKéMON that know\nCUT will be able\pto use it outside\nof battle too.\pHere, I also want\nyou to have this.$"

Crystal_AzaleaGym_BugsyText_FuryCutterSpeech:
	.string "TM49 contains\nFURY CUTTER.\pIf you don't miss,\nit gets stronger\nevery turn.\pThe longer your\nbattle goes, the\nbetter it gets.\pIsn't that great?\nI discovered it!$"

Crystal_AzaleaGym_BugsyText_BugMonsAreDeep:
	.string "Bug POKéMON are\ndeep. There are\pmany mysteries to\nbe explored.\pStudy your favor-\nites thoroughly.$"

Crystal_AzaleaGym_BugCatcherBennySeenText:
	.string "Bug POKéMON evolve\nyoung. So they get\pstronger that much\nfaster.$"

Crystal_AzaleaGym_BugCatcherBennyBeatenText:
	.string "Just evolving\nisn't enough!$"

Crystal_AzaleaGym_BugCatcherBennyAfterBattleText:
	.string "POKéMON become\nstronger if they\nevolve. Really!$"

Crystal_AzaleaGym_BugCatcherAlSeenText:
	.string "Bug POKéMON are\ncool and tough!\pI'll prove it to\nyou!$"

Crystal_AzaleaGym_BugCatcherAlBeatenText:
	.string "You proved how\ntough you are…$"

Crystal_AzaleaGym_BugCatcherAlAfterBattleText:
	.string "They're so cool,\nbut most girls\pdon't like bug\nPOKéMON.\pI don't know why…$"

Crystal_AzaleaGym_BugCatcherJoshSeenText:
	.string "You saved all the\nSLOWPOKE? Whew,\nyou're mighty!\pBut my grown-up\nPOKéMON are pretty\ntough too!$"

Crystal_AzaleaGym_BugCatcherJoshBeatenText:
	.string "Urrgggh!$"

Crystal_AzaleaGym_BugCatcherJoshAfterBattleText:
	.string "I guess I should\nteach them better\nmoves…$"

Crystal_AzaleaGym_TwinsAmyandmay1SeenText:
	.string "AMY: Hi! Are you\nchallenging the\nLEADER? No way!$"

Crystal_AzaleaGym_TwinsAmyandmay1BeatenText:
	.string "AMY & MAY: Oh,\ndouble goodness!$"

Crystal_AzaleaGym_TwinsAmyandmay1AfterBattleText:
	.string "AMY: You're\nreally strong!$"

Crystal_AzaleaGym_TwinsAmyandmay2SeenText:
	.string "MAY: You want to\nsee the LEADER?\nWe come first!$"

Crystal_AzaleaGym_TwinsAmyandmay2BeatenText:
	.string "AMY & MAY: Oh,\ndouble goodness!$"

Crystal_AzaleaGym_TwinsAmyandmay2AfterBattleText:
	.string "MAY: Our bug POKé-\nMON lost! Oh, what\na shame.$"

Crystal_AzaleaGym_AzaleaGymGuideText:
	.string "Yo, challenger!\pBUGSY's young, but\nhis knowledge of\pbug POKéMON is for\nreal.\pIt's going to be\ntough without my\nadvice.\pLet's see… Bug\nPOKéMON don't like\nfire.\pFlying-type moves\nare super-effec-\ntive too.$"

Crystal_AzaleaGym_AzaleaGymGuideWinText:
	.string "Well done! That\nwas a great clash\pof talented young\ntrainers.\pWith people like\nyou, the future of\nPOKéMON is bright!$"

@ KurtsHouse <= KurtsHouse
Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsHouseKurtMakingBallsMustWaitText:
	.string "Hm? Who are you?\p{PLAYER}, eh? You\nwant me to make\nsome BALLS?\pSorry, but that'll\nhave to wait.\pDo you know TEAM\nROCKET? Ah, don't\pworry. I'll tell\nyou anyhow.\pTEAM ROCKET's an\nevil gang that\puses POKéMON for\ntheir dirty work.\pThey're supposed\nto have disbanded\nthree years ago.\pAnyway, they're at\nthe WELL, cutting\poff SLOWPOKETAILS\nfor sale!\pSo I'm going to\ngo give them a\nlesson in pain!\pHang on, SLOWPOKE!\nOld KURT is on his\nway!$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsHouseKurtHonoredToMakeBallsText:
	.string "KURT: Hi, {PLAYER}!\pYou handled your-\nself like a real\nhero at the WELL.\pI like your style!\pI would be honored\nto make BALLS for\pa trainer like\nyou.\pThis is all I have\nnow, but take it.$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsHouseKurtBallsFromApricornsText:
	.string "KURT: I make BALLS\nfrom APRICORNS.\pCollect them from\ntrees and bring\n'em to me.\pI'll make BALLS\nout of them.$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsHouseKurtAskYouHaveAnApricornText:
	.string "KURT: You have an\nAPRICORN for me?\pFine! I'll turn it\ninto a BALL.$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsHouseKurtItWillTakeADayText:
	.string "KURT: It'll take a\nday to make you a\pBALL. Come back\nfor it later.$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsHouseKurtThatsALetdownText:
	.string "KURT: Oh…\nThat's a letdown.$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsHouseKurtDontBotherMeText:
	.string "KURT: I'm working!\nDon't bother me!$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsHouseKurtJustFinishedYourBallText:
	.string "KURT: Ah, {PLAYER}!\nI just finished\nyour BALL. Here!$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsHouseKurtTurnedOutGreatText:
	.string "KURT: That turned\nout great.\pTry catching\nPOKéMON with it.$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsHouseKurtGranddaughterHelpingWorkFasterText:
	.string "KURT: Now that my\ngranddaughter is\phelping me, I can\nwork much faster.$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsHouseKurtWhatIsThatText:
	.string "Wh-what is that?\pI've never seen\none before.\pIt looks a lot\nlike a POKé BALL,\pbut it appears to\nbe something else.\pLet me check it\nfor you.$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsHouseKurtImCheckingItNowText:
	.string "I'm checking it\nnow.$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsHouseKurtAhHaISeeText:
	.string "Ah-ha! I see!\nSo…$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsHouseKurtThisBallStartedToShakeText:
	.string "{PLAYER}!\pThis BALL started\nto shake while I\nwas checking it.\pThere must be\nsomething to this!$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsGranddaughterSlowpokeGoneText:
	.string "The SLOWPOKE are\ngone… Were they\ptaken away by bad\npeople?$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsGranddaughterLonelyText:
	.string "Grandpa's gone…\nI'm so lonely…$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsGranddaughterSlowpokeBackText:
	.string "The SLOWPOKE my\ndad gave me came\pback! Its TAIL is\ngrowing back too!$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsGranddaughterDadText:
	.string "Dad works at SILPH\nwhere he studies\nPOKé BALLS.\pI have to stay\nhome with Grandpa\nand SLOWPOKE.$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsGranddaughterHelpText:
	.string "I get to help\nGrandpa now!\pWe'll make good\nBALLS for you, so\nplease wait!$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsGranddaughterFunText:
	.string "It's fun to make\nBALLS!$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsGranddaughterGSBallText:
	.string "Grandpa's checking\na BALL right now.\pSo I'm waiting\ntill he's done.$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsHouseSlowpokeText:
	.string "SLOWPOKE: …\nYawn?$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsHouseOakPhotoText:
	.string "…A young PROF.\nOAK?$"

Crystal_KurtsHouse_KurtsHouseCelebiStatueText:
	.string "It's a statue of\nthe forest's pro-\ntector.$"

