@ SlowpokeWellB1F <= SlowpokeWellB1F
Crystal_SlowpokeWellB1F_SlowpokeWellB1FKurtText:
	.string "KURT: Hey there,\n{PLAYER}!\pThe guard up top\ntook off when I\nshouted at him.\pBut then I took a\ntumble down the\nWELL.\pI slammed down\nhard on my back,\nso I can't move.\pRats! If I were\nfit, my POKéMON\pwould've punished\nthem…\pAh, it can't be\nhelped.\p{PLAYER}, show them\nhow gutsy you are\nin my place!$"

Crystal_SlowpokeWellB1F_KurtLeaveSlowpokeWellText:
	.string "KURT: Way to go,\n{PLAYER}!\pTEAM ROCKET has\ntaken off.\pMy back's better\ntoo. Let's get out\nof here.$"

Crystal_SlowpokeWellB1F_GruntM29SeenText:
	.string "Darn! I was stand-\ning guard up top\pwhen some old coot\nyelled at me.\pHe startled me so\nmuch that I fell\ndown here.\pI think I'll vent\nmy anger by taking\nit out on you!$"

Crystal_SlowpokeWellB1F_GruntM29BeatenText:
	.string "Arrgh! This is NOT\nmy day!$"

Crystal_SlowpokeWellB1F_GruntM29AfterBattleText:
	.string "Sure, we've been\nhacking the tails\poff SLOWPOKE and\nselling them.\pEverything we do\nis for profit.\pThat's right!\nWe're TEAM ROCKET,\pand we'll do any-\nthing for money!$"

Crystal_SlowpokeWellB1F_GruntM1SeenText:
	.string "What do you want?\pIf you interrupt\nour work, don't\nexpect any mercy!$"

Crystal_SlowpokeWellB1F_GruntM1BeatenText:
	.string "You did OK today,\nbut wait till next\ntime!$"

Crystal_SlowpokeWellB1F_TrainerGruntM1WhenTalkText:
	.string "Yeah, TEAM ROCKET\nwas broken up\nthree years ago.\pBut we continued\nour activities\nunderground.\pNow you can have\nfun watching us\nstir up trouble!$"

Crystal_SlowpokeWellB1F_GruntM2SeenText:
	.string "Quit taking SLOW-\nPOKETAILS?\pIf we obeyed you,\nTEAM ROCKET's rep\nwould be ruined!$"

Crystal_SlowpokeWellB1F_GruntM2BeatenText:
	.string "Just…\nToo strong…$"

Crystal_SlowpokeWellB1F_GruntM2AfterBattleText:
	.string "We need the money,\nbut selling SLOW-\nPOKETAILS?\pIt's tough being a\nROCKET GRUNT!$"

Crystal_SlowpokeWellB1F_GruntF1SeenText:
	.string "Stop taking TAILS?\pYeah, just try to\ndefeat all of us!$"

Crystal_SlowpokeWellB1F_GruntF1BeatenText:
	.string "You rotten brat!$"

Crystal_SlowpokeWellB1F_GruntF1AfterBattleText:
	.string "SLOWPOKETAILS\ngrow back fast!\pWhat's wrong with\nselling them?$"

Crystal_SlowpokeWellB1F_SlowpokeWellB1FSlowpokeWithMailText:
	.string "A SLOWPOKE with\nits TAIL cut off…\pHuh? It has MAIL.\nRead it?$"

Crystal_SlowpokeWellB1F_SlowpokeWellB1FSlowpokeMailText:
	.string "{PLAYER} read the\nMAIL.\pBe good and look\nafter the house\pwith Grandpa and\nSLOWPOKE.\pLove, Dad$"

Crystal_SlowpokeWellB1F_SlowpokeWellB1FTaillessSlowpokeText:
	.string "A SLOWPOKE with\nits TAIL cut off…$"

