@ SlowpokeWellB2F <= SlowpokeWellB2F
Crystal_SlowpokeWellB2F_SlowpokeWellB2FGymGuideText:
	.string "I'm waiting to see\nSLOWPOKE's moment\nof evolution.\pThrough observa-\ntion, I made a new\ndiscovery.\pA SLOWPOKE with a\nKING'S ROCK often\pgets bitten by a\nSHELLDER.\pHere, I'll share a\nKING'S ROCK with\nyou.$"

Crystal_SlowpokeWellB2F_SlowpokeWellB2FGymGuideText_GotKingsRock:
	.string "I'm going to be\nlike SLOWPOKE.\pI'll wait patient-\nly, so I can see\none evolve.$"

@ IlexForestAzaleaGate <= IlexForestAzaleaGate
Crystal_IlexForestAzaleaGate_IlexForestAzaleaGateOfficerText:
	.string "ILEX FOREST is\nbig. Be careful!\nDon't get lost.$"

Crystal_IlexForestAzaleaGate_IlexForestAzaleaGateGrannyText:
	.string "The FOREST is\nwatched over by\nits protector.\pStay out of\nmischief!$"

@ IlexForest <= IlexForest
Crystal_IlexForest_IlexForestApprenticeIntroText:
	.string "Oh, man… My boss\nis going to be\nsteaming…\pThe FARFETCH'D\nthat CUTS trees\pfor charcoal took\noff on me.\pI can't go looking\nfor it here in the\nILEX FOREST.\pIt's too big, dark\nand scary for me…$"

Crystal_IlexForest_IlexForestApprenticeAfterText:
	.string "Wow! Thanks a\nwhole bunch!\pMy boss's POKéMON\nwon't obey me be-\ncause I don't have\na BADGE.$"

Crystal_IlexForest_Text_ItsTheMissingPokemon:
	.string "It's the missing\nPOKéMON!$"

Crystal_IlexForest_Text_Kwaaaa:
	.string "FARFETCH'D: Kwaa!$"

Crystal_IlexForest_Text_CharcoalMasterIntro:
	.string "Ah! My FARFETCH'D!\pYou found it for\nus, kid?\pWithout it, we\nwouldn't be able\pto CUT trees for\ncharcoal.\pThanks, kid!\pNow, how can I\nthank you…\pI know! Here, take\nthis.$"

Crystal_IlexForest_Text_CharcoalMasterOutro:
	.string "That's the CUT HM.\nTeach that to a\pPOKéMON to clear\nsmall trees.\pOf course, you\nhave to have the\pGYM BADGE from\nAZALEA to use it.$"

Crystal_IlexForest_Text_CharcoalMasterTalkAfter:
	.string "Do you want to\napprentice as a\pcharcoal maker\nwith me?\pYou'll be first-\nrate in ten years!$"

Crystal_IlexForest_Text_HeadbuttIntro:
	.string "What am I doing?\pI'm shaking trees\nusing HEADBUTT.\pIt's fun. Here,\nyou try it too!$"

Crystal_IlexForest_Text_HeadbuttOutro:
	.string "Rattle trees with\nHEADBUTT. Some-\ntimes, sleeping\nPOKéMON fall out.$"

Crystal_IlexForest_Text_IlexForestLass:
	.string "Did something\nhappen to the\nforest's guardian?$"

Crystal_IlexForest_IlexForestSignpostText:
	.string "ILEX FOREST is\nso overgrown with\ptrees that you\ncan't see the sky.\pPlease watch out\nfor items that may\nhave been dropped.$"

Crystal_IlexForest_Text_IlexForestShrine:
	.string "ILEX FOREST\nSHRINE…\pIt's in honor of\nthe forest's\nprotector…$"

Crystal_IlexForest_Text_ShrineCelebiEvent:
	.string "ILEX FOREST\nSHRINE…\pIt's in honor of\nthe forest's\nprotector…\pOh? What is this?\pIt's a hole.\nIt looks like the\pGS BALL would fit\ninside it.\pWant to put the GS\nBALL here?$"

Crystal_IlexForest_Text_InsertGSBall:
	.string "{PLAYER} put in the\nGS BALL.$"

Crystal_IlexForest_Text_KurtCaughtCelebi:
	.string "Whew, wasn't that\nsomething!\p{PLAYER}, that was\nfantastic. Thanks!\pThe legends about\nthat SHRINE were\nreal after all.\pI feel inspired by\nwhat I just saw.\pIt motivates me to\nmake better BALLS!\pI'm going!$"

Crystal_IlexForest_BugCatcherWayneSeenText:
	.string "Don't sneak up on\nme like that!\pYou frightened a\nPOKéMON away!$"

Crystal_IlexForest_BugCatcherWayneBeatenText:
	.string "I hadn't seen that\nPOKéMON before…$"

Crystal_IlexForest_BugCatcherWayneAfterBattleText:
	.string "A POKéMON I've\nnever seen before\pfell out of the\ntree when I used\nHEADBUTT.\pI ought to use\nHEADBUTT in other\nplaces too.$"

