	.string "I always play this\nslot machine. It\ppays out more than\nothers, I think.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGameCorner_GoldenrodGameCornerPokefanM1Text:
	.string "I just love this\nnew slot machine.\pIt's more of a\nchallenge than the\nones in CELADON.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGameCorner_GoldenrodGameCornerCooltrainerMText:
	.string "Life is a gamble.\nI'm going to flip\ncards till I drop!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGameCorner_GoldenrodGameCornerPokefanM2Text:
	.string "I couldn't win at\nthe slots, and I\pblew it on card\nflipping…\pI got so furious,\nI tossed out my\pCOIN CASE in the\nUNDERGROUND.$"

@ GoldenrodGym <= GoldenrodGym
Crystal_GoldenrodGym_WhitneyBeforeText:
	.string "Hi! I'm WHITNEY!\pEveryone was into\nPOKéMON, so I got\ninto it too!\pPOKéMON are\nsuper-cute!\pYou want to bat-\ntle? I'm warning\nyou--I'm good!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGym_WhitneyShouldntBeSoSeriousText:
	.string "Sob…\p…Waaaaaaah!\nYou're mean!\pYou shouldn't be\nso serious! You…\nyou child, you!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGym_WhitneyYouMeanieText:
	.string "Waaaaah!\pWaaaaah!\p…Snivel, hic…\n…You meanie!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGym_WhitneyWhatDoYouWantText:
	.string "…Sniff…\pWhat? What do you\nwant? A BADGE?\pOh, right.\nI forgot. Here's\nPLAINBADGE.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGym_PlayerReceivedPlainBadgeText:
	.string "{PLAYER} received\nPLAINBADGE.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGym_WhitneyPlainBadgeText:
	.string "PLAINBADGE lets\nyour POKéMON use\pSTRENGTH outside\nof battle.\pIt also boosts\nyour POKéMON's\nSPEED.\pOh, you can have\nthis too!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGym_WhitneyAttractText:
	.string "It's ATTRACT!\nIt makes full use\pof a POKéMON's\ncharm.\pIsn't it just per-\nfect for a cutie\nlike me?$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGym_WhitneyGoodCryText:
	.string "Ah, that was a\ngood cry!\pCome for a visit\nagain! Bye-bye!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGym_LassCarrieSeenText:
	.string "Don't let my\nPOKéMON's cute\plooks fool you.\nThey can whip you!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGym_LassCarrieBeatenText:
	.string "Darn… I thought\nyou were weak…$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGym_LassCarrieAfterBattleText:
	.string "Do my POKéMON\nthink I'm cute?$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGym_LassBridgetSeenText:
	.string "I like cute POKé-\nMON better than\nstrong POKéMON.\pBut I have strong\nand cute POKéMON!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGym_LassBridgetBeatenText:
	.string "Oh, no, no, no!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGym_LassBridgetAfterBattleText:
	.string "I'm trying to beat\nWHITNEY, but…\nIt's depressing.\pI'm okay! If I\nlose, I'll just\ptry harder next\ntime!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGym_BridgetWhitneyCriesText:
	.string "Oh, no. You made\nWHITNEY cry.\pIt's OK. She'll\nstop soon. She\palways cries when\nshe loses.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGym_BeautyVictoriaSeenText:
	.string "Oh, you are a cute\nlittle trainer! \pI like you, but I\nwon't hold back!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGym_BeautyVictoriaBeatenText:
	.string "Let's see… Oops,\nit's over?$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGym_BeautyVictoriaAfterBattleText:
	.string "Wow, you must be\ngood to beat me!\nKeep it up!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGym_BeautySamanthaSeenText:
	.string "Give it your best\nshot, or I'll take\nyou down!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGym_BeautySamanthaBeatenText:
	.string "No! Oh, MEOWTH,\nI'm so sorry!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGym_BeautySamanthaAfterBattleText:
	.string "I taught MEOWTH\nmoves for taking\non any type…$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGym_GoldenrodGymGuideText:
	.string "Yo! CHAMP in\nmaking!\pThis GYM is home\nto normal-type\nPOKéMON trainers.\pI recommend you\nuse fighting-type\nPOKéMON.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodGym_GoldenrodGymGuideWinText:
	.string "You won? Great! I\nwas busy admiring\nthe ladies here.$"

