Crystal_GoldenrodHappinessRater_GoldenrodHappinessRaterPokefanMText:
	.string "I keep losing in\nbattles, and my\pPOKéMON end up\nfainting…\pMaybe that's why\nmy POKéMON don't\nlike me much…$"

Crystal_GoldenrodHappinessRater_GoldenrodHappinessRaterTwinText:
	.string "When I use an item\non my POKéMON, it\nacts really glad!$"

