Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterWelcomeToTradeCornerText:
	.string "Hello! Welcome to\nPOKéCOM CENTER\nTRADE CORNER.\pYou can trade\nPOKéMON with other\npeople far away.$"

