	.string "We have returned\nyour POKéMON.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterYourMonIsLonelyText:
	.string "It's unfortunate,\nbut no one has\pcome forward as a\ntrade partner.\pWe've held your\nPOKéMON for a long\ptime. As a result,\nit is very lonely.\pSorry, but we must\nreturn it to you.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecenter1FWeHopeToSeeYouAgainText_2:
	.string "We hope to see you\nagain.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterContinueToHoldYourMonText:
	.string "Fine. We will\ncontinue to hold\nyour POKéMON.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterRecentlyLeftYourMonText:
	.string "Oh? You left your\nPOKéMON with us\nonly recently.\pPlease come back\nlater.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterSaveBeforeTradeCornerText:
	.string "We'll SAVE before\nconnecting to the\nCENTER.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterWhichMonToTradeText:
	.string "Which POKéMON do\nyou want to trade?$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterTradeCanceledText:
	.string "Sorry, but we must\ncancel the trade.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterEggTicketText:
	.string "Oh!\pI see you have an\nEGG TICKET!\pIt's a coupon that\nspecial people can\predeem for a\nspecial POKéMON!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterOddEggBriefingText:
	.string "Let me give you a\nquick briefing.\pTrades held at the\nTRADE CORNER are\pbetween two\ntrainers who don't\pknow each other's\nidentity.\pAs a result, it\nmay take time.\pHowever, an ODD\nEGG is available\njust for you.\pIt will be sent to\nyou right away.\pPlease choose one\nof the rooms in\pthe CENTER.\nAn ODD EGG will be\psent from the\nchosen room.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterPleaseWaitAMomentText:
	.string "Please wait a\nmoment.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterHereIsYourOddEggText:
	.string "Thank you for\nwaiting.\pWe received your\nODD EGG.\pHere it is!\pPlease raise it\nwith loving care.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterNoEggTicketServiceText:
	.string "I'm awfully sorry.\pThe EGG TICKET\nexchange service\nisn't running now.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterNewsMachineText:
	.string "It's a POKéMON\nNEWS MACHINE.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterWhatToDoText:
	.string "What would you\nlike to do?$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterNewsMachineExplanationText:
	.string "POKéMON NEWS is\nnews compiled from\pthe SAVE files of\nPOKéMON trainers.\pWhen reading the\nNEWS, your SAVE\pfile may be sent\nout.\pThe SAVE file data\nwill contain your\padventure log and\nmobile profile.\pYour phone number\nwill not be sent.\pThe contents of\nthe NEWS will vary\pdepending on the\nSAVE files sent by\pyou and the other\nPOKéMON trainers.\pYou might even be\nin the NEWS!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterWouldYouLikeTheNewsText:
	.string "Would you like to\nget the NEWS?$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterReadingTheLatestNewsText:
	.string "Reading the latest\nNEWS… Please wait.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterNoOldNewsText:
	.string "There is no old\nNEWS…$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterCorruptedNewsDataText:
	.string "The NEWS data is\ncorrupted.\pPlease download\nthe NEWS again.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterMakingPreparationsText:
	.string "We're making\npreparations.\pPlease come back\nlater.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterSaveBeforeNewsMachineText:
	.string "We will SAVE your\nprogress before\pstarting the NEWS\nMACHINE.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterPerson1Text:
	.string "Whoa, this POKéMON\nCENTER is huge.\pThey just built\nthis place. They\pinstalled lots of\nnew machines too.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterPerson2Text:
	.string "I thought up a fun\nnew thing for the\nTRADE CORNER!\pI make a PIDGEY\nhold MAIL, then\pput it up for\ntrade for another\none!\pIf everyone did\nthat, MAIL could\pbe traded with all\nsorts of people!\pI call it PIDGEY\nMAIL!\pIf it becomes\npopular, I might\pmake lots of new\nfriends!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterPerson3Text:
	.string "They said you can\ntrade POKéMON with\ptotal strangers up\nhere.\pBut they're still\nadjusting things.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterPerson4Text:
	.string "Some girl I don't\nknow sent me her\pHOPPIP.\nYou should trade\pfor a POKéMON that\nyou want.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterPerson5Text:
	.string "I received a\nfemale HOPPIP, but\nits named STANLEY!\pThat's my dad's\nname!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterPerson6Text:
	.string "What is the NEWS\nMACHINE?\pDoes it get news\nfrom a wider area\nthan the radio?$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterPerson7Text:
	.string "The POKéCOM CENTER\nwill link with all\pPOKéMON CENTERS in\na wireless net.\pThat must mean\nI'll be able to\plink with all\nsorts of people.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterPerson8Text:
	.string "The machines here\ncan't be used yet.\pStill, it's nice\ncoming to a trendy\pplace before other\npeople.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterPerson9Text:
	.string "My friend was in\nthe NEWS a while\pback. I was really\nsurprised!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterPerson10Text:
	.string "I get anxious if I\ndon't check out\nthe latest NEWS!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterPerson11Text:
	.string "If I get in the\nNEWS and become\pfamous, I bet I'll\nbe adored.\pI wonder how I\ncould get in the\nNEWS?$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecenter1FGameboyKidText:
	.string "The COLOSSEUM\nupstairs is for\nlink battles.\pBattle records are\nposted on the\pwall, so I can't\nafford to lose.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterPerson12Text:
	.string "I came over here\nwhen I got word\pthat GOLDENROD's\nPOKéMON CENTER has\pnew machines that\nno one's ever seen\nbefore.\pBut it looks like\nthey're still busy\pwith all their\npreparations…$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterPerson13Text:
	.string "Just seeing all\nthese new things\phere makes me feel\nyounger!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecenter1FLassText:
	.string "A higher level\nPOKéMON doesn't\nalways win.\pAfter all, it may\nhave a type dis-\nadvantage.\pI don't think\nthere is a single\pPOKéMON that is\nthe toughest.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokeCenter1FLinkReceptionistPleaseAcceptGSBallText:
	.string "{PLAYER}, isn't it?\pCongratulations!\pAs a special deal,\na GS BALL has been\nsent just for you!\pPlease accept it!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokeCenter1FLinkReceptionistPleaseDoComeAgainText:
	.string "Please do come\nagain!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterSignText:
	.string "POKéCOM CENTER\n1F INFORMATION\pLeft:\nADMINISTRATION\pCenter:\nTRADE CORNER\pRight:\nPOKéMON NEWS$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecomCenterNewsMachineNotYetText:
	.string "It's a POKéMON\nNEWS MACHINE!\pIt's not in\noperation yet…$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecenter1FPokefanFDoYouHaveEonMailText:
	.string "Oh my, your pack\nlooks so heavy!\pOh! Do you happen\nto have something\nnamed EON MAIL?\pMy daughter is\nafter one.\pYou can part with\none, can't you?$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecenter1FAskGiveAwayAnEonMailText:
	.string "Give away an EON\nMAIL?$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecenter1FPokefanFThisIsForYouText:
	.string "Oh, that's great!\nThank you, honey!\pHere, this is for\nyou in return!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecenter1FPokefanFDaughterWillBeDelightedText:
	.string "My daughter will\nbe delighted!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodPokecenter1F_GoldenrodPokecenter1FPokefanFTooBadText:
	.string "Oh? You don't have\none? Too bad.$"

