	.string "Gaah! I lost!\nThat makes me mad!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_PokemaniacDonaldAfterBattleText:
	.string "Are you making a\nPOKéDEX? Here's a\nhot tip.\pThe HIKER on ROUTE\n33, ANTHONY, is a\ngood guy.\pHe'll phone you if\nhe sees any rare\nPOKéMON.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_GoldenrodUndergroundTheDoorsLockedText:
	.string "The door's locked…$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_GoldenrodUndergroundTheDoorIsOpenText:
	.string "The door is open.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_GoldenrodUndergroundBasementKeyOpenedDoorText:
	.string "The BASEMENT KEY\nopened the door.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_GoldenrodUndergroundOlderHaircutBrotherOfferHaircutText:
	.string "Welcome!\pI run the POKéMON\nSALON!\pI'm the older and\nbetter of the two\nHAIRCUT BROTHERS.\pI can make your\nPOKéMON beautiful\nfor just ¥500.\pWould you like me\nto do that?$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_GoldenrodUndergroundOlderHaircutBrotherAskWhichMonText:
	.string "Which POKéMON\nshould I work on?$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_GoldenrodUndergroundOlderHaircutBrotherWatchItBecomeBeautifulText:
	.string "OK! Watch it\nbecome beautiful!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_GoldenrodUndergroundOlderHaircutBrotherAllDoneText:
	.string "There! All done!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_GoldenrodUndergroundOlderHaircutBrotherThatsAShameText:
	.string "Is that right?\nThat's a shame!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_GoldenrodUndergroundOlderHaircutBrotherYoullNeedMoreMoneyText:
	.string "You'll need more\nmoney than that.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_GoldenrodUndergroundOlderHaircutBrotherOneHaircutADayText:
	.string "I do only one\nhaircut a day. I'm\ndone for today.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_GoldenrodUndergroundYoungerHaircutBrotherOfferHaircutText:
	.string "Welcome to the\nPOKéMON SALON!\pI'm the younger\nand less expen-\nsive of the two\nHAIRCUT BROTHERS.\pI'll spiff up your\nPOKéMON for just\n¥300.\pSo? How about it?$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_GoldenrodUndergroundYoungerHaircutBrotherAskWhichMonText:
	.string "OK, which POKéMON\nshould I do?$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_GoldenrodUndergroundYoungerHaircutBrotherIllMakeItLookCoolText:
	.string "OK! I'll make it\nlook cool!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_GoldenrodUndergroundYoungerHaircutBrotherAllDoneText:
	.string "There we go!\nAll done!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_GoldenrodUndergroundYoungerHaircutBrotherHowDisappointingText:
	.string "No? \nHow disappointing!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_GoldenrodUndergroundYoungerHaircutBrotherShortOnFundsText:
	.string "You're a little\nshort on funds.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_GoldenrodUndergroundYoungerHaircutBrotherOneHaircutADayText:
	.string "I can do only one\nhaircut a day.\pSorry, but I'm all\ndone for today.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_HaircutBrosText_SlightlyHappier:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3} looks a\nlittle happier.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_HaircutBrosText_Happier:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3} looks\nhappy.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_HaircutBrosText_MuchHappier:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3} looks\ndelighted!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_GoldenrodUndergroundWeAreNotOpenTodayText:
	.string "We're not open\ntoday.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUnderground_GoldenrodUndergroundNoEntryText:
	.string "NO ENTRY BEYOND\nTHIS POINT$"

@ GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances <= GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances
Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_UndergroundRivalBeforeText:
	.string "Hold it!\pI saw you, so I\ntailed you.\pI don't need you\nunderfoot while I\ptake care of TEAM\nROCKET.\p…Wait a second.\nYou beat me be-\nfore, didn't you?\pThat was just a\nfluke.\pBut I repay my\ndebts!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_UndergroundRivalWinText:
	.string "…Why…\nWhy do I lose?\pI've assembled the\ntoughest POKéMON.\pI didn't ease up\non the gas.\pSo why do I lose?$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_UndergroundRivalAfterText:
	.string "…I don't under-\nstand…\pIs what that LANCE\nguy said true?\pThat I don't treat\nPOKéMON properly?\pLove…\pTrust…\pAre they really\nwhat I lack?\pAre they keeping\nme from winning?\pI… I just don't\nunderstand.\pBut it's not going\nto end here.\pNot now. Not\nbecause of this.\pI won't give up my\ndream of becoming\pthe world's best\nPOKéMON trainer!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_UndergroundRivalLossText:
	.string "Humph. This is my\nreal power, wimp.\pI'll make TEAM\nROCKET history.\pAnd I'm going to\ngrind that LANCE\nunder my heels.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_SuperNerdText:
	.string "I was challenged\nto a battle down-\nstairs.\pIt's rough down\nthere. You'd\nbetter be careful.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_TeacherText:
	.string "There are some\nshops downstairs…\pBut there are\nalso trainers.\pI'm scared to go\ndown there.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_GruntM11SeenText:
	.string "Open one shutter,\nanother closes.\pBet you can't get\nwhere you want!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_GruntM11BeatenText:
	.string "Drat! I was sunk\nby indecision!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_GruntM11AfterBattleText:
	.string "I'm confused too…\nThe switch on the\pend is the one to\npress first, but…$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_GruntM25SeenText:
	.string "Kwahaha!\pConfounded by the\nshutters, are we?\pI'll let you in on\na secret if you\ncan beat me!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_GruntM25BeatenText:
	.string "Uwww…\nI blew it.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_GruntM25AfterBattleText:
	.string "All right. A hint!\pChange the order\nof switching.\pThat'll change the\nways the shutters\nopen and close.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_BurglarDuncanSeenText:
	.string "Fork over your\ngoodies!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_BurglarDuncanBeatenText:
	.string "Mercy!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_BurglarDuncanAfterBattleText:
	.string "Steal and sell!\nThat's basic in\ncrime, kid!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_BurglarEddieSeenText:
	.string "They ditched this\nproject before\nthey finished.\pI'm searching for\nleftover loot.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_BurglarEddieBeatenText:
	.string "Over the top!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_BurglarEddieAfterBattleText:
	.string "UNDERGROUND WARE-\nHOUSE?\pWhat do you want\nto go there for?\pThere's nothing\ndown there.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_GruntM13SeenText:
	.string "I don't care if\nyou're lost.\pYou show up here,\nyou're nothing but\na victim!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_GruntM13BeatenText:
	.string "Urk! Yeah, think\nyou're cool, huh?$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_GruntM13AfterBattleText:
	.string "You must have ice\nin your veins to\ndis TEAM ROCKET.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_SwitchRoomText_Switch1:
	.string "It's labeled\nSWITCH 1.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_GruntF3SeenText:
	.string "Are you lost? No,\nyou can't be.\pYou don't have\nthat scared look.\pI'll give you\nsomething to be\nscared about!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_GruntF3BeatenText:
	.string "How could you?$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_GruntF3AfterBattleText:
	.string "Go wherever you'd\nlike! Get lost!\nSee if I care!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_SwitchRoomText_OffTurnOn:
	.string "It's OFF.\nTurn it ON?$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_SwitchRoomText_OnTurnOff:
	.string "It's ON.\nTurn it OFF?$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_SwitchRoomText_Switch2:
	.string "It's labeled\nSWITCH 2.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_SwitchRoomText_Switch3:
	.string "It's labeled\nSWITCH 3.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundSwitchRoomEntrances_SwitchRoomText_Emergency:
	.string "It's labeled\nEMERGENCY.$"

