@ GoldenrodUndergroundWarehouse <= GoldenrodUndergroundWarehouse
Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundWarehouse_GruntM24SeenText:
	.string "How did you get\nthis far?\pI guess it can't\nbe helped. I'll\ndispose of you.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundWarehouse_GruntM24BeatenText:
	.string "I got disposed of…$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundWarehouse_GruntM24AfterBattleText:
	.string "TEAM ROCKET will\nkeep going, wait-\ning for the return\nof GIOVANNI.\pWe'll do whatever\nit takes.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundWarehouse_GruntM14SeenText:
	.string "You're not going\nany farther!\pI don't show mercy\nto my enemies, not\neven brats!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundWarehouse_GruntM14BeatenText:
	.string "Blast it!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundWarehouse_GruntM14AfterBattleText:
	.string "I lost…\pPlease forgive me,\nGIOVANNI!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundWarehouse_GruntM15SeenText:
	.string "Hyuck-hyuck-hyuck!\nI remember you!\pYou got me good\nat our hideout!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundWarehouse_GruntM15BeatenText:
	.string "Hyuck-hyuck-hyuck!\nSo, that's how?$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundWarehouse_GruntM15AfterBattleText:
	.string "Hyuck-hyuck-hyuck!\nThat was a blast!\nI'll remember you!$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundWarehouse_DirectorIntroText:
	.string "DIRECTOR: Who?\nWhat? You came to\nrescue me?\pThank you!\pThe RADIO TOWER!\pWhat's happening\nthere?\pTaken over by TEAM\nROCKET?\pHere. Take this\nCARD KEY.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundWarehouse_DirectorCardKeyText:
	.string "DIRECTOR: Use that\nto open the shut-\nters on 3F.$"

Crystal_GoldenrodUndergroundWarehouse_DirectorAfterText:
	.string "I'm begging you to\nhelp.\pThere's no telling\nwhat they'll do if\pthey control the\ntransmitter.\pThey may even be\nable to control\pPOKéMON using a\nspecial signal!\pYou're the only\none I can call on.\pPlease save the\nRADIO TOWER…\pAnd all the POKé-\nMON nationwide!$"

@ BillsFamilysHouse <= BillsFamilysHouse
Crystal_BillsFamilysHouse_BillTakeThisEeveeText:
	.string "BILL: Hi, {PLAYER}!\nDo us a favor and\ntake this EEVEE.\pIt came over when\nI was adjusting\nthe TIME CAPSULE.\pSomeone has to\ntake care of it,\pbut I don't like\nbeing outside.\pCan I count on you\nto play with it,\n{PLAYER}?$"

Crystal_BillsFamilysHouse_BillImCountingOnYouText:
	.string "BILL: I knew you'd\ncome through!\pWay to go! You're\nthe real deal!\pOK, I'm counting\non you.\pTake good care of\nit!$"

Crystal_BillsFamilysHouse_ReceivedEeveeText:
	.string "{PLAYER} received\nEEVEE!$"

Crystal_BillsFamilysHouse_BillEeveeMayEvolveText:
	.string "BILL: PROF.ELM\nclaims EEVEE may\pevolve in new and\nunknown ways.$"

Crystal_BillsFamilysHouse_BillPartyFullText:
	.string "Whoa, wait. You\ncan't carry any\nmore POKéMON.$"

Crystal_BillsFamilysHouse_BillNoEeveeText:
	.string "Oh… Now what to\ndo?$"

Crystal_BillsFamilysHouse_BillPopWontWorkText:
	.string "BILL: My pop, he\nwon't work. All he\pdoes is goof off\nall day long.\pHe's getting to be\na real headache…$"

Crystal_BillsFamilysHouse_BillsMomText_BeforeEcruteak:
	.string "Oh, you collect\nPOKéMON? My son\nBILL is an expert.\pHe just got called\nto the POKéMON\pCENTER in ECRUTEAK\nCITY.\pMy husband went\noff to the GAME\pCORNER without\nbeing called…$"

Crystal_BillsFamilysHouse_BillsMomText_AfterEcruteak:
	.string "My husband was\nonce known as a\pPOKéMANIAC.\nBILL must have\ptaken after his\nfather.$"

Crystal_BillsFamilysHouse_BillsYoungerSisterUsefulNumberText:
	.string "Are you a trainer?\pI've got a useful\nphone number for\nyou.$"

Crystal_BillsFamilysHouse_RecordedBillsNumberText:
	.string "{PLAYER} recorded\nBILL's number.$"

Crystal_BillsFamilysHouse_BillsYoungerSisterRefusedNumberText:
	.string "My brother made\nthe PC POKéMON\nstorage system.\pI was going to\ngive you BILL's\nnumber…$"

Crystal_BillsFamilysHouse_BillsYoungerSisterPhoneFullText:
	.string "You can't record\nany more numbers.$"

Crystal_BillsFamilysHouse_BillsYoungerSisterStorageSystemText:
	.string "My big brother\nBILL made the PC\pPOKéMON storage\nsystem.$"

@ CharcoalKiln <= CharcoalKiln
Crystal_CharcoalKiln_CharcoalKilnBossText1:
	.string "All the SLOWPOKE\nhave disappeared\nfrom the town.\pThe forest's pro-\ntector may be\nangry with us…\pIt may be a bad\nomen. We should\nstay in.$"

Crystal_CharcoalKiln_CharcoalKilnBossText2:
	.string "The SLOWPOKE have\nreturned…\pBut my APPRENTICE\nhasn't come back\nfrom ILEX FOREST.\pWhere in the world\nis that lazy guy?$"

Crystal_CharcoalKiln_CharcoalKilnBossText3:
	.string "You chased off\nTEAM ROCKET and\pwent to ILEX\nFOREST alone?\pThat takes guts!\nI like that. Come\ntrain with us.$"

Crystal_CharcoalKiln_CharcoalKilnApprenticeText1:
	.string "Where have all the\nSLOWPOKE gone?\pAre they out play-\ning somewhere?$"

Crystal_CharcoalKiln_CharcoalKilnApprenticeText2:
	.string "I'm sorry--I for-\ngot to thank you.\pThis is CHARCOAL\nthat I made.\pFire-type POKéMON\nwould be happy to\nhold that.$"

Crystal_CharcoalKiln_CharcoalKilnApprenticeText3:
	.string "The SLOWPOKE came\nback, and you even\nfound FARFETCH'D.\pYou're the cool-\nest, man!$"

Crystal_CharcoalKiln_FarfetchdText:
	.string "FARFETCH'D: Kwaa!$"

@ DayCare <= DayCare
Crystal_DayCare_Text_GrampsLookingForYou:
	.string "Gramps was looking\nfor you.$"

Crystal_DayCare_Text_DayCareManTalksAboutEggTicket:
	.string "I'm the DAY-CARE\nMAN.\pThere's something\nnew in GOLDENROD\pcalled the TRADE\nCORNER.\pI was given an EGG\nTICKET that can be\ptraded in for a\nODD EGG.\pBut since we run a\nDAY-CARE, we don't\pneed it. You may\nas well have it.$"

Crystal_DayCare_DayCareManText_GiveOddEgg:
	.string "I'm the DAY-CARE\nMAN.\pDo you know about\nEGGS?\pI was raising\nPOKéMON with my\nwife, you see.\pWe were shocked to\nfind an EGG!\pHow incredible is\nthat?\pWell, wouldn't you\nlike this EGG?\pThen fine, this is\nyours to keep!$"

Crystal_DayCare_DayCareText_ComeAgain:
	.string "Come again.$"

Crystal_DayCare_DayCareText_GotOddEgg:
	.string "{PLAYER} received\nODD EGG!$"

Crystal_DayCare_DayCareText_DescribeOddEgg:
	.string "I found that when\nI was caring for\psomeone's POKéMON\nbefore.\pBut the trainer\ndidn't want the\pEGG, so I'd kept\nit around.$"

Crystal_DayCare_DayCareText_PartyFull:
	.string "You've no room for\nthis.$"

@ EarlsPokemonAcademy <= EarlsPokemonAcademy
Crystal_EarlsPokemonAcademy_AcademyEarlIntroText:
	.string "EARL, I am!\pWonderful are\nPOKéMON, yes!\pTeach you I will\nto be a better\ntrainer!\pWhat you want to\nknow? Want to be\na winner is you?$"

Crystal_EarlsPokemonAcademy_AcademyEarlTeachHowToWinText:
	.string "Good! Teach you,\nI will!\pIn battle, POKéMON\ntop on list jump\nout first!\pChange order in\nlist, make battle\neasy, maybe!\pMore from me you\nwant to hear?$"

Crystal_EarlsPokemonAcademy_AcademyEarlTeachMoreText:
	.string "So, want to know\nhow to raise\nPOKéMON well?$"

Crystal_EarlsPokemonAcademy_AcademyEarlTeachHowToRaiseWellText:
	.string "Fine! Teach you,\nI will!\pIf POKéMON come\nout in battle even\pbriefly, some EXP.\nPoints it gets.\pAt top of list put\nweak POKéMON.\pSwitch in battle\nquick!\pThis way, weak\nPOKéMON strong\nbecome!$"

Crystal_EarlsPokemonAcademy_AcademyEarlNoMoreToTeachText:
	.string "Oh! Smart student\nyou are! Nothing\nmore do I teach!\pGood to POKéMON\nyou must be!$"

Crystal_EarlsPokemonAcademy_EarlsPokemonAcademyYoungster1Text:
	.string "I'm taking notes\nof the teacher's\nlecture.\pI'd better copy\nthe stuff on the\nblackboard too.$"

Crystal_EarlsPokemonAcademy_EarlsPokemonAcademyGameboyKid1Text:
	.string "I traded my best\nPOKéMON to the\nguy beside me.$"

Crystal_EarlsPokemonAcademy_EarlsPokemonAcademyGameboyKid2Text:
	.string "Huh? The POKéMON I\njust got is hold-\ning something!$"

Crystal_EarlsPokemonAcademy_EarlsPokemonAcademyYoungster2Text:
	.string "A POKéMON holding\na BERRY will heal\nitself in battle.\pMany other items\ncan be held by\nPOKéMON…\pIt sure is tough\ntaking notes…$"

Crystal_EarlsPokemonAcademy_AcademyBlackboardText:
	.string "The blackboard\ndescribes POKéMON\pstatus changes in\nbattle.$"

Crystal_EarlsPokemonAcademy_AcademyBlackboardText2:
	.string "Read which topic?$"

Crystal_EarlsPokemonAcademy_AcademyPoisonText:
	.string "If poisoned, a\nPOKéMON steadily\nloses HP.\pPoison lingers\nafter the battle,\pand HP is lost as\nyou walk.\pTo cure it, use an\nANTIDOTE.$"

Crystal_EarlsPokemonAcademy_AcademyParalysisText:
	.string "Paralysis reduces\nspeed and may\nprevent movement.\pIt remains after\nbattle, so use\na PARLYZ HEAL.$"

Crystal_EarlsPokemonAcademy_AcademySleepText:
	.string "If asleep, your\nPOKéMON can't make\na move.\pA sleeping POKéMON\ndoesn't wake up\nafter battle.\pWake it up with\nan AWAKENING.$"

Crystal_EarlsPokemonAcademy_AcademyBurnText:
	.string "A burn steadily\nconsumes HP.\pIt also reduces\nattack power.\pA burn lingers\nafter battle.\pUse a BURN HEAL as\nthe cure.$"

Crystal_EarlsPokemonAcademy_AcademyFreezeText:
	.string "If your POKéMON is\nfrozen, it can't\ndo a thing.\pIt remains frozen\nafter battle.\pThaw it out with\nan ICE HEAL.$"

Crystal_EarlsPokemonAcademy_AcademyNotebookText:
	.string "It's this kid's\nnotebook…\pCatch POKéMON\nusing POKé BALLS.\pUp to six can be\nin your party.\pKeep reading?$"

Crystal_EarlsPokemonAcademy_AcademyNotebookText1:
	.string "Before throwing a\nPOKé BALL, weaken\nthe target first.\pA poisoned or\nburned POKéMON is\neasier to catch.\pKeep reading?$"

Crystal_EarlsPokemonAcademy_AcademyNotebookText2:
	.string "Some moves may\ncause confusion.\pConfusion may make\na POKéMON attack\nitself.\pLeaving battle\nclears up any\nconfusion.\pKeep reading?$"

Crystal_EarlsPokemonAcademy_AcademyNotebookText3:
	.string "People who catch\nand use POKéMON\pin battle are\nPOKéMON trainers.\pThey are expected\nto visit POKéMON\pGYMS and defeat\nother trainers.\pThe next page\nis… Blank!\pBoy: E-he-he…\pI haven't written\nanymore…$"

Crystal_EarlsPokemonAcademy_AcademyStickerMachineText:
	.string "This super machine\nprints data out as\pstickers!$"

