@ PokecomCenterAdminOfficeMobile <= PokecomCenterAdminOfficeMobile
Crystal_PokecomCenterAdminOfficeMobile_PokecomCenterAdminOfficeMobileScientist1Text:
	.string "POKéCOM CENTER and\nMOBILE CENTER were\pbuilt to satisfy\ndemands for trades\pand battles with\ntrainers far away\pand with total\nstrangers.$"

Crystal_PokecomCenterAdminOfficeMobile_PokecomCenterAdminOfficeMobileScientist2Text:
	.string "When you linked\nwith someone by\pmobile phone for\nthe first time,\pweren't you\nimpressed?\pWhen my first try\nworked, I was so\pimpressed that I\ngot the shakes!$"

Crystal_PokecomCenterAdminOfficeMobile_PokecomCenterAdminOfficeMobileScientist3Text:
	.string "They were able to\nbuild this huge\pfacility thanks to\nadvances in wire-\nless technology.$"

Crystal_PokecomCenterAdminOfficeMobile_PokecomCenterAdminOfficeMobileComputer1Text:
	.string "It's a notice\nabout where MOBILE\pADAPTERS are to be\nused…$"

Crystal_PokecomCenterAdminOfficeMobile_PokecomCenterAdminOfficeMobileComputer1Text_PokeComClub:
	.string "There's a POKéCOM\nCLUB upstairs in\pany POKéMON\nCENTER.\pThere, you can\nbattle or trade\pwith a friend far\naway by using a\nMOBILE ADAPTER.\pTo link up, your\nfriend must have\pthe same kind of\nMOBILE ADAPTER as\nyou.$"

Crystal_PokecomCenterAdminOfficeMobile_PokecomCenterAdminOfficeMobileComputer1Text_MobileCenter:
	.string "To use the TRADE\nCORNER or read the\pPOKéMON NEWS, you\nneed to phone the\nMOBILE CENTER.\pYou must register\nat the MOBILE\pCENTER before\nconnecting there.$"

Crystal_PokecomCenterAdminOfficeMobile_PokecomCenterAdminOfficeMobileComputer2Text:
	.string "It's a notice\nabout using the\nphone…$"

Crystal_PokecomCenterAdminOfficeMobile_PokecomCenterAdminOfficeMobileComputer2Text_UsePhone:
	.string "Please ensure that\nyour phone and\pMOBILE ADAPTER are\nproperly linked.\pPlease make sure\nthe wireless phone\nsignal is strong.\pDon't touch or\nhang up the phone\nwhile linking.$"

Crystal_PokecomCenterAdminOfficeMobile_PokecomCenterAdminOfficeMobileComputer2Text_DontUsePhone:
	.string "If the server is\nbusy, it may not\pbe possible to log\non.\pIf so, please call\nback later.\pIf you are unable\nto log on or don't\punderstand the\nerror messages,\pcall a support\ncenter or read the\ninstructions.$"

Crystal_PokecomCenterAdminOfficeMobile_PokecomCenterAdminOfficeMobileComputer3Text:
	.string "The ADMINISTRATION\nOFFICE received an\ne-mail. It says…\p<……> <……> <……>\pTo the POKéCOM\nCENTER staff…\pWireless communi-\ncation has enabled\pPOKéMON trainers\nto interact across\pthe nation. Let's\nkeep working for\pthe day when all\nthe trainers in\pthe world can link\nwithout barriers!\p<……> <……> <……>$"

@ BlackthornCity <= BlackthornCity
Crystal_BlackthornCity_Text_ClairIsOut:
	.string "I am sorry.\pCLAIR, our GYM\nLEADER, entered\pthe DRAGON'S DEN\nbehind the GYM.\pI have no idea\nwhen our LEADER\nwill return.$"

Crystal_BlackthornCity_Text_ClairIsIn:
	.string "CLAIR, our GYM\nLEADER, is waiting\nfor you.\pHowever, it would\nbe impossible for\pa run-of-the-mill\ntrainer to win.$"

Crystal_BlackthornCity_Text_ClairIsBeaten:
	.string "You defeated\nCLAIR?\pThat's amazing!\pI've never heard\nof her losing to\panyone other than\nLANCE.$"

Crystal_BlackthornCity_BlackthornGrampsRefusesEntryText:
	.string "No. Only chosen\ntrainers may train\phere.\nPlease leave.$"

Crystal_BlackthornCity_BlackthornGrampsGrantsEntryText:
	.string "If CLAIR allows\nit, her grand-\nfather--our MASTER\n--will also.\pYou may enter.$"

Crystal_BlackthornCity_BlackBeltText_WeirdRadio:
	.string "My radio's busted?\nLately, I only get\nthis weird signal.$"

Crystal_BlackthornCity_BlackBeltText_VoicesInMyHead:
	.string "Arooo! Voices in\nmy head!\pHuh? I'm listening\nto my radio!$"

Crystal_BlackthornCity_BlackthornCooltrainerF1Text:
	.string "Are you going to\nmake your POKéMON\nforget some moves?$"

Crystal_BlackthornCity_BlackthornYoungsterText:
	.string "Dragon masters all\ncome from the city\nof BLACKTHORN.$"

Crystal_BlackthornCity_MeetSantosText:
	.string "SANTOS: …\pIt's Saturday…\pI'm SANTOS of\nSaturday…$"

Crystal_BlackthornCity_SantosGivesGiftText:
	.string "You can have this…$"

Crystal_BlackthornCity_SantosGaveGiftText:
	.string "SANTOS: …\pSPELL TAG…\pGhost-type moves\nget stronger…\pIt will frighten\nyou…$"

Crystal_BlackthornCity_SantosSaturdayText:
	.string "SANTOS: …\pSee you again on\nanother Saturday…\pI won't have any\nmore gifts…$"

Crystal_BlackthornCity_SantosNotSaturdayText:
	.string "SANTOS: Today's\nnot Saturday…$"

Crystal_BlackthornCity_BlackthornCooltrainerF2Text:
	.string "Wow, you came\nthrough the ICE\nPATH?\pYou must be a real\nhotshot trainer!$"

Crystal_BlackthornCity_BlackthornCitySignText:
	.string "BLACKTHORN CITY\pA Quiet Mountain\nRetreat$"

Crystal_BlackthornCity_BlackthornGymSignText:
	.string "BLACKTHORN CITY\nPOKéMON GYM\nLEADER: CLAIR\pThe Blessed User\nof Dragon POKéMON$"

Crystal_BlackthornCity_MoveDeletersHouseSignText:
	.string "MOVE DELETER'S\nHOUSE$"

Crystal_BlackthornCity_DragonDensSignText:
	.string "DRAGON'S DEN\nAHEAD$"

Crystal_BlackthornCity_BlackthornCityTrainerTipsText:
	.string "TRAINER TIPS\pA POKéMON holding\na MIRACLEBERRY\pwill cure itself\nof any status\nproblem.$"

@ BlackthornDragonSpeechHouse <= BlackthornDragonSpeechHouse
Crystal_BlackthornDragonSpeechHouse_BlackthornDragonSpeechHouseGrannyText:
	.string "A clan of trainers\nwho can freely\pcommand dragons\nlive right here in\nBLACKTHORN.\pAs a result, there\nare many legends\pabout dragons in\nthis town.$"

Crystal_BlackthornDragonSpeechHouse_BlackthornDragonSpeechHouseDratiniText:
	.string "DRATINI: Draa!$"

@ BlackthornGym1F <= BlackthornGym1F
Crystal_BlackthornGym1F_ClairIntroText:
	.string "I am CLAIR.\pThe world's best\ndragon master.\pI can hold my own\nagainst even the\pPOKéMON LEAGUE's\nELITE FOUR.\pDo you still want\nto take me on?\p…Fine.\nLet's do it!\pAs a GYM LEADER,\nI will use my full\ppower against any\nopponent!$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym1F_ClairWinText:
	.string "I lost?\pI don't believe\nit. There must be\nsome mistake…$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym1F_ClairText_GoToDragonsDen:
	.string "I won't admit\nthis.\pI may have lost,\nbut you're still\pnot ready for the\nPOKéMON LEAGUE.\pI know. You should\ntake the dragon\nuser challenge.\pBehind this GYM is\na place called\nDRAGON'S DEN.\pThere is a small\nshrine at its\pcenter.\nGo there.\pIf you can prove\nthat you've lost\pyour lazy ideals,\nI will recognize\pyou as a trainer\nworthy of a GYM\nBADGE!$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym1F_ClairText_TooMuchToExpect:
	.string "What's the matter?\pIs it too much to\nexpect of you?$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym1F_BlackthornGymClairText_YouKeptMeWaiting:
	.string "You've kept me\nwaiting!\pHere! Take this!$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym1F_BlackthornGymText_ReceivedTM24:
	.string "{PLAYER} received\nTM24.$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym1F_BlackthornGymClairText_DescribeTM24:
	.string "That contains\nDRAGONBREATH.\pNo, it doesn't\nhave anything to\ndo with my breath.\pIf you don't want\nit, you don't have\nto take it.$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym1F_BlackthornGymClairText_BagFull:
	.string "What is this? You\ndon't have room?$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym1F_BlackthornGymClairText_League:
	.string "What's the matter?\pAren't you headed\nto the POKéMON\nLEAGUE?\pDon't you know\nwhere it is?\pFrom here, go to\nNEW BARK TOWN.\pThen SURF east.\nThe route there is\nvery tough.\pDon't you dare\nlose at the POKé-\nMON LEAGUE!\pIf you do, I'll\nfeel even worse\pabout having lost\nto you!\pGive it every-\nthing you've got.$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym1F_CooltrainermPaulSeenText:
	.string "Your first battle\nagainst dragons?\pI'll show you how\ntough they are!$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym1F_CooltrainermPaulBeatenText:
	.string "My dragon POKéMON\nlost?$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym1F_CooltrainermPaulAfterBattleText:
	.string "LANCE told you\nthat he'd like to\psee you again?\nNot a chance!$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym1F_CooltrainermMikeSeenText:
	.string "My chance of\nlosing? Not even\none percent!$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym1F_CooltrainermMikeBeatenText:
	.string "That's odd.$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym1F_CooltrainermMikeAfterBattleText:
	.string "I know my short-\ncomings now.\pThanks for showing\nme!$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym1F_CooltrainerfLolaSeenText:
	.string "Dragons are sacred\nPOKéMON.\pThey are full of\nlife energy.\pIf you're not\nserious, you won't\pbe able to beat\nthem.$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym1F_CooltrainerfLolaBeatenText:
	.string "Way to go!$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym1F_CooltrainerfLolaAfterBattleText:
	.string "Dragons are weak\nagainst dragon-\ntype moves.$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym1F_BlackthornGymGuideText:
	.string "Yo! CHAMP in\nmaking!\pIt's been a long\njourney, but we\pare almost done!\nCount on me!\pCLAIR uses the\nmythical and sac-\nred dragon-type\nPOKéMON.\pYou can't damage\nthem very easily.\pBut you know,\nthey're supposed\pto be weak against\nice-type moves.$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym1F_BlackthornGymGuideWinText:
	.string "You were great to\nbeat CLAIR!\pAll that's left is\nthe POKéMON LEAGUE\nchallenge.\pYou're on the way\nto becoming the\nPOKéMON CHAMPION!$"

@ BlackthornGym2F <= BlackthornGym2F
Crystal_BlackthornGym2F_CooltrainermCodySeenText:
	.string "It's not as if we\nall use dragon-\ntype POKéMON.$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym2F_CooltrainermCodyBeatenText:
	.string "Rats! If only I\nhad a dragon!$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym2F_CooltrainermCodyAfterBattleText:
	.string "Members of our\ndragon-user clan\pcan use dragon\nPOKéMON only after\pour MASTER allows\nit.$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym2F_CooltrainerfFranSeenText:
	.string "I can't allow a\nnameless trainer\npast me!\pCLAIR would be\nlivid if I did!$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym2F_CooltrainerfFranBeatenText:
	.string "Awww… I lost…$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym2F_CooltrainerfFranAfterBattleText:
	.string "Uh-oh… CLAIR is\ngoing to be mad…$"

Crystal_BlackthornGym2F_BlackthornGym2FBoulderFellText:
	.string "The boulder fell\nthrough!$"

@ BlackthornMart <= BlackthornMart
Crystal_BlackthornMart_BlackthornMartCooltrainerMText:
	.string "You can't buy MAX\nREVIVE, but it\pfully restores a\nfainted POKéMON.\pBeware--it won't\nrestore PP, the\pPOWER POINTS\nneeded for moves.$"

Crystal_BlackthornMart_BlackthornMartBlackBeltText:
	.string "MAX REPEL keeps\nweak POKéMON away\nfrom you.\pIt's the longest\nlasting of the\nREPEL sprays.$"

@ BlackthornPokecenter1F <= BlackthornPokecenter1F
Crystal_BlackthornPokecenter1F_BlackthornPokecenter1FGentlemanText:
	.string "Deep inside far-\noff INDIGO PLATEAU\pis the POKéMON\nLEAGUE.\pI hear the best\ntrainers gather\pthere from around\nthe country.$"

Crystal_BlackthornPokecenter1F_BlackthornPokecenter1FTwinText:
	.string "There was this\nmove I just had\pto teach my POKé-\nMON.\pSo I got the MOVE\nDELETER to make it\nforget an HM move.$"

@ BrunosRoom <= BrunosRoom
Crystal_BrunosRoom_BrunoScript_BrunoBeforeText:
	.string "I am BRUNO of the\nELITE FOUR.\pI always train to\nthe extreme be-\ncause I believe in\nour potential.\pThat is how we\nbecame strong.\pCan you withstand\nour power?\pHm? I see no fear\nin you. You look\pdetermined. Per-\nfect for battle!\pReady, {PLAYER}?\nYou will bow down\pto our overwhelm-\ning power!\pHoo hah!$"

Crystal_BrunosRoom_BrunoScript_BrunoBeatenText:
	.string "Why? How could we\nlose?$"

Crystal_BrunosRoom_BrunoScript_BrunoDefeatText:
	.string "Having lost, I\nhave no right to\nsay anything…\pGo face your next\nchallenge!$"

