@ DarkCaveBlackthornEntrance <= DarkCaveBlackthornEntrance
Crystal_DarkCaveBlackthornEntrance_DarkCaveBlackthornEntrancePharmacistText1:
	.string "Whoa! You startled\nme there!\pI had my BLACK-\nGLASSES on, so I\pdidn't notice you\nat all.\pWhat am I doing\nhere?\pHey, don't you\nworry about it.\pI'll give you a\npair of BLACK-\nGLASSES, so forget\nyou saw me, OK?$"

Crystal_DarkCaveBlackthornEntrance_DarkCaveBlackthornEntrancePharmacistText2:
	.string "BLACKGLASSES ups\nthe power of dark-\ntype moves.$"

@ DayOfWeekSiblingsHouse <= DayOfWeekSiblingsHouse
Crystal_DayOfWeekSiblingsHouse_DayOfWeekSiblingsHousePokedexText1:
	.string "There's something\nwritten here.\pRead it?$"

Crystal_DayOfWeekSiblingsHouse_DayOfWeekSiblingsHousePokedexText2:
	.string "To my brothers and\nsisters:\pWe take pride in\nserving POKéMON\ntrainers.\pWhen trainers talk\nto you, give them\nsomething useful.\pLove,\nMONICA\pKeep reading?$"

Crystal_DayOfWeekSiblingsHouse_DayOfWeekSiblingsHousePokedexText3:
	.string "Monday, MONICA\nROUTE 40\pTuesday, TUSCANY\nROUTE 29\pWednesday, WESLEY\nLAKE OF RAGE\pThursday, ARTHUR\nROUTE 36\pFriday, FRIEDA\nROUTE 32\pSaturday, SANTOS\nBLACKTHORN CITY\pSunday, SUNNY\nROUTE 37$"

@ DragonShrine <= DragonShrine
Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineElderGreetingText:
	.string "Hm… Good to see\nyou here.\pNo need to explain\nwhy you came.\pCLAIR sent you\nhere, didn't she?\pThat girl is a\nhandful…\pI am sorry, but I\nmust test you.\pNot to worry, you\nare to answer only\na few questions.\pReady?$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineQuestion1Text:
	.string "What are POKéMON\nto you?$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineQuestion2Text:
	.string "What helps you to\nwin battles?$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineQuestion3Text:
	.string "What kind of\ntrainer do you\nwish to battle?$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineQuestion4Text:
	.string "What is most\nimportant for\nraising POKéMON?$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineQuestion5Text:
	.string "Strong POKéMON.\nWeak POKéMON.\pWhich is more\nimportant?$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrinePassedTestText:
	.string "Hm… I see…\pYou care deeply\nfor POKéMON.\pVery commendable.\pThat conviction is\nwhat is important!\p{PLAYER}, don't\nlose that belief.\pIt will see you\nthrough at the\nPOKéMON LEAGUE.$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineMustIInformLanceText:
	.string "CLAIR!\pThis child is\nimpeccable, in\nskill and spirit!\pAdmit defeat and\nconfer the RISING-\nBADGE!\p…Or must I inform\nLANCE of this?$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineElderScoldsClairText:
	.string "CLAIR…\pReflect upon what\nit is that you\plack and this\nchild has.$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineComeAgainText:
	.string "Come again, if you\nso desire.$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineTakeThisDratiniText:
	.string "Hm… Good to see\nyou here.\pYour arrival is\nmost fortunate.\pI have something\nfor you.\pTake this DRATINI\nas proof that I\phave recognized\nyour worth.$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrinePlayerReceivedDratiniText:
	.string "{PLAYER} received\nDRATINI!$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrinePartyFullText:
	.string "Hm? Your POKéMON\nparty is full.$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineSymbolicDragonText:
	.string "Dragon POKéMON are\nsymbolic of our\nclan.\pYou have shown\nthat you can be\pentrusted with\none.$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineClairsGrandfatherText:
	.string "CLAIR appears to\nhave learned an\pinvaluable lesson\nfrom you.\pI thank you as her\ngrandfather.$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineRivalIsInTrainingText:
	.string "A boy close to\nyour age is in\ntraining here.\pHe is much like\nCLAIR when she was\pyounger. It is a\nlittle worrisome…$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineWrongAnswerText1:
	.string "Hah? I didn't\nquite catch that…$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineWrongAnswerText2:
	.string "What was it you\nsaid?$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineRightAnswerText:
	.string "Oh, I understand…$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineElder2Text:
	.string "It's been quite\nsome time since a\ptrainer has gained\nour MASTER's rare\napproval.\pIn fact, not since\nMaster LANCE.$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineElder3Text:
	.string "You know young\nMaster LANCE?\pHe looks so much\nlike our MASTER\ndid in his youth.\pIt's in their\nblood.$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineClairYouPassedText:
	.string "So how did it go?\pI guess there's no\npoint in asking.\pYou did fail?\p<……><……><……><……><……><……>\p…What? You passed?$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineClairThatCantBeText:
	.string "That can't be!$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineClairYoureLyingText:
	.string "You're lying!\pEven I haven't\nbeen approved!$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineIUnderstandText:
	.string "I-I understand…$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineHereRisingBadgeText:
	.string "Here, this is the\nRISINGBADGE…\pHurry up! Take it!$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrinePlayerReceivedRisingBadgeText:
	.string "{PLAYER} received\nRISINGBADGE.$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineRisingBadgeExplanationText:
	.string "RISINGBADGE will\nenable your\pPOKéMON to use the\nmove for climbing\nwaterfalls.\pAlso, all POKéMON\nwill recognize you\pas a trainer and\nobey your every\pcommand without\nquestion.$"

Crystal_DragonShrine_DragonShrineSpeechlessText:
	.string "<……><……><……><……><……><……>$"

