@ DragonsDenB1F <= DragonsDenB1F
Crystal_DragonsDenB1F_ClairText_Wait:
	.string "Wait!$"

Crystal_DragonsDenB1F_ClairText_GiveDragonbreathDragonDen:
	.string "CLAIR: I'm sorry\nabout this.\pHere, take this as\nmy apology.$"

Crystal_DragonsDenB1F_Text_ReceivedTM24:
	.string "{PLAYER} received\nTM24.$"

Crystal_DragonsDenB1F_ClairText_DescribeDragonbreathDragonDen:
	.string "That contains\nDRAGONBREATH.\pNo, it doesn't\nhave anything to\ndo with my breath.\pIf you don't want\nit, you don't have\nto take it.$"

Crystal_DragonsDenB1F_ClairText_NoRoom:
	.string "Oh? You don't have\nany room for this.\pI'm going back to\nthe GYM, so make\proom, then come\nsee me there.$"

Crystal_DragonsDenB1F_ClairText_WhatsTheMatterDragonDen:
	.string "CLAIR: What's the\nmatter? Aren't you\pgoing on to the\nPOKéMON LEAGUE?\pDo you know how to\nget there?\pFrom here, go to\nNEW BARK TOWN.\pThen SURF east to\nPOKéMON LEAGUE.\pThe route there is\nvery tough.\pDon't you dare\nlose at the POKé-\nMON LEAGUE!\pIf you do, I'll\nfeel even worse\pabout having lost\nto you!\pGive it everything\nyou've got.$"

Crystal_DragonsDenB1F_DragonShrineSignpostText:
	.string "DRAGON SHRINE\pA shrine honoring\nthe dragon POKéMON\psaid to have lived\nin DRAGON'S DEN.$"

Crystal_DragonsDenB1F_RivalText_Training1:
	.string "…\nWhat? {PLAYER}?\p…No, I won't\nbattle you now…\pMy POKéMON aren't\nready to beat you.\pI can't push them\ntoo hard now.\pI have to be dis-\nciplined to become\pthe greatest POKé-\nMON trainer…$"

Crystal_DragonsDenB1F_RivalText_Training2:
	.string "…\pWhew…\pLearn to stay out\nof my way…$"

Crystal_DragonsDenB1F_CooltrainermDarinSeenText:
	.string "You! How dare you\nenter uninvited!$"

Crystal_DragonsDenB1F_CooltrainermDarinBeatenText:
	.string "S-strong!$"

Crystal_DragonsDenB1F_CooltrainermDarinAfterBattleText:
	.string "The SHRINE ahead\nis home to the\pMASTER of our\ndragon-user clan.\pYou're not allowed\nto just go in!$"

Crystal_DragonsDenB1F_CooltrainerfCaraSeenText:
	.string "You shouldn't be\nin here!$"

Crystal_DragonsDenB1F_CooltrainerfCaraBeatenText:
	.string "Oh yikes, I lost!$"

Crystal_DragonsDenB1F_CooltrainerfCaraAfterBattleText:
	.string "Soon I'm going to\nget permission\pfrom our MASTER to\nuse dragons.\pWhen I do, I'm\ngoing to become an\padmirable dragon\ntrainer and gain\pour MASTER's\napproval.$"

Crystal_DragonsDenB1F_TwinsLeaandpia1SeenText:
	.string "It's a stranger we\ndon't know.$"

Crystal_DragonsDenB1F_TwinsLeaandpia1BeatenText:
	.string "Ouchies.$"

Crystal_DragonsDenB1F_TwinsLeaandpia1AfterBattleText:
	.string "It was like having\nto battle LANCE.$"

Crystal_DragonsDenB1F_TwinsLeaandpia2SeenText:
	.string "Who are you?$"

Crystal_DragonsDenB1F_TwinsLeaandpia2BeatenText:
	.string "Meanie.$"

Crystal_DragonsDenB1F_TwinsLeaandpia2AfterBattleText:
	.string "We'll tell on you.\pMASTER will be\nangry with you.$"

