Crystal_IndigoPlateauPokecenter1F_IndigoPlateauPokecenter1FCooltrainerMText:
	.string "At the POKéMON\nLEAGUE, you'll get\ptested by the\nELITE FOUR.\pYou have to beat\nthem all. If you\plose, you have to\nstart all over!$"

Crystal_IndigoPlateauPokecenter1F_PlateauRivalText1:
	.string "Hold it.\pYou're going to\ntake the POKéMON\pLEAGUE challenge\nnow?\pThat's not going\nto happen.\pMy super-well-\ntrained POKéMON\pare going to pound\nyou.\p{PLAYER}!\nI challenge you!$"

Crystal_IndigoPlateauPokecenter1F_PlateauRivalWinText:
	.string "…\pOK--I lost…$"

Crystal_IndigoPlateauPokecenter1F_PlateauRivalText2:
	.string "…Darn… I still\ncan't win…\pI… I have to think\nmore about my\nPOKéMON…\pHumph! Try not to\nlose!$"

Crystal_IndigoPlateauPokecenter1F_PlateauRivalLoseText:
	.string "…\pWhew…\nWith my partners,\pI'm going to be\nthe CHAMPION!$"

Crystal_IndigoPlateauPokecenter1F_TeleportGuyText1:
	.string "Ah! You're chal-\nlenging the ELITE\pFOUR? Are you sure\nyou're ready?\pIf you need to\ntrain some more,\pmy ABRA can help\nyou.\pIt can TELEPORT\nyou home.\pWould you like to\ngo home now?$"

Crystal_IndigoPlateauPokecenter1F_TeleportGuyYesText:
	.string "OK, OK. Picture\nyour house in your\nmind…$"

Crystal_IndigoPlateauPokecenter1F_TeleportGuyNoText:
	.string "OK, OK. The best\nof luck to you!$"

Crystal_IndigoPlateauPokecenter1F_AbraText:
	.string "ABRA: Aabra…$"

