@ KarensRoom <= KarensRoom
Crystal_KarensRoom_KarenScript_KarenBeforeText:
	.string "I am KAREN of the\nELITE FOUR.\pYou're {PLAYER}?\nHow amusing.\pI love dark-type\nPOKéMON.\pI find their wild,\ntough image to be\pso appealing. And\nthey're so strong.\pThink you can take\nthem? Just try to\nentertain me.\pLet's go.$"

Crystal_KarensRoom_KarenScript_KarenBeatenText:
	.string "Well, aren't you\ngood. I like that\nin a trainer.$"

Crystal_KarensRoom_KarenScript_KarenDefeatText:
	.string "Strong POKéMON.\pWeak POKéMON.\pThat is only the\nselfish perception\nof people.\pTruly skilled\ntrainers should\ptry to win with\ntheir favorites.\pI like your style.\nYou understand\nwhat's important.\pGo on--the CHAM-\nPION is waiting.$"

Crystal_KarensRoom_KarensRoom_EnterMovement:
	walk_up
	walk_up
	walk_up
	walk_up
	step_end

@ KogasRoom <= KogasRoom
Crystal_KogasRoom_KogaScript_KogaBeforeText:
	.string "Fwahahahaha!\pI am KOGA of the\nELITE FOUR.\pI live in shadows,\na ninja!\pMy intricate style\nwill confound and\ndestroy you!\pConfusion, sleep,\npoison…\pPrepare to be the\nvictim of my sin-\nister technique!\pFwahahahaha!\pPOKéMON is not\nmerely about brute\pforce--you shall\nsee soon enough!$"

Crystal_KogasRoom_KogaScript_KogaBeatenText:
	.string "Ah!\nYou have proven\nyour worth!$"

Crystal_KogasRoom_KogaScript_KogaDefeatText:
	.string "I subjected you to\neverything I could\nmuster.\pBut my efforts\nfailed. I must\nhone my skills.\pGo on to the next\nroom, and put your\nabilities to test!$"

Crystal_KogasRoom_KogasRoom_EnterMovement:
	walk_up
	walk_up
	walk_up
	walk_up
	step_end

@ LakeOfRage <= LakeOfRage
Crystal_LakeOfRage_LakeOfRageLanceForcedToEvolveText:
	.string "This lake is full\nof GYARADOS but\nnothing else…\pSo the MAGIKARP\nare being forced\nto evolve…$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_LakeOfRageLanceIntroText:
	.string "Did you come here\nbecause of the\nrumors?\pYou're {PLAYER}?\nI'm LANCE, a\ntrainer like you.\pI heard some ru-\nmors, so I came to\ninvestigate…\pI saw the way you\nbattled earlier,\n{PLAYER}.\pI can tell that\nyou're a trainer\pwith considerable\nskill.\pIf you don't mind,\ncould you help me\ninvestigate?$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_LakeOfRageLanceRadioSignalText:
	.string "LANCE: Excellent!\pIt seems that the\nLAKE's MAGIKARP\pare being forced\nto evolve.\pA mysterious radio\nbroadcast coming\pfrom MAHOGANY is\nthe cause.\pI'll be waiting\nfor you, {PLAYER}.$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_LakeOfRageLanceRefusedText:
	.string "Oh… Well, if you\nchange your mind,\nplease help me.$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_LakeOfRageLanceAskHelpText:
	.string "LANCE: Hm? Are you\ngoing to help me?$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_LakeOfRageGyaradosCryText:
	.string "GYARADOS: Gyashaa!$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_LakeOfRageGotRedScaleText:
	.string "{PLAYER} obtained a\nRED SCALE.$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_LakeOfRageGrampsText:
	.string "The GYARADOS are\nangry!\pIt's a bad omen!$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_LakeOfRageGrampsText_ClearedRocketHideout:
	.string "Hahah! The MAGI-\nKARP are biting!$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_LakeOfRageSuperNerdText:
	.string "I heard this lake\nwas made by ram-\npaging GYARADOS.\pI wonder if there\nis any connection\pto their mass out-\nbreak now?$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_LakeOfRageCooltrainerFText:
	.string "Did my eyes de-\nceive me? I saw a\pred GYARADOS in\nthe LAKE…\pBut I thought\nGYARADOS were\nusually blue?$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_FisherAndreSeenText:
	.string "Let me battle with\nthe POKéMON I just\ncaught!$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_FisherAndreBeatenText:
	.string "I might be an ex-\npert angler, but\pI stink as a POKé-\nMON trainer…$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_FisherAndreAfterBattleText:
	.string "I won't lose as an\nangler! I catch\nPOKéMON all day.$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_FisherRaymondSeenText:
	.string "No matter what I\ndo, all I catch\pare the same POKé-\nMON…$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_FisherRaymondBeatenText:
	.string "My line's all\ntangled up…$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_FisherRaymondAfterBattleText:
	.string "Why can't I catch\nany good POKéMON?$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_CooltrainermAaronSeenText:
	.string "If a trainer spots\nanother trainer,\phe has to make a\nchallenge.\pThat is our\ndestiny.$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_CooltrainermAaronBeatenText:
	.string "Whew…\nGood battle.$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_CooltrainermAaronAfterBattleText:
	.string "POKéMON and their\ntrainer become\ppowerful through\nconstant battling.$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_CooltrainerfLoisSeenText:
	.string "What happened to\nthe red GYARADOS?\pIt's gone?\pOh, darn. I came\nhere for nothing?\pI know--let's\nbattle!$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_CooltrainerfLoisBeatenText:
	.string "Good going!$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_CooltrainerfLoisAfterBattleText:
	.string "Come to think of\nit, I've seen a\npink BUTTERFREE.$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_MeetWesleyText:
	.string "WESLEY: Well, how\ndo you do?\pSeeing as how it's\nWednesday today,\pI'm WESLEY of\nWednesday.$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_WesleyGivesGiftText:
	.string "Pleased to meet\nyou. Please take a\nsouvenir.$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_WesleyGaveGiftText:
	.string "WESLEY: BLACKBELT\nbeefs up the power\nof fighting moves.$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_WesleyWednesdayText:
	.string "WESLEY: Since you\nfound me, you must\phave met my broth-\ners and sisters.\pOr did you just\nget lucky?$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_WesleyNotWednesdayText:
	.string "WESLEY: Today's\nnot Wednesday.\nThat's too bad.$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_LakeOfRageSignText:
	.string "LAKE OF RAGE,\nalso known as\nGYARADOS LAKE.$"

Crystal_LakeOfRage_FishingGurusHouseSignText:
	.string "FISHING GURU'S\nHOUSE$"

@ LakeOfRageHiddenPowerHouse <= LakeOfRageHiddenPowerHouse
Crystal_LakeOfRageHiddenPowerHouse_HiddenPowerGuyText1:
	.string "…You have strayed\nfar…\pHere I have medi-\ntated. Inside me,\pa new power has\nbeen awakened.\pLet me share my\npower with your\pPOKéMON.\nTake this, child.$"

Crystal_LakeOfRageHiddenPowerHouse_HiddenPowerGuyText2:
	.string "Do you see it? It\nis HIDDEN POWER!\pIt draws out the\npower of POKéMON\nfor attacking.\pRemember this: its\ntype and power de-\npend on the POKé-\nMON using it.$"

Crystal_LakeOfRageHiddenPowerHouse_HiddenPowerGuyText3:
	.string "I am meditating…$"

@ LakeOfRageMagikarpHouse <= LakeOfRageMagikarpHouse
Crystal_LakeOfRageMagikarpHouse_MagikarpLengthRaterText_LakeOfRageHistory:
	.string "LAKE OF RAGE is\nactually a crater\pmade by rampaging\nGYARADOS.\pThe crater filled\nup with rainwater\pand the LAKE was\nformed.\pThat's the story\npassed on from my\pGrandpa's great-\ngreat-grandpa.\pIt used to be that\nyou could catch\plively MAGIKARP\nthere, but…\pI don't understand\nwhat's happening.$"

Crystal_LakeOfRageMagikarpHouse_MagikarpLengthRaterText_MenInBlack:
	.string "The LAKE hasn't\nbeen normal since\pthose men wearing\nblack arrived.$"

Crystal_LakeOfRageMagikarpHouse_MagikarpLengthRaterText_WorldsLargestMagikarp:
	.string "LAKE OF RAGE is\nback to normal.\pThe MAGIKARP have\nreturned.\pI may yet realize\nmy dream of see-\ning the world's\nlargest MAGIKARP.\pDo you have a ROD?\nPlease help me if\nyou do.$"

Crystal_LakeOfRageMagikarpHouse_MagikarpLengthRaterText_YouHaveAMagikarp:
	.string "Ah, you have a\nMAGIKARP! Let's\psee how big that\nbaby is.$"

Crystal_LakeOfRageMagikarpHouse_MagikarpLengthRaterText_Memento:
	.string "Wow! This one is\noutstanding!\pI tip my hat to\nyou!\pTake this as a\nmemento!$"

Crystal_LakeOfRageMagikarpHouse_MagikarpLengthRaterText_Bonus:
	.string "The record is the\nimportant thing.\pThink of that as\na bonus!$"

Crystal_LakeOfRageMagikarpHouse_MagikarpLengthRaterText_TooShort:
	.string "Wow! This one is\noutstanding!\p…I wish I could\nsay that, but I've\pseen a bigger one\nbefore.$"

Crystal_LakeOfRageMagikarpHouse_MagikarpLengthRaterText_NotMagikarp:
	.string "What? That's not a\nMAGIKARP!$"

Crystal_LakeOfRageMagikarpHouse_MagikarpLengthRaterText_Refused:
	.string "Oh… So you didn't\nget one good\penough to show me?\nMaybe next time.$"

@ skipped text asset LakeOfRageMagikarpHouseUnusedRecordText: unsupported commands text_ram wStringBuffer4, text_end
@ LancesRoom <= LancesRoom
Crystal_LancesRoom_LanceBattleIntroText:
	.string "LANCE: I've been\nwaiting for you.\p{PLAYER}!\pI knew that you,\nwith your skills,\pwould eventually\nreach me here.\pThere's no need\nfor words now.\pWe will battle to\ndetermine who is\pthe stronger of\nthe two of us.\pAs the most power-\nful trainer and as\pthe POKéMON LEAGUE\nCHAMPION…\pI, LANCE the drag-\non master, accept\nyour challenge!$"

Crystal_LancesRoom_LanceBattleWinText:
	.string "…It's over.\pBut it's an odd\nfeeling.\pI'm not angry that\nI lost. In fact, I\nfeel happy.\pHappy that I\nwitnessed the rise\pof a great new\nCHAMPION!$"

Crystal_LancesRoom_LanceBattleAfterText:
	.string "…Whew.\pYou have become\ntruly powerful,\n{PLAYER}.\pYour POKéMON have\nresponded to your\pstrong and up-\nstanding nature.\pAs a trainer, you\nwill continue to\pgrow strong with\nyour POKéMON.$"

Crystal_LancesRoom_LancesRoomMaryOhNoOakText:
	.string "MARY: Oh, no!\nIt's all over!\pPROF.OAK, if you\nweren't so slow…$"

Crystal_LancesRoom_LancesRoomOakCongratulationsText:
	.string "PROF.OAK: Ah,\n{PLAYER}!\pIt's been a long\nwhile.\pYou certainly look\nmore impressive.\pYour conquest of\nthe LEAGUE is just\nfantastic!\pYour dedication,\ntrust and love for\pyour POKéMON made\nthis happen.\pYour POKéMON were\noutstanding too.\pBecause they be-\nlieved in you as a\ptrainer, they per-\nsevered.\pCongratulations,\n{PLAYER}!$"

Crystal_LancesRoom_LancesRoomMaryInterviewText:
	.string "MARY: Let's inter-\nview the brand new\nCHAMPION!$"

Crystal_LancesRoom_LancesRoomNoisyText:
	.string "LANCE: This is\ngetting to be a\nbit too noisy…\p{PLAYER}, could you\ncome with me?$"

Crystal_LancesRoom_LancesRoomMaryNoInterviewText:
	.string "MARY: Oh, wait!\nWe haven't done\nthe interview!$"

