@ MahoganyGym <= MahoganyGym
Crystal_MahoganyGym_PryceText_Intro:
	.string "POKéMON have many\nexperiences in\ptheir lives, just \nlike we do. \pI, too, have seen\nand suffered much\nin my life.\pSince I am your\nelder, let me show\nyou what I mean.\pI have been with\nPOKéMON since\pbefore you were\nborn.\pI do not lose\neasily.\pI, PRYCE--the\nwinter trainer--\pshall demonstrate\nmy power!$"

Crystal_MahoganyGym_PryceText_Impressed:
	.string "Ah, I am impressed\nby your prowess.\pWith your strong\nwill, I know you\pwill overcome all\nlife's obstacles.\pYou are worthy of\nthis BADGE!$"

Crystal_MahoganyGym_Text_ReceivedGlacierBadge:
	.string "{PLAYER} received\nGLACIERBADGE.$"

Crystal_MahoganyGym_PryceText_GlacierBadgeSpeech:
	.string "That BADGE will\nraise the SPECIAL\nstats of POKéMON.\pIt also lets your\nPOKéMON use WHIRL-\nPOOL to get across\nreal whirlpools.\pAnd this… This is\na gift from me!$"

Crystal_MahoganyGym_PryceText_IcyWindSpeech:
	.string "That TM contains\nICY WIND.\pIt inflicts damage\nand lowers speed.\pIt demonstrates\nthe harshness of\nwinter.$"

Crystal_MahoganyGym_PryceText_CherishYourPokemon:
	.string "When the ice and\nsnow melt, spring\narrives.\pYou and your POKé-\nMON will be to-\pgether for many\nyears to come.\pCherish your time\ntogether!$"

Crystal_MahoganyGym_BoarderRonaldSeenText:
	.string "I'll freeze your\nPOKéMON, so you\ncan't do a thing!$"

Crystal_MahoganyGym_BoarderRonaldBeatenText:
	.string "Darn. I couldn't\ndo a thing.$"

Crystal_MahoganyGym_BoarderRonaldAfterBattleText:
	.string "I think there's a\nmove a POKéMON\pcan use while it's\nfrozen.$"

Crystal_MahoganyGym_BoarderBradSeenText:
	.string "This GYM has a\nslippery floor.\pIt's fun, isn't\nit?\pBut hey--we're\nnot playing games\nhere!$"

Crystal_MahoganyGym_BoarderBradBeatenText:
	.string "Do you see how\nserious we are?$"

Crystal_MahoganyGym_BoarderBradAfterBattleText:
	.string "This GYM is great.\nI love boarding\nwith my POKéMON!$"

Crystal_MahoganyGym_BoarderDouglasSeenText:
	.string "I know PRYCE's\nsecret.$"

Crystal_MahoganyGym_BoarderDouglasBeatenText:
	.string "OK. I'll tell you\nPRYCE's secret.$"

Crystal_MahoganyGym_BoarderDouglasAfterBattleText:
	.string "The secret behind\nPRYCE's power…\pHe meditates under\na waterfall daily\pto strengthen his\nmind and body.$"

Crystal_MahoganyGym_SkierRoxanneSeenText:
	.string "To get to PRYCE,\nour GYM LEADER,\pyou need to think\nbefore you skate.$"

Crystal_MahoganyGym_SkierRoxanneBeatenText:
	.string "I wouldn't lose to\nyou in skiing!$"

Crystal_MahoganyGym_SkierRoxanneAfterBattleText:
	.string "If you don't skate\nwith precision,\pyou won't get far\nin this GYM.$"

Crystal_MahoganyGym_SkierClarissaSeenText:
	.string "Check out my\nparallel turn!$"

Crystal_MahoganyGym_SkierClarissaBeatenText:
	.string "No! You made me\nwipe out!$"

Crystal_MahoganyGym_SkierClarissaAfterBattleText:
	.string "I shouldn't have\nbeen bragging\nabout my skiing…$"

Crystal_MahoganyGym_MahoganyGymGuideText:
	.string "PRYCE is a veteran\nwho has trained\pPOKéMON for some\n50 years.\pHe's said to be\ngood at freezing\popponents with\nice-type moves.\pThat means you\nshould melt him\pwith your burning\nambition!$"

Crystal_MahoganyGym_MahoganyGymGuideWinText:
	.string "PRYCE is some-\nthing, but you're\nsomething else!\pThat was a hot\nbattle that\pbridged the gen-\neration gap!$"

@ MahoganyMart1F <= MahoganyMart1F
Crystal_MahoganyMart1F_MahoganyMart1FRageCandyBarText:
	.string "Hello, kiddo!\pHow would you like\nsome RAGECANDYBAR?\pIt's the thing to\neat in MAHOGANY!$"

Crystal_MahoganyMart1F_MahoganyMart1FPharmacistText_LanceEntered:
	.string "Arrgh… You found\nthe secret stair-\nway…$"

Crystal_MahoganyMart1F_MahoganyMart1FBlackBeltText:
	.string "Heheh! The experi-\nment worked like a\ncharm.\pMAGIKARP are just\nworthless, but\pGYARADOS are big\nmoneymakers.$"

Crystal_MahoganyMart1F_MahoganyMart1FBlackBeltText_LanceEntered:
	.string "Urrgh…\pThat guy's dragon\nPOKéMON are tough…$"

Crystal_MahoganyMart1F_MahoganyMart1FLanceDragoniteHyperBeamText:
