Crystal_MahoganyPokecenter1F_MahoganyPokecenter1FPokefanMText:
	.string "What's this? TEAM\nROCKET has come\nback?\pI saw some men in\nblack at LAKE OF\nRAGE…$"

Crystal_MahoganyPokecenter1F_MahoganyPokecenter1FYoungsterText:
	.string "I stop my POKéMON\nfrom evolving too\nearly.\pI make them learn\ncertain moves be-\nfore I let them\nevolve.$"

Crystal_MahoganyPokecenter1F_MahoganyPokecenter1FCooltrainerFText:
	.string "POKéMON do become\nstronger when they\pevolve, but they\nalso learn moves\nmore slowly.$"

@ MahoganyRedGyaradosSpeechHouse <= MahoganyRedGyaradosSpeechHouse
Crystal_MahoganyRedGyaradosSpeechHouse_MahoganyRedGyaradosSpeechHouseBlackBeltText:
	.string "I heard that a red\nGYARADOS appeared\nat the LAKE.\pThat's odd, since\neven ordinary\pGYARADOS are rare\nin that lake…$"

Crystal_MahoganyRedGyaradosSpeechHouse_MahoganyRedGyaradosSpeechHouseTeacherText:
	.string "My favorite radio\nprogram? I'd say\nPOKéMON MUSIC.$"

Crystal_MahoganyRedGyaradosSpeechHouse_MahoganyRedGyaradosSpeechHouseTeacherText_RocketsInRadioTower:
	.string "I've been hearing\nlaughter on the\pradio…\nIt's creepy.$"

@ MahoganyTown <= MahoganyTown
Crystal_MahoganyTown_RageCandyBarMerchantTryOneText:
	.string "Hiya, kid!\pI see you're new\nin MAHOGANY TOWN.\pSince you're new,\nyou should try a\pyummy RAGECANDY-\nBAR!\pRight now, it can\nbe yours for just\n¥300! Want one?$"

Crystal_MahoganyTown_RageCandyBarMerchantSavorItText:
	.string "Good! Savor it!$"

Crystal_MahoganyTown_RageCandyBarMerchantNotEnoughMoneyText:
	.string "You don't have\nenough money.$"

Crystal_MahoganyTown_RageCandyBarMerchantRefusedText:
	.string "Oh, fine then…$"

Crystal_MahoganyTown_RageCandyBarMerchantNoRoomText:
	.string "You don't have\nroom for this.$"

Crystal_MahoganyTown_RageCandyBarMerchantSoldOutText:
	.string "RAGECANDYBAR's\nsold out.\pI'm packing up.\nDon't bother me,\nkiddo.$"

Crystal_MahoganyTown_MahoganyTownGrampsText:
	.string "Are you off to see\nthe GYARADOS ram-\npage at the LAKE?$"

Crystal_MahoganyTown_MahoganyTownGrampsText_ClearedRocketHideout:
