Crystal_RadioTower1F_RadioTower1FReceptionistNoToursText:
	.string "Hello. I'm sorry,\nbut we're not\noffering any tours\ntoday.$"

Crystal_RadioTower1F_RadioTower1FLuckyNumberManAskToPlayText:
	.string "Hi, are you here\nfor the LUCKY NUM-\nBER SHOW?\pWant me to check\nthe ID numbers of\nyour POKéMON?\pIf you get lucky,\nyou win a prize.$"

Crystal_RadioTower1F_RadioTower1FLuckyNumberManThisWeeksIdIsText:
