Crystal_RadioTower1F_RadioTower1FLuckyNumberManNoRoomForYourPrizeText:
	.string "You've got no room\nfor your prize.\pMake room and come\nback right away.$"

Crystal_RadioTower1F_RadioTower1FRadioCardWomanOfferQuizText:
	.string "We have a special\nquiz campaign on\nright now.\pAnswer five ques-\ntions correctly to\nwin a RADIO CARD.\pSlide it into your\nPOKENAV to play\pthe radio anytime,\nanywhere.\pWould you like to\ntake the quiz?$"

Crystal_RadioTower1F_RadioTower1FRadioCardWomanQuestion1Text:
	.string "Question 1:\pIs there a POKéMON\nthat appears only\nin the morning?$"

Crystal_RadioTower1F_RadioTower1FRadioCardWomanQuestion2Text:
	.string "Correct!\nQuestion 2:\pIs this statement\ncorrect?\pYou can't buy a\nBERRY at a MART.$"

Crystal_RadioTower1F_RadioTower1FRadioCardWomanQuestion3Text:
	.string "Bull's-eye!\nQuestion 3:\pDoes HM01 contain\nthe move FLASH?$"

Crystal_RadioTower1F_RadioTower1FRadioCardWomanQuestion4Text:
	.string "So far so good!\nQuestion 4:\pIs FALKNER the\nVIOLET GYM LEADER\pwho uses bird\nPOKéMON?$"

Crystal_RadioTower1F_RadioTower1FRadioCardWomanQuestion5Text:
	.string "Wow! Right again!\nHere's the final\nquestion:\pDo GOLDENROD GAME\nCORNER's slots\phave CHARMANDER\non their reels?$"

Crystal_RadioTower1F_RadioTower1FRadioCardWomanYouWinText:
	.string "Bingo! You got it!\nCongratulations!\pHere's your prize,\na RADIO CARD!$"

Crystal_RadioTower1F_RadioTower1FPokegearIsARadioText:
	.string "{PLAYER}'s POKENAV\ncan now double as\na radio!$"

Crystal_RadioTower1F_RadioTower1FRadioCardWomanTuneInText:
	.string "Please tune in to\nour radio shows.$"

Crystal_RadioTower1F_RadioTower1FRadioCardWomanWrongAnswerText:
	.string "Oh, dear.\nSorry, but you\pgot it wrong.\nPlease try again!$"

Crystal_RadioTower1F_RadioTower1FRadioCardWomanNotTakingQuizText:
	.string "Oh. I see. Please\nsee me if you\nchange your mind.$"

Crystal_RadioTower1F_RadioTower1FLassText:
	.string "BEN is a fabulous\nDJ.\pHis sweet voice\nmakes me melt!$"

Crystal_RadioTower1F_RadioTower1FYoungsterText:
	.string "I love MARY, from\nPOKéMON TALK.\pI only know what\nshe sounds like,\nthough.$"

Crystal_RadioTower1F_GruntM3SeenText:
	.string "We've finally\ntaken over the\nRADIO TOWER!\pNow everyone will\nget to experience\pthe true terror of\nTEAM ROCKET!\pWe'll show you\nhow scary we are!$"

Crystal_RadioTower1F_GruntM3BeatenText:
	.string "Too strong! We\nmust watch you…$"

Crystal_RadioTower1F_GruntM3AfterBattleText:
	.string "You're too strong.\pOur plan could be\nruined. I must\nwarn the others…$"

Crystal_RadioTower1F_RadioTower1FDirectoryText:
	.string "1F RECEPTION\n2F SALES\p3F PERSONNEL\n4F PRODUCTION\p5F DIRECTOR'S\n   OFFICE$"

Crystal_RadioTower1F_RadioTower1FLuckyChannelSignText:
	.string "LUCKY CHANNEL!\pWin with POKéMON\nID numbers!\pTrade your POKéMON\nto collect differ-\nent ID numbers!$"

