@ RadioTower2F <= RadioTower2F
Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FSuperNerdText:
	.string "You can listen to\nthe radio any-\nwhere. Tune in!$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FTeacherText:
	.string "Lullabies on the\nradio may make\nPOKéMON sleep.$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FTeacherText_Rockets:
	.string "Why would they\nwant to take over\nthe RADIO TOWER?$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTowerJigglypuffText:
	.string "JIGGLYPUFF:\nJiggly…$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBlackBelt1Text:
	.string "Sorry. Authorized\npersonnel only\nbeyond this point.\pIt wasn't that way\nbefore.\pThere's something\nwrong with the\nDIRECTOR…$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBlackBelt2Text:
	.string "Feel free to look\naround anywhere.\pThe DIRECTOR is\nnice again, just\nas he was before.$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_GruntM4SeenText:
	.string "Three years ago,\nTEAM ROCKET was\nforced to disband.\pBut we're making a\ncomeback here!$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_GruntM4BeatenText:
	.string "Gwah! Don't get\ncute!$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_GruntM4AfterBattleText:
	.string "We won't let you\nruin our plans\nfor our comeback!$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_GruntM5SeenText:
	.string "We're TEAM ROCKET,\nthe exploiters of\nPOKéMON!\pWe love being\nevil! Scared?$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_GruntM5BeatenText:
	.string "You think you're a\nhero?$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_GruntM5AfterBattleText:
	.string "We're not always\nevil. We just do\nwhatever we like.$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_GruntM6SeenText:
	.string "Hey, hey! Keep out\nof our way!$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_GruntM6BeatenText:
	.string "Arggh. I give up.$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_GruntM6AfterBattleText:
	.string "Our EXECUTIVES are\ntrying to take\nthis place over.\pThey have some big\nplan. I wonder\nwhat that is?$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_GruntF2SeenText:
	.string "Hahaha!\pHow boring.\nIt was far too\peasy to take over\nthis place!\pCome on, keep me\namused!$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_GruntF2BeatenText:
	.string "Wh-who are you?$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_GruntF2AfterBattleText:
	.string "You beat me, and\nI won't forget it!$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBuenaShowIntroductionText:
	.string "BUENA: Hi! I'm\nBUENA!\pDo you know about\na radio program\ncalled PASSWORD?\pIf you can tell me\nthe password from\pthe program, you\nwill earn points.\pSave up those\npoints and trade\pthem to that sweet\nyoung lady over\pthere for some\nchoice prizes!\pHere you go!\pIt's your very own\npoint card!$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBuenaTuneInToMyShowText:
	.string "BUENA: Tune in to\nmy PASSWORD SHOW!$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBuenaDoYouKnowPasswordText:
	.string "BUENA: Hi!\nDid you tune in to\nmy radio show?\pDo you remember\ntoday's password?$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBuenaJoinTheShowText:
	.string "BUENA: Oh, wow!\nThank you!\pWhat was your name\nagain?\p…{PLAYER}, OK!\pCome on, {PLAYER}.\nJoin the show.$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBuenaEveryoneSayPasswordText:
	.string "BUENA: Everyone\nready?\pI want to hear you\nshout out today's\ppassword for\n{PLAYER}!$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBuenaComeBackAfterListeningText:
	.string "BUENA: Come back\nafter you listen\pto my show, OK?\nCatch ya later!$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBuenaAlreadyPlayedText:
	.string "BUENA: Sorry…\pYou get just one\nchance each day.\pCome back tomorrow\nfor another try!$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBuenaCorrectAnswerText:
	.string "BUENA: YIPPEE!\nThat's right!\pYou did tune in!\nI'm so happy!\pYou earned one\npoint! Congrats!$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBuenaDidYouForgetText:
	.string "BUENA: Aww…\nThat's not it…\pDid you forget the\npassword?$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBuenaThanksForComingText:
	.string "BUENA: Yup! Our\ncontestant was\p{PLAYER}.\nThanks for coming!\pI hope all you\nlisteners will\pcome too!\nI'll be waiting!$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBuenaPasswordIsHelpText:
	.string "BUENA: Huh?\nToday's password?\pHELP, of course!$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBuenaCardIsFullText:
	.string "BUENA: Your BLUE\nCARD's full.\pTrade it in for a\nfabulous prize!$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBuenaTuneInAfterSixText:
	.string "BUENA: Tune in to\nPASSWORD every\pnight from six to\nmidnight!\pTune in, then drop\nin for a visit!$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBuenaNoBlueCardText:
	.string "BUENA: Oh? You\nforgot to bring\nyour BLUE CARD?\pI can't give you\npoints if you\ndon't have it.$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBuenaOfferPhoneNumberText:
	.string "BUENA: Oh! Your\nBLUE CARD reached\p30 points today!\nThat's so wild!\pHmm… There isn't a\nprize for hitting\n30 points, but…\pYou came by so\noften, {PLAYER}.\pI'll make you a\nspecial deal!\pHow would you like\nmy phone number?$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBuenaOfferNumberAgainText:
	.string "BUENA: {PLAYER},\ndo you want to\pregister my phone\nnumber?$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FRegisteredBuenasNumberText:
	.string "{PLAYER} registered\nBUENA's number.$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBuenaCallMeText:
	.string "BUENA: I look\nforward to hearing\nfrom you!$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBuenaSadRejectedText:
	.string "BUENA: Aww… It's a\nspecial prize…$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBuenaYourPhoneIsFullText:
	.string "BUENA: {PLAYER},\nyour phone list\phas no room left\nfor me…$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBuenaReceptionistPointsForPrizesText:
	.string "You can cash in\nyour saved points\pfor a lovely prize\nof your choice!$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FBuenaReceptionistNoCardText:
	.string "You can't trade in\npoints without\nyour BLUE CARD.\pDon't forget your\nBLUE CARD!$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FSalesSignText:
	.string "2F SALES$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FOaksPKMNTalkSignText:
	.string "PROF.OAK'S POKéMON\nTALK\pThe Hottest Show\non the Air!$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FPokemonRadioSignText:
	.string "Anywhere, Anytime\nPOKéMON Radio$"

Crystal_RadioTower2F_RadioTower2FPlayerWalksToMicrophoneMovement:
	walk_slow_down
	walk_slow_right
	step_end

@ RadioTower3F <= RadioTower3F
Crystal_RadioTower3F_RadioTower3FSuperNerdText:
	.string "We have recordings\nof the cries of\pall POKéMON that\nhave been found.\pWe must have about\n200 kinds.$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_RadioTower3FGymGuideText_Rockets:
	.string "To trainers, POKé-\nMON are their\nbeloved partners.\pIt's terrible how\nTEAM ROCKET is\ptrying to control\nPOKéMON.$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_RadioTower3FGymGuideText:
	.string "We run 24 hours a\nday to broadcast\pentertaining pro-\ngrams.\pI'll do my best to\nrun around the\nclock too!$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_RadioTower3FCooltrainerFPleaseSaveDirectorText:
	.string "The TEAM ROCKET\nboss has locked\nhimself in.\pBut the DIRECTOR\ncan open it.\pHe's up on the\nfifth floor.\pPlease save him!$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_RadioTower3FCooltrainerFIsDirectorSafeText:
	.string "Is the DIRECTOR\nsafe?$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_RadioTower3FCooltrainerFYoureMyHeroText:
	.string "Thank you!\nYou're my hero!\pThis is a token of\nmy appreciation.$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_RadioTower3FCooltrainerFItsSunnyDayText:
	.string "It's SUNNY DAY.\nIt powers up fire-\ntype moves for a\nwhile.$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_RadioTower3FCooltrainerFYouWereMarvelousText:
	.string "You were simply\nmarvelous!$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_GruntM7SeenText:
	.string "I've been given\nstrict orders.\pI'm to crush any-\none who challenges\nTEAM ROCKET!$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_GruntM7BeatenText:
	.string "What?!$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_GruntM7AfterBattleText:
	.string "I failed in my\nduties…\pI'll be docked pay\nfor this…$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_GruntM8SeenText:
	.string "It feels great\nordering POKéMON\nto commit crimes.$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_GruntM8BeatenText:
	.string "You're kidding!$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_GruntM8AfterBattleText:
	.string "I feel lousy over\nlosing!\pDarn it! I hate\nuseless POKéMON!$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_GruntM9SeenText:
	.string "Why did the shut-\nter open? Did you\phave something to\ndo with this?$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_GruntM9BeatenText:
	.string "I'm done for!$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_GruntM9AfterBattleText:
	.string "What?! You made it\npast our men in\nthe UNDERGROUND?\pHow could you?$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_ScientistMarcSeenText:
	.string "An unknown child\nwandering here?\pWho are you?$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_ScientistMarcBeatenText:
	.string "Tch! I took you\ntoo lightly!$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_ScientistMarcAfterBattleText:
	.string "Bwahahaha…\pI can transmit as\nstrong a signal as\nI need from here.$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_RadioTower3FCardKeySlotText:
	.string "It's the CARD KEY\nslot.$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_InsertedTheCardKeyText:
	.string "{PLAYER} inserted\nthe CARD KEY.$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_RadioTower3FPersonnelSignText:
	.string "3F PERSONNEL$"

Crystal_RadioTower3F_RadioTower3FPokemonMusicSignText:
	.string "POKéMON MUSIC with\nHost DJ BEN$"

@ RadioTower4F <= RadioTower4F
Crystal_RadioTower4F_RadioTower4FFisherText:
	.string "I listened to the\nradio while I was\nat the RUINS.\pI heard a strange\nbroadcast there.$"

Crystal_RadioTower4F_RadioTower4FDJMaryText:
	.string "MARY: Why? Why do\nI have to suffer\nthrough this?\pMEOWTH, help me!$"

Crystal_RadioTower4F_RadioTower4FDJMaryText_ClearedRockets:
	.string "MARY: Oh! You're\nmy little savior!\pWill you take this\nas my thanks?$"

Crystal_RadioTower4F_RadioTower4FDJMaryText_GivePinkBow:
	.string "MARY: It's just\nright for POKéMON\pthat know normal-\ntype moves.$"

Crystal_RadioTower4F_RadioTower4FDJMaryText_After:
	.string "MARY: Please tune\ninto me on PROF.\pOAK'S POKéMON TALK\nshow.$"

Crystal_RadioTower4F_RadioTowerMeowthText:
	.string "MEOWTH: Meowth…$"

Crystal_RadioTower4F_GruntM10SeenText:
	.string "You plan to rescue\nthe DIRECTOR?\pThat won't be pos-\nsible because I'm\ngoing to beat you!$"

Crystal_RadioTower4F_GruntM10BeatenText:
	.string "No! Unbelievable!$"

Crystal_RadioTower4F_GruntM10AfterBattleText:
	.string "I don't believe\nit! I was beaten!$"

Crystal_RadioTower4F_Executivem2SeenText:
	.string "Stop! I'm known as\nthe TEAM ROCKET\nfortress!\pYou're not taking\nanother step!$"

Crystal_RadioTower4F_Executivem2BeatenText:
	.string "The fortress came\ndown!$"

Crystal_RadioTower4F_Executivem2AfterBattleText:
	.string "You've earned my\nrespect, so here's\nsome advice.\pIt's not too late.\nYou can still turn\nback.$"

Crystal_RadioTower4F_GruntF4SeenText:
	.string "Don't I think\nPOKéMON are cute?\pI'll think my\nPOKéMON are cute--\pafter they beat\nyours!$"

Crystal_RadioTower4F_GruntF4BeatenText:
	.string "Oh, no! They're so\nuseless!$"

Crystal_RadioTower4F_GruntF4AfterBattleText:
	.string "I love my\nbeautiful self!\pWho cares about\nPOKéMON?$"

Crystal_RadioTower4F_ScientistRichSeenText:
	.string "Most excellent.\pThis RADIO TOWER\nwill fulfill our\ngrand design.$"

Crystal_RadioTower4F_ScientistRichBeatenText:
	.string "Hmmm…\pAll grand plans\ncome with snags.$"

Crystal_RadioTower4F_ScientistRichAfterBattleText:
	.string "Do you honestly\nbelieve you can\nstop TEAM ROCKET?$"

Crystal_RadioTower4F_RadioTower4FProductionSignText:
	.string "4F PRODUCTION$"

Crystal_RadioTower4F_RadioTower4FStudio2SignText:
	.string "4F STUDIO 2$"

@ RadioTower5F <= RadioTower5F
Crystal_RadioTower5F_FakeDirectorTextBefore1:
	.string "Y-you! You came to\nrescue me?$"

Crystal_RadioTower5F_FakeDirectorTextBefore2:
	.string "Is that what you\nwere expecting?\pWrong!\nI'm an imposter!\pI pretended to be\nthe real thing to\pprepare for our\ntakeover.\pDo you want to\nknow where we hid\nthe real DIRECTOR?\pSure, I'll tell\nyou. But only if\nyou can beat me!$"

Crystal_RadioTower5F_FakeDirectorWinText:
	.string "OK, OK. I'll tell\nyou where he is.$"

Crystal_RadioTower5F_FakeDirectorTextAfter:
	.string "We stashed the\nreal DIRECTOR in\pthe UNDERGROUND\nWAREHOUSE.\pIt's at the far\nend of the UNDER-\nGROUND.\pBut I doubt you'll\nget that far.$"

Crystal_RadioTower5F_Executivef1SeenText:
	.string "Remember me from\nthe HIDEOUT in\nMAHOGANY TOWN?\pI lost then, but I\nwon't this time.$"

Crystal_RadioTower5F_Executivef1BeatenText:
	.string "This can't be\nhappening!\pI fought hard, but\nI still lost…$"

Crystal_RadioTower5F_Executivef1AfterBattleText:
	.string "{PLAYER}, isn't it?\pA brat like you\nwon't appreciate\pthe magnificence\nof TEAM ROCKET.\pThat's too bad.\nI really admire\nyour power.$"

Crystal_RadioTower5F_RadioTower5FRocketBossBeforeText:
	.string "Oh? You managed to\nget this far?\pYou must be quite\nthe trainer.\pWe intend to take\nover this RADIO\pSTATION and an-\nnounce our come-\nback.\pThat should bring\nour boss GIOVANNI\pback from his solo\ntraining.\pWe are going to\nregain our former\nglory.\pI won't allow you\nto interfere with\nour plans.$"

Crystal_RadioTower5F_RadioTower5FRocketBossWinText:
	.string "No! Forgive me,\nGIOVANNI!$"

Crystal_RadioTower5F_RadioTower5FRocketBossAfterText:
	.string "How could this be?\pOur dreams have\ncome to naught.\pI wasn't up to the\ntask after all.\pLike GIOVANNI did\nbefore me, I will\pdisband TEAM\nROCKET here today.\pFarewell.$"

Crystal_RadioTower5F_RadioTower5FDirectorThankYouText:
	.string "DIRECTOR: {PLAYER},\nthank you!\pYour courageous\nactions have saved\pPOKéMON nation-\nwide.\pI know it's not\nmuch, but please\ntake this.$"

Crystal_RadioTower5F_RadioTower5FDirectorDescribeClearBellText:
	.string "There used to be a\ntower right here\nin GOLDENROD CITY.\pBut it was old and\ncreaky.\pSo we replaced it\nwith our RADIO\nTOWER.\pWe dug up that\nbell during\nconstruction.\pI heard that all\nsorts of POKéMON\plived in GOLDENROD\nin the past.\pPerhaps…\pThat bell has some\nconnection to the\pTIN TOWER in\nECRUTEAK CITY…\pAh!\pThat reminds me…\pI overheard TEAM\nROCKET whispering.\pApparently, some-\nthing is going on\nat the TIN TOWER.\pI have no idea\nwhat is happening,\pbut you might look\ninto it.\pOK, I better go to\nmy OFFICE.$"

Crystal_RadioTower5F_RadioTower5FDirectorText:
	.string "DIRECTOR: Hello,\n{PLAYER}!\pYou know, I love\nPOKéMON.\pI built this RADIO\nTOWER so I could\pexpress my love\nof POKéMON.\pIt would be nice\nif people enjoyed\nour programs.$"

Crystal_RadioTower5F_BenText:
	.string "BEN: Do you listen\nto our music?$"

Crystal_RadioTower5F_RadioTower5FDirectorsOfficeSignText:
	.string "5F DIRECTOR'S\n   OFFICE$"

Crystal_RadioTower5F_RadioTower5FStudio1SignText:
	.string "5F STUDIO 1$"

Crystal_RadioTower5F_FakeDirectorMovement:
	walk_left
	walk_left
	walk_left
	walk_up
