@ Route26 <= Route26
Crystal_Route26_CooltrainermJakeSeenText:
	.string "I'm making my\nfinal preparations\pfor the POKéMON\nLEAGUE.$"

Crystal_Route26_CooltrainermJakeBeatenText:
	.string "I blew it!$"

Crystal_Route26_CooltrainermJakeAfterBattleText:
	.string "It's going to be\ntough to win at\nthe LEAGUE.\pI need to do some\nmore training.\pI hear that the\nLEAGUE's ELITE\pFOUR are tougher\nthan GYM LEADERS.$"

Crystal_Route26_CooltrainermGaven3SeenText:
	.string "By experiencing\ntough battles, you\ngain power.$"

Crystal_Route26_CooltrainermGaven3BeatenText:
	.string "Gaah! Life is even\ntougher!$"

Crystal_Route26_CooltrainermGavenAfterText:
	.string "To get to POKéMON\nLEAGUE, you have\pto get through\nVICTORY ROAD.\pBut VICTORY ROAD\nis tough.\pPractically nobody\ngoes there!$"

Crystal_Route26_CooltrainerfJoyceSeenText:
	.string "Since you've come\nthis far, you must\nbe good.\pI'm going to give\nthis battle every-\nthing I've got!$"

Crystal_Route26_CooltrainerfJoyceBeatenText:
	.string "No! I don't\nbelieve this!$"

Crystal_Route26_CooltrainerfJoyceAfterBattleText:
	.string "I've defeated\neight GYM LEADERS,\pso I was feeling\nconfident.\pI'll have to try\nharder next time.$"

Crystal_Route26_CooltrainerfBeth1SeenText:
	.string "I lost to a train-\ner named <RIVAL>.\pHe was really\nstrong, but…\pIt was as if he\nabsolutely had to\nwin at any cost.\pI felt sorry for\nhis POKéMON.$"

Crystal_Route26_CooltrainerfBeth1BeatenText:
	.string "POKéMON aren't\ntools of war.$"

Crystal_Route26_CooltrainerfBethAfterText:
	.string "POKéMON are in-\nvaluable, lifelong\npartners.$"

Crystal_Route26_PsychicRichardSeenText:
	.string "Wow, look at all\nthose BADGES!\nI'm impressed.\pBut you're not\nsatisfied by just\pcollecting them,\nright?$"

Crystal_Route26_PsychicRichardBeatenText:
	.string "Good battle!$"

Crystal_Route26_PsychicRichardAfterBattleText:
	.string "People and POKéMON\ngrow from their\nexperiences.\pDon't get lazy and\ncomplacent.$"

Crystal_Route26_FisherScottSeenText:
	.string "I'm feeling great\ntoday!\pI feel like I\ncould boot even\nthe LEAGUE CHAMP!$"

Crystal_Route26_FisherScottBeatenText:
	.string "No! Not in this\nbattle!$"

Crystal_Route26_FisherScottAfterBattleText:
	.string "Just like in fish-\ning, it's all over\pin POKéMON if you\ngive up.$"

Crystal_Route26_Route26SignText:
	.string "ROUTE 26\pPOKéMON LEAGUE\nRECEPTION GATE$"

@ Route26HealHouse <= Route26HealHouse
