@ Route27SandstormHouse <= Route27SandstormHouse
Crystal_Route27SandstormHouse_SandstormHouseWomanText1:
	.string "Where are you off\nto with POKéMON?\pPOKéMON LEAGUE?\pAre your POKéMON\nloyal enough for\nyou to win?\pLet me see…$"

Crystal_Route27SandstormHouse_SandstormHouseWomanLoyalText:
	.string "Ah! Your POKéMON\ntrusts you very\nmuch.\pIt's nice to see a\ngood trainer.\pHere. A gift for\nyour journey.$"

Crystal_Route27SandstormHouse_SandstormHouseSandstormDescription:
	.string "TM37 happens to be\nSANDSTORM.\pIt's a move that\ninflicts damage on\nboth battlers.\pIt's for advanced\ntrainers only.\pUse it if you\ndare. Good luck!$"

Crystal_Route27SandstormHouse_SandstormHouseWomanDisloyalText:
	.string "If it doesn't come\nto trust you some\pmore, it could be\ntough going.\pTrust is the tie\nthat binds POKéMON\nand trainers.$"

@ Route43 <= Route43
Crystal_Route43_PokemaniacBenSeenText:
	.string "I love POKéMON!\pThat's why I\nstarted--and why\pI'll keep on col-\nlecting POKéMON!$"

Crystal_Route43_PokemaniacBenBeatenText:
	.string "How could you do\nthis to me?$"

