	.string "What else do I\nlike besides\nPOKéMON?\pMARY on the radio.\nI bet she's cute!$"

Crystal_Route43_PokemaniacBrentSeenText:
	.string "Hey! Do you have\nany rare POKéMON?$"

Crystal_Route43_PokemaniacBrentBeatenText:
	.string "Oh, my poor POKé-\nMON! Darlings!$"

Crystal_Route43_PokemaniacBrentAfterBattleText:
	.string "I'd be happy just\nto own a single\nrare POKéMON.$"

Crystal_Route43_PokemaniacRonSeenText:
	.string "Would you get\nthis?\pSome <RIVAL> guy\nmade fun of my\nPOKéMON!\pDarn it! My POKé-\nMON's great!$"

Crystal_Route43_PokemaniacRonBeatenText:
