	.string "I can do so much\nwith my POKéMON--\nit's super-fun!$"

Crystal_Route43_CamperSpencerBeatenText:
	.string "Losing isn't fun\nat all…$"

Crystal_Route43_CamperSpencerAfterBattleText:
	.string "What is going on\nat LAKE OF RAGE?\pWe were planning\nto camp there.$"

Crystal_Route43_PicnickerTiffanySeenText:
