	.string "I fish until I\ncan't anymore.\pI also battle\nuntil I drop.\pThat's my\nrelationship\nwith my POKéMON.$"

Crystal_Route44_FisherEdgarBeatenText:
	.string "Hmmmm… \nThis isn't right.$"

Crystal_Route44_FisherEdgarAfterBattleText:
	.string "That's 100 wins\nto 101 losses.\pI won't battle\nagain for a while.$"

Crystal_Route44_BirdKeeperVance1SeenText:
	.string "Do you know about\nthe legendary bird\nPOKéMON?$"

Crystal_Route44_BirdKeeperVance1BeatenText:
	.string "Whew! You're hot\nstuff.$"

Crystal_Route44_BirdKeeperVanceLegendaryBirdsText:
	.string "ARTICUNO, ZAPDOS\nand MOLTRES are\pthe three legend-\nary bird POKéMON.\pI heard there are\nother legendary\nbirds, though.$"

Crystal_Route44_BirdKeeperVance2BeatenText:
	.string "Why can't I ever\nbeat you?\pOh yeah, here you\ngo. It's that gift\pI couldn't give\nyou last time.$"

