	.string "Arrgh… That's a\nshocking loss…$"

Crystal_Route44_PsychicPhilAfterBattleText:
	.string "It's important to\nhave conviction\non your side.$"

Crystal_Route44_PokemaniacZachSeenText:
	.string "I'll do anything\nto get my hands on\nrare POKéMON!$"

Crystal_Route44_PokemaniacZachBeatenText:
	.string "Oooh, your POKéMON\nare so appealing.$"

Crystal_Route44_PokemaniacZachAfterBattleText:
	.string "If a POKéMON has\ndifferent colors\pfrom usual, it's\nmore valuable.\pWhat? You mean\nthat's not true?$"

Crystal_Route44_CooltrainermAllenSeenText:
	.string "I can tell you're\na good trainer by\nlooking at you.\pI'm good at POKé-\nMON, and I can see\nthat you are too.$"

Crystal_Route44_CooltrainermAllenBeatenText:
	.string "Tch! It's a total\nloss on my part.$"

Crystal_Route44_CooltrainermAllenAfterBattleText:
	.string "Wow. You have a\nlot of BADGES.\pNo wonder you're\nso tough.\pI wonder if\nECRUTEAK GYM's\pMORTY is still in\ntraining?\pHe really hammered\nme.$"

Crystal_Route44_CooltrainerfCybilSeenText:
