@ Route45 <= Route45
Crystal_Route45_HikerErikSeenText:
	.string "Be prepared for\nanything!\pLet me see if your\nPOKéMON have been\nraised properly!$"

Crystal_Route45_HikerErikBeatenText:
	.string "Oh, I lost that!$"

Crystal_Route45_HikerErikAfterBattleText:
	.string "I'll head back to\nBLACKTHORN's ICE\pPATH and train\nsome more.$"

Crystal_Route45_HikerMichaelSeenText:
	.string "Yo! You're spunky!\nBut you know what?\pWhen it comes to\nsheer spunkiness,\nI'm the man!$"

Crystal_Route45_HikerMichaelBeatenText:
	.string "My POKéMON weren't\nspunky enough!$"

Crystal_Route45_HikerMichaelAfterBattleText:
	.string "Boy, do I love\nHP UP! Mmmm, yum!\pI keep drinking my\nPOKéMON's!\pI can't help it!$"

Crystal_Route45_HikerParry3SeenText:
	.string "My POKéMON are\npower packed!$"

Crystal_Route45_HikerParry3BeatenText:
	.string "Wahahah! I'm the\nbig loser!$"

Crystal_Route45_HikerParryAfterBattleText:
	.string "I'm not much good\nat thinking, see?\pSo, I just plow\nahead with power!$"

Crystal_Route45_HikerTimothySeenText:
	.string "Why do I climb\nmountains?\pBecause they're\nthere.\pWhy do I train\nPOKéMON?\pBecause they're\nthere!$"

Crystal_Route45_HikerTimothyBeatenText:
	.string "Losses…\nThey're there too!$"

Crystal_Route45_HikerTimothyAfterBattleText:
	.string "The best thing to\never happen to me\pwas discovering\nPOKéMON.$"

Crystal_Route45_HikerParryGivesIronText:
	.string "I just can't find\na way to win!\pKeep it up!\pOh, and take this\n--it's the gift\pyou couldn't take\nwhen we last met.$"

Crystal_Route45_BlackbeltKenji3SeenText:
	.string "I was training\nhere alone.\pBehold the fruits\nof my labor!$"

Crystal_Route45_BlackbeltKenji3BeatenText:
	.string "Waaaargh!$"

Crystal_Route45_BlackbeltKenjiAfterBattleText:
	.string "This calls for\nextreme measures.\pI must take to the\nhills and train in\nsolitude.$"

Crystal_Route45_BlackbeltKenjiMorningText:
	.string "I'm going to train\na bit more before\nI break for lunch.$"

Crystal_Route45_BlackbeltKenjiNightText:
	.string "We had plenty of\nrest at lunch, so\pnow we're all\nready to go again!\pWe're going to\ntrain again!$"

Crystal_Route45_CooltrainermRyanSeenText:
	.string "What are your\nthoughts on rais-\ning POKéMON?$"

Crystal_Route45_CooltrainermRyanBeatenText:
	.string "You've won my\nrespect.$"

Crystal_Route45_CooltrainermRyanAfterBattleText:
	.string "I see you're rais-\ning your POKéMON\nwith care.\pThe bond you build\nwill save you in\ntough situations.$"

Crystal_Route45_CooltrainerfKellySeenText:
	.string "What is your\nbattle strategy?\pIt is foolish to\nuse strong moves\nindiscriminately.$"

Crystal_Route45_CooltrainerfKellyBeatenText:
	.string "Fine. I lost.$"

Crystal_Route45_CooltrainerfKellyAfterBattleText:
	.string "I'm not in favor\nof overly power-\nful moves.\pI want to win, but\nI also don't want\nto harm POKéMON.$"

Crystal_Route45_Route45DummyText:
	.string "I'm really, really\ntough!\pIs there anywhere\nI can prove how\ntough I really am?$"

Crystal_Route45_CamperQuentinSeenText:
	.string "I'm really, really\ntough!$"

Crystal_Route45_CamperQuentinBeatenText:
