Crystal_RuinsOfAlphOmanyteChamber_RuinsOfAlphOmanyteChamberWallPatternRightText:
	.string "Patterns appeared\non the walls…$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphOmanyteChamber_RuinsOfAlphOmanyteChamberWallHoleText:
	.string "There's a big hole\nin the wall!$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphOmanyteChamber_RuinsOfAlphOmanyteChamberAncientReplicaText:
	.string "It's a replica of\nan ancient POKé-\nMON.$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphOmanyteChamber_RuinsOfAlphOmanyteChamberDescriptionText:
