@ RuinsOfAlphOutside <= RuinsOfAlphOutside
Crystal_RuinsOfAlphOutside_RuinsOfAlphOutsideScientistText:
	.string "Hm? That's a POKé-\nDEX, isn't it?\nMay I see it?\pThere are so many\nkinds of POKéMON.\pHm? What's this?\pWhat is this\nPOKéMON?\pIt looks like the\nstrange writing on\pthe walls of the\nRUINS.\pIf those drawings\nare really POKé-\nMON, there should\nbe many more.\pI know! Let me up-\ngrade your POKé-\nDEX. Follow me.$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphOutside_SuperNerdStanSeenText:
	.string "What do you want?\nI'm studying--\ndon't disturb me!$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphOutside_SuperNerdStanBeatenText:
	.string "Sorry…\nI'm frustrated by\pour lack of real\nunderstanding…$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphOutside_SuperNerdStanAfterBattleText:
	.string "The RUINS are from\nabout 1500 years\nago.\pNobody knows who\nbuilt them.\pIt's also not\nknown if the POKé-\nMON statues have\nany meaning.\pIt's all one big\nmystery…$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphOutside_PsychicNathanSeenText:
	.string "Hmmm… This is a\nstrange place.$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphOutside_PsychicNathanBeatenText:
	.string "…$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphOutside_PsychicNathanAfterBattleText:
	.string "I like thinking\nhere.$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphOutside_RuinsOfAlphOutsideMysteryChamberSignText:
	.string "MYSTERY STONE\nPANEL CHAMBER$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphOutside_RuinsOfAlphSignText:
	.string "RUINS OF ALPH\nVISITORS WELCOME$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphOutside_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenterSignText:
	.string "RUINS OF ALPH\nRESEARCH CENTER\pTHE AUTHORITY ON\nTHE RUINS OF ALPH$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphOutside_RuinsOfAlphOutsideFisherText1:
	.string "While exploring\nthe RUINS, we\psuddenly noticed\nan odd presence.\pWe all got scared\nand ran away.\pYou should be\ncareful too.$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphOutside_RuinsOfAlphOutsideFisherText2:
	.string "The RUINS hide a\nhuge secret!\p…I think…$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphOutside_RuinsOfAlphOutsideYoungster1Text:
	.string "There are many\nkinds of UNOWN, so\pwe use them for\nour secret codes.$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphOutside_RuinsOfAlphOutsideYoungster2Text:
	.string "A… H… E… A… D…\nHmm…\pWhat?\pI'm decoding this\nmessage!$"

