@ RuinsOfAlphResearchCenter <= RuinsOfAlphResearchCenter
Crystal_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenter_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenterModifiedDexText:
	.string "Done!\pI modified your\nPOKéDEX.\pI added an\noptional POKéDEX\pto store UNOWN\ndata.\pIt records them in\nthe sequence that\nthey were caught.$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenter_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenterDexUpgradedText:
	.string "{PLAYER}'s POKéDEX\nwas upgraded.$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenter_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenterScientist3Text:
	.string "The UNOWN you\ncatch will all be\nrecorded.\pCheck to see how\nmany kinds exist.$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenter_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenterScientist3_PrinterAvailable:
	.string "You caught all the\nUNOWN variations?\pThat's a great\nachievement!\pI've set up the\nprinter here for\nhandling UNOWN.\pFeel free to use\nit anytime.$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenter_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenterScientist1Text:
	.string "The RUINS are\nabout 1500 years\nold.\pBut it's not known\nwhy they were\nbuilt--or by whom.$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenter_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenterScientist1Text_GotUnownDex:
	.string "I wonder how many\nkinds of POKéMON\nare in the RUINS?$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenter_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenterScientist1Text_UnownAppeared:
	.string "POKéMON appeared\nin the RUINS?\pThat's incredible\nnews!\pWe'll need to\ninvestigate this.$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenter_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenterScientist1Text_GotAllUnown:
	.string "Our investigation,\nwith your help, is\pgiving us insight\ninto the RUINS.\pThe RUINS appear\nto have been built\pas a habitat for\nPOKéMON.$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenter_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenterScientist2Text:
	.string "There are odd pat-\nterns drawn on the\pwalls of the\nRUINS.\pThey must be the\nkeys for unravel-\ning the mystery\nof the RUINS.$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenter_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenterScientist2Text_UnownAppeared:
	.string "The strange POKé-\nMON you saw in the\nRUINS?\pThey appear to be\nvery much like the\pdrawings on the\nwalls there.\pHmm…\pThat must mean\nthere are many\nkinds of them…$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenter_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenterUnusedText1:
	.string "We think something\ncaused the cryptic\ppatterns to appear\nin the RUINS.\pWe've focused our\nstudies on that.$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenter_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenterUnusedText2:
	.string "According to my\nresearch…\pThose mysterious\npatterns appeared\pwhen the POKéCOM\nCENTER was built.\pIt must mean that\nradio waves have\psome sort of a\nlink…$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenter_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenterScientist2Text_GotAllUnown:
	.string "Why did those\nancient patterns\pappear on the wall\nnow?\pThe mystery\ndeepens…$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenter_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenterComputerText:
	.string "RUINS OF ALPH\pExploration\nYear 10$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenter_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenterComputerText_GotAllUnown:
	.string "Mystery POKéMON\nName: UNOWN\pA total of 26\nkinds found.$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenter_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenterPrinterText_DoesntWork:
	.string "This doesn't seem\nto work yet.$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenter_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenterUnownPrinterText:
	.string "UNOWN may be\nprinted out.$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenter_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenterProfSilktreePhotoText:
	.string "It's a photo of\nthe RESEARCH\pCENTER'S founder,\nPROF.SILKTREE.$"

Crystal_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenter_RuinsOfAlphResearchCenterAcademicBooksText:
	.string "There are many\nacademic books.\pAncient Ruins…\nMysteries of the\nAncients…$"

