@ TeamRocketBaseB1F <= TeamRocketBaseB1F
Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB1F_CameraGrunt1SeenText:
	.string "Hey!\nIntruder alert!$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB1F_CameraGrunt1BeatenText:
	.string "Dang… I failed…$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB1F_CameraGrunt2SeenText:
	.string "It's my turn!\nThere's no escape!$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB1F_CameraGrunt2BeatenText:
	.string "Surveillance cams\nare in the POKéMON\nstatues.\pWe'll keep appear-\ning until you trip\na secret switch.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB1F_ScientistJedSeenText:
	.string "This was once a\nninja hideout.\pThere are traps to\nconfound intruders\nlike you.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB1F_ScientistJedBeatenText:
	.string "I get it…$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB1F_ScientistJedAfterBattleText:
	.string "All right. I'll\ndivulge a secret\nabout our hideout.\pThat thing on the\nfloor up ahead is\na warp panel.\pIf you step on it,\nyou'll be warped\pback to the en-\ntrance.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB1F_GruntM16SeenText:
	.string "Heheh. Feeling\nlucky, punk?\pGo ahead, take\nanother step.\pWe've got traps\nset in the floor!$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB1F_GruntM16BeatenText:
	.string "Kaboom!$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB1F_GruntM16AfterBattleText:
	.string "I don't even know\nwhere the traps\nare planted.\pYou'll just have\nto collect your\ncourage and walk.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB1F_TeamRocketBaseB1FSecurityCameraText:
	.string "It's a PERSIAN\nstatue…\pIts eyes are oddly\nshiny.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB1F_TeamRocketBaseB1FSecretSwitchText:
