@ TeamRocketBaseB2F <= TeamRocketBaseB2F
Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_RocketBaseExecutiveFHoldItText:
	.string "Hold it right\nthere!$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_RocketBaseBossFThrashText:
	.string "We can't have a\nbrat like you on\nthe loose.\pIt's harmful to\nTEAM ROCKET's\npride, you see.\pHowever strong you\nmay be, you can't\ptake both of us at\nthe same time.\pSorry, baby. Now\nget ready to be\nthrashed.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_RocketBaseLanceShareFunText:
	.string "Hey! Don't be so\nselfish. Spread\nthe fun around.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_RocketBaseBossDontMeddleText:
	.string "What? You had an\naccomplice?\pWhere is your\nsense of honor?\pAs the interim\nboss in place of\pGIOVANNI, I'll\nshow you how wrong\pit is to meddle\nwith TEAM ROCKET!$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_RocketBaseBossWinText:
	.string "Tch, you really\nare strong.\pIt's too bad.\pIf you were to\njoin TEAM ROCKET,\pyou could become\nan EXECUTIVE.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_RocketBaseBossRetreatText:
	.string "…This hideout is\ndone for…\pBut that's fine.\nThe broadcast ex-\nperiment was a\ntotal success.\pIt doesn't matter\nwhat happens to\nthis hideout now.\pWe have much big-\nger plans.\pYou'll come to\nappreciate TEAM\pROCKET's true\npower soon enough.\pEnjoy yourself\nwhile you can…\pFufufufu…$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_RocketBaseLancePostBattleText:
	.string "LANCE: That did\nit. We defeated\pall the ROCKETS\nhere.\pBut I'm concerned\nabout the young\pguy I battled in\nthe process…$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_RocketBaseLancePowerOffText:
	.string "Sorry, {PLAYER}.\nI saw how well you\pwere doing, so I\njust hung back.\pNow all there is\nleft to do is to\pturn off that odd\nradio signal.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_RockerBaseLanceElectrodeFaintText:
	.string "It's this machine\nthat's causing all\nthe problems.\pI don't see a\nswitch on it…\pWe have no choice.\nWe have to make\pall the ELECTRODE\nfaint.\pThat should stop\nthis machine from\ptransmitting that\nstrange signal.\pIt's no fault of\nthe POKéMON, so it\pmakes me feel\nguilty.\p{PLAYER}, let's\nsplit the job.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_RocketBaseLancesSideText:
	.string "LANCE: Leave this\nside to me.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_RocketBaseLanceElectrodeDoneText:
	.string "LANCE: That odd\nsignal has finally\nstopped.\pThe LAKE should be\nback to normal.\pYou're the hero!\nLet me thank you\pon behalf of all\nthe POKéMON.\pOh, yes. You\nshould take this.\pI found it here,\nbut I don't have\nany need for it.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_RocketBaseReceivedHM06Text:
	.string "{PLAYER} received\nHM06.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_RocketBaseLanceWhirlpoolText:
	.string "That's WHIRLPOOL.\nTeach it to a\pPOKéMON to get\nacross wild water.\pBut keep this in\nmind.\pYou can use that\nout of battle only\pwith the BADGE\nfrom MAHOGANY GYM.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_RocketBaseLanceMonMasterText:
	.string "{PLAYER}…\pThe journey to be-\ncoming the POKéMON\pMASTER is long and\ndifficult.\pKnowing that, will\nyou keep going?\p…\pI see. No, you're\nright.\pIf you would give\nup that easily,\pyou would have\nnever chased that\pdream in the first\nplace.\pI look forward to\nseeing you again!$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_LanceHealsText1:
	.string "LANCE: Are you all\nright?\pYour POKéMON are\nhurt and tired.\pHere, give them\nsome of my medi-\ncine.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_LanceHealsText2:
	.string "LANCE: {PLAYER},\nlet's give it our\nbest for POKéMON.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_GruntM17SeenText:
	.string "The door won't\nopen?\pWell, duh.\nIt has to have a\ppassword that only\nTEAM ROCKET knows.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_GruntM17BeatenText:
	.string "What? I lost?$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_GruntM17AfterBattleText:
	.string "Heh, I'm just a\nGRUNT.\pI don't know the\npassword. Too bad\nfor you.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_GruntM18SeenText:
	.string "Oh, a kid? I don't\nreally like this,\pbut eliminate you\nI must.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_GruntM18BeatenText:
	.string "I knew I'd lose…$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_GruntM18AfterBattleText:
	.string "I got wiped out on\nthe last mission\nby a kid too.\pWhen we were ab-\nducting POKéMON,\pthis kid with long\nred hair and mean-\plooking eyes just\ncreamed me…$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_GruntM19SeenText:
	.string "You rotten little\npest!$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_GruntM19BeatenText:
	.string "Grrrr…$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_GruntM19AfterBattleText:
	.string "Heh, only the boss\nknows the password\nfor that door.\pWhere's the boss?\nWho knows? Go look\nfor yourself.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_RocketBaseDoorNoPasswordText:
	.string "The door's closed…\pIt needs a pass-\nword to open.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_RocketBaseDoorKnowPasswordText:
	.string "The door's closed…\p{PLAYER} entered\nthe password.\pThe door opened!$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_RocketBaseB2FTransmitterText:
	.string "It's the radio\ntransmitter that's\psending the\nsinister signal.\pIt's working at\nfull capacity.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB2F_RocketBaseB2FDeactivateTransmitterText:
	.string "The radio trans-\nmitter has finally\pstopped its evil\nbroadcast.$"

