@ TeamRocketBaseB3F <= TeamRocketBaseB3F
Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB3F_LanceGetPasswordText:
	.string "LANCE: It takes\ntwo passwords to\pget into the\nboss's quarters.\pThose passwords\nare known only to\na few ROCKETS.\pThat ROCKET there\nvery graciously\ntold me so.\p{PLAYER}, let's go\nget the passwords.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB3F_TeamRocketBaseB3FRocketText:
	.string "Urrggh… The guy\nin the cape is\nincredibly tough…$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB3F_RocketBaseRivalText:
	.string "…\pDidn't I tell you\nthat I was going\pto destroy TEAM\nROCKET?\p…Tell me, who was\nthe guy in the\pcape who used\ndragon POKéMON?\pMy POKéMON were no\nmatch at all.\pI don't care that\nI lost. I can beat\phim by getting\nstronger POKéMON.\pIt's what he said\nthat bothers me…\pHe told me that\nI don't love and\ptrust my POKéMON\nenough.\pI'm furious that I\nlost to a bleeding\nheart like him.\p…Humph! I don't\nhave the time for\nthe likes of you!$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB3F_ExecutiveM4BeforeText:
	.string "What? Who are you?\nThis is the office\pof our leader,\nGIOVANNI.\pSince disbanding\nTEAM ROCKET three\pyears ago, he has\nbeen in training.\pBut we're certain\nhe will be back\psome day to assume\ncommand again.\pThat's why we're\nstanding guard.\pI won't let any-\none disturb this\nplace!$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB3F_ExecutiveM4BeatenText:
	.string "I… I couldn't do a\nthing…\pGIOVANNI, please\nforgive me…$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB3F_ExecutiveM4AfterText:
	.string "No, I can't let\nthis affect me.\pI have to inform\nthe others…$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB3F_RocketBaseMurkrowText:
	.string "MURKROW: The\npassword is…\pHAIL GIOVANNI.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB3F_GruntF5SeenText:
	.string "Do I know the\npassword?\pMaybe.\pBut no weakling's\ngoing to get it!$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB3F_GruntF5BeatenText:
	.string "All right. Stop.\nI'll tell you.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB3F_GruntF5AfterBattleText:
	.string "The password to\nthe boss's room is\pSLOWPOKETAIL.\pBut it's useless\nunless you have\ntwo passwords.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB3F_GruntM28SeenText:
	.string "Hyuck-hyuck-hyuck!\pYou're challenging\nme to a battle?\pHah! You're nuts,\nbut you have guts!\pI like that!\pIf you can beat\nme, I'll tell you\pa password to the\nboss's room!$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB3F_GruntM28BeatenText:
	.string "Hyuck-hyuck-hyuck!\nYou're good!$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB3F_GruntM28AfterBattleText:
	.string "Hyuck-hyuck-hyuck!\pThe password to\nthe boss's room…\pUh…, I think it is\nRATICATE TAIL.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB3F_ScientistRossSeenText:
	.string "I used to work for\nSILPH, but now I\prun research for\nTEAM ROCKET.\pA meddlesome child\nlike you needs to\nbe punished.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB3F_ScientistRossBeatenText:
	.string "A mere tactical\nerror cost me…$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB3F_ScientistRossAfterBattleText:
	.string "A radio signal\nthat drives POKé-\nMON mad…\pMy experiment is a\ncomplete success.\pMy promotion is\nassured. This loss\pmeans absolutely\nnothing.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB3F_ScientistMitchSeenText:
	.string "I don't care that\nPOKéMON are hurt\nby our experiment.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB3F_ScientistMitchBeatenText:
	.string "Thinking is my\nstrong suit, not\nbattling.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB3F_ScientistMitchAfterBattleText:
	.string "If we turn up the\npower of our radio\psignal for broad-\ncast nationwide…\pThe very thought\nexcites me!$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB3F_TeamRocketBaseB3FLockedDoorNeedsPasswordText:
	.string "The door's closed…\pIt needs two\npasswords to open.$"

Crystal_TeamRocketBaseB3F_TeamRocketBaseB3FLockedDoorOpenSesameText:
	.string "The door's closed…\p{PLAYER} entered\nthe two passwords.\pThe door opened!$"

