@ VictoryRoad <= VictoryRoad
Crystal_VictoryRoad_VictoryRoadRivalBeforeText:
	.string "Hold it.\p…Are you going to\ntake the POKéMON\nLEAGUE challenge?\p…Don't make me\nlaugh.\pYou're so much\nweaker than I am.\pI'm not like I was\nbefore.\pI now have the\nbest and strongest\pPOKéMON with me.\nI'm invincible!\p{PLAYER}!\nI challenge you!$"

Crystal_VictoryRoad_VictoryRoadRivalDefeatText:
	.string "…I couldn't win…\pI gave it every-\nthing I had…\pWhat you possess,\nand what I lack…\pI'm beginning to\nunderstand what\pthat dragon master\nsaid to me…$"

Crystal_VictoryRoad_VictoryRoadRivalAfterText:
	.string "…I haven't given up\non becoming the\ngreatest trainer…\pI'm going to find\nout why I can't\pwin and become\nstronger…\pWhen I do, I will\nchallenge you.\pAnd I'll beat you\ndown with all my\npower.\p…Humph! You keep\nat it until then.$"

Crystal_VictoryRoad_VictoryRoadRivalVictoryText:
	.string "…Humph!\pWhen it comes down\nto it, nothing can\nbeat power.\pI don't need any-\nthing else.$"

