@ WillsRoom <= WillsRoom
Crystal_WillsRoom_WillScript_WillBeforeText:
	.string "Welcome to POKéMON\nLEAGUE, {PLAYER}.\pAllow me to intro-\nduce myself. I am\nWILL.\pI have trained all\naround the world,\pmaking my psychic\nPOKéMON powerful.\pAnd, at last, I've\nbeen accepted into\nthe ELITE FOUR.\pI can only keep\ngetting better!\pLosing is not an\noption!$"

Crystal_WillsRoom_WillScript_WillBeatenText:
	.string "I… I can't…\nbelieve it…$"

Crystal_WillsRoom_WillScript_WillDefeatText:
	.string "Even though I was\ndefeated, I won't\nchange my course.\pI will continue\nbattling until I\pstand above all\ntrainers!\pNow, {PLAYER}, move\non and experience\pthe true ferocity\nof the ELITE FOUR.$"

