@ BurnedTower1F <= BurnedTower1F
Crystal_BurnedTower1F_BurnedTowerRival_BeforeText:
	.string "<……> <……> <……>\p…Oh, it's you.\pI came looking for\nsome legendary\pPOKéMON that they\nsay roosts here.\pBut there's\nnothing here!\pNothing after all\nthe trouble of\pcoming to this\ndump? No way!\pIt's all your\nfault!$"

Crystal_BurnedTower1F_BurnedTowerRival_WinText:
	.string "…Humph!\pThis is why I hate\nbattling wimps.\pThere's no\nchallenge in it.$"

Crystal_BurnedTower1F_BurnedTowerRival_AfterText1:
	.string "…Aw, whatever.\pYou would never be\nable to catch a\plegendary POKéMON\nanyway.$"

Crystal_BurnedTower1F_BurnedTowerRival_LossText:
	.string "…Humph!\pThis is why I hate\nbattling wimps.\pIt's just a waste\nof my time.$"

Crystal_BurnedTower1F_BurnedTowerRival_AfterText2:
	.string "Humph!\pWhat are you doing\nfalling into a\phole? Some genius\nyou are!\pServes you right!$"

Crystal_BurnedTower1F_BurnedTower1FEusineIntroText:
	.string "EUSINE: My name's\nEUSINE.\pI'm on the trail\nof a POKéMON named\nSUICUNE.\pAnd you are…?\p{PLAYER}? Glad to\nmeet you!\pI heard rumors\nthat SUICUNE is in\pthis BURNED TOWER,\nso I came to look.\pBut where exactly\ncould it be?$"

Crystal_BurnedTower1F_BurnedTower1FEusineText:
	.string "EUSINE: I heard\nthat SUICUNE is in\pthis BURNED TOWER,\nso I came to look.\pBut where exactly\ncould it be?$"

Crystal_BurnedTower1F_BurnedTower1FMortyText:
	.string "MORTY: ECRUTEAK's\nGYM LEADER has to\pstudy what are\nsaid to be the\plegendary POKéMON\n--SUICUNE, ENTEI\nand RAIKOU.\pEUSINE is here, so\nI've decided to\pinvestigate the\nTOWER with him.$"

