@ CianwoodCity <= CianwoodCity
Crystal_CianwoodCity_ChucksWifeEasierToFlyText:
	.string "You crossed the\nsea to get here?\pThat must have\nbeen hard.\pIt would be much\neasier if your\pPOKéMON knew how\nto FLY…$"

Crystal_CianwoodCity_ChucksWifeBeatChuckText:
	.string "But you can't use\nFLY without this\ncity's GYM BADGE.\pIf you beat the\nGYM LEADER here,\ncome see me.\pI'll have a nice\ngift for you.$"

Crystal_CianwoodCity_ChucksWifeGiveHMText:
	.string "That's CIANWOOD's\nGYM BADGE!\pThen you should\ntake this HM.$"

Crystal_CianwoodCity_ChucksWifeFlySpeechText:
	.string "Teach FLY to your\nPOKéMON.\pYou will be able\nto FLY instantly\pto anywhere you \nhave visited.$"

Crystal_CianwoodCity_ChucksWifeChubbyText:
	.string "My husband lost to\nyou, so he needs\nto train harder.\pThat's good, since\nhe was getting a\nlittle chubby.$"

Crystal_CianwoodCity_CianwoodCityYoungsterText:
	.string "If you use FLY,\nyou can get back\pto OLIVINE in-\nstantly.$"

Crystal_CianwoodCity_CianwoodCityPokefanMText:
	.string "Boulders to the\nnorth of town can\nbe crushed.\pThey may be hiding\nsomething.\pYour POKéMON could\nuse ROCK SMASH to\nbreak them.$"

Crystal_CianwoodCity_CianwoodCityLassText:
	.string "CHUCK, the GYM\nLEADER, spars with\phis fighting POKé-\nMON.$"

Crystal_CianwoodCity_CianwoodCityUnusedText:
	.string "There are several\nislands between\nhere and OLIVINE.\pA mythical sea\ncreature supposed-\nly lives there.$"

Crystal_CianwoodCity_EusineSuicuneText:
	.string "EUSINE: Yo,\n{PLAYER}.\pWasn't that\nSUICUNE just now?\pI only caught a\nquick glimpse, but\pI thought I saw\nSUICUNE running on\nthe waves.\pSUICUNE is beau-\ntiful and grand.\pAnd it races\nthrough towns and\proads at simply\nawesome speeds.\pIt's wonderful…\pI want to see\nSUICUNE up close…\pI've decided.\pI'll battle you as\na trainer to earn\nSUICUNE's respect!\pCome on, {PLAYER}.\nLet's battle now!$"

Crystal_CianwoodCity_EusineBeatenText:
	.string "I hate to admit\nit, but you win.$"

Crystal_CianwoodCity_EusineAfterText:
	.string "You're amazing,\n{PLAYER}!\pNo wonder POKéMON\ngravitate to you.\pI get it now.\pI'm going to keep\nsearching for\nSUICUNE.\pI'm sure we'll see\neach other again.\pSee you around!$"

Crystal_CianwoodCity_CianwoodCitySignText:
	.string "CIANWOOD CITY\pA Port Surrounded\nby Rough Seas$"

Crystal_CianwoodCity_CianwoodGymSignText:
	.string "CIANWOOD CITY\nPOKéMON GYM\pLEADER: CHUCK\pHis Roaring Fists\nDo the Talking$"

Crystal_CianwoodCity_CianwoodPharmacySignText:
	.string "500 Years of\nTradition\pCIANWOOD CITY\nPHARMACY\pWe Await Your\nMedicinal Queries$"

Crystal_CianwoodCity_CianwoodPhotoStudioSignText:
	.string "CIANWOOD CITY\nPHOTO STUDIO\pTake a Snapshot as\na Keepsake!$"

Crystal_CianwoodCity_CianwoodPokeSeerSignText:
	.string "THE POKé SEER\nAHEAD$"

