@ CianwoodGym <= CianwoodGym
Crystal_CianwoodGym_ChuckIntroText1:
	.string "WAHAHAH!\pSo you've come\nthis far!\pLet me tell you,\nI'm tough!\pMy POKéMON will\ncrush stones and\nshatter bones!\pWatch this!$"

Crystal_CianwoodGym_ChuckIntroText2:
	.string "CHUCK: Urggh!\n…\pOooarrgh!$"

Crystal_CianwoodGym_ChuckIntroText3:
	.string "There! Scared now,\nare you?\pWhat?\nIt has nothing to\pdo with POKéMON?\nThat's true!\pCome on. We shall\ndo battle!$"

Crystal_CianwoodGym_ChuckLossText:
	.string "Wha? Huh?\nI lost?\pHow about that!\nYou're worthy of\nSTORMBADGE!$"

Crystal_CianwoodGym_GetStormBadgeText:
	.string "{PLAYER} received\nSTORMBADGE.$"

Crystal_CianwoodGym_ChuckExplainBadgeText:
	.string "STORMBADGE makes\nall POKéMON up to\pL70 obey, even\ntraded ones.\pIt also lets your\nPOKéMON use FLY\pwhen you're not in\na battle.\pHere, take this\ntoo!$"

Crystal_CianwoodGym_ChuckExplainTMText:
	.string "That is DYNAMIC-\nPUNCH.\pIt doesn't always\nhit, but when it\pdoes, it causes\nconfusion!$"

Crystal_CianwoodGym_ChuckAfterText:
	.string "WAHAHAH! I enjoyed\nbattling you!\pBut a loss is a\nloss!\pFrom now on, I'm\ngoing to train 24\nhours a day!$"

Crystal_CianwoodGym_BlackbeltYoshiSeenText:
	.string "My POKéMON and I\nare bound togeth-\ner by friendship.\pOur bond will\nnever be broken!$"

Crystal_CianwoodGym_BlackbeltYoshiBeatenText:
	.string "This isn't real!$"

Crystal_CianwoodGym_BlackbeltYoshiAfterText:
	.string "You seem to have a\nstrong bond with\nyour POKéMON too!$"

Crystal_CianwoodGym_BlackbeltLaoSeenText:
	.string "We martial artists\nfear nothing!$"

Crystal_CianwoodGym_BlackbeltLaoBeatenText:
	.string "That's shocking!$"

Crystal_CianwoodGym_BlackbeltLaoAfterText:
	.string "Fighting POKéMON\nare afraid of psy-\nchics…$"

Crystal_CianwoodGym_BlackbeltNobSeenText:
	.string "Words are useless.\nLet your fists do\nthe talking!$"

Crystal_CianwoodGym_BlackbeltNobBeatenText:
	.string "…$"

Crystal_CianwoodGym_BlackbeltNobAfterText:
	.string "I lost! \nI'm speechless!$"

Crystal_CianwoodGym_BlackbeltLungSeenText:
	.string "My raging fists\nwill shatter your\nPOKéMON!$"

Crystal_CianwoodGym_BlackbeltLungBeatenText:
	.string "I got shattered!$"

Crystal_CianwoodGym_BlackbeltLungAfterText:
	.string "My POKéMON lost…\nMy… my pride is\nshattered…$"

@ CianwoodLugiaSpeechHouse <= CianwoodLugiaSpeechHouse
Crystal_CianwoodLugiaSpeechHouse_CianwoodLugiaSpeechHouseTeacherText:
	.string "You came from\nOLIVINE?\pDo you remember\nthe four islands\nalong the way?\pI heard that a \nmythical sea crea-\nture is hiding in\nthem.$"

Crystal_CianwoodLugiaSpeechHouse_CianwoodLugiaSpeechHouseLassText:
	.string "I heard that you\ncan only see it if\pyou have a SILVER\nWING.\pIt must have the\nsame scent as the\ncreature.$"

Crystal_CianwoodLugiaSpeechHouse_CianwoodLugiaSpeechHouseTwinText:
	.string "I've heard that\nthe whirlpools\paround the islands\nare caused by the\nsea creature.\pYou might need a\nspecial move to\nget past them.$"

@ CianwoodPharmacy <= CianwoodPharmacy
Crystal_CianwoodPharmacy_PharmacistGiveSecretpotionText:
	.string "Your POKéMON ap-\npear to be fine.\pIs something wor- \nrying you?\p…\pThe LIGHTHOUSE\nPOKéMON is in\ntrouble?\pI got it!\pThis ought to do\nthe trick.$"

Crystal_CianwoodPharmacy_ReceivedSecretpotionText:
	.string "{PLAYER} received\nSECRETPOTION.$"

Crystal_CianwoodPharmacy_PharmacistDescribeSecretpotionText:
	.string "My SECRETPOTION is\na tad too strong.\pI only offer it in\nan emergency.$"

@ CianwoodPhotoStudio <= CianwoodPhotoStudio
Crystal_CianwoodPhotoStudio_CianwoodPhotoStudioFishingGuruText_Question:
	.string "You have magnifi-\ncent POKéMON with\nyou.\pHow about a photo\nfor a souvenir?$"

Crystal_CianwoodPhotoStudio_CianwoodPhotoStudioFishingGuruText_Yes:
	.string "OK! Big smile now!$"

Crystal_CianwoodPhotoStudio_CianwoodPhotoStudioFishingGuruText_No:
	.string "Oh, that's too\nbad. I thought it\pwould be a great\nmemento…$"

@ CianwoodPokecenter1F <= CianwoodPokecenter1F
Crystal_CianwoodPokecenter1F_CianwoodPokecenter1FLassText:
	.string "Did you meet the\nPOKéMANIAC?\pHe's always brag-\nging about his\nrare POKéMON.$"

Crystal_CianwoodPokecenter1F_CianwoodGymGuideText:
	.string "The POKéMON GYM\ntrainers here are\nmacho bullies.\pIf I stick around,\nthey might come\nafter me.\pHere's some ad-\nvice: the GYM\pLEADER uses the\nfighting-type.\pSo you should\nconfound him with\npsychic POKéMON.\pWipe out his POKé-\nMON before they\pcan use their\nphysical strength.\pAnd those boulders\nin the middle of\nthe GYM?\pIf you don't move\nthem correctly,\pyou won't reach\nthe GYM LEADER.\pIf you get stuck,\ngo outside.$"

Crystal_CianwoodPokecenter1F_CianwoodGymGuideWinText:
	.string "{PLAYER}! You won!\nI could tell by\nlooking at you!$"

Crystal_CianwoodPokecenter1F_CianwoodPokecenter1FUnusedText1:
	.string "Don't you get the\nurge to show off\pyour POKéMON to\nfriends?\pI wish I could\nshow the POKéMON I\praised to my pal\nin VIOLET.$"

Crystal_CianwoodPokecenter1F_CianwoodPokecenter1FUnusedText2:
	.string "I've been battling\nmy pal in VIOLET\pusing a MOBILE\nADAPTER link.\pI'm down 5-7\nagainst him. I've\ngotta crank it up!$"

Crystal_CianwoodPokecenter1F_CianwoodPokecenter1FSuperNerdText:
	.string "I love showing off\nthe POKéMON that\pI've raised.\nDon't you?\pI'm going to get\ninto a bunch of\pbattles, and show\noff my POKéMON!$"

@ DanceTheater <= DanceTheater
Crystal_DanceTheater_KimonoGirlNaokoSeenText:
	.string "You have lovely\nPOKéMON. May I see\nthem in battle?$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_KimonoGirlNaokoBeatenText:
	.string "Oh, you are very\nstrong.$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_KimonoGirlNaokoAfterBattleText:
	.string "I enjoyed that\nbout. I would like\nto see you again.$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_KimonoGirlSayoSeenText:
	.string "I always dance\nwith my POKéMON.\pOf course, I also\ntrain them.$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_KimonoGirlSayoBeatenText:
	.string "Oh, so close!\nI almost had you.$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_KimonoGirlSayoAfterBattleText:
	.string "Rhythm is impor-\ntant for both\pdancing and POKé-\nMON.$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_KimonoGirlZukiSeenText:
	.string "Isn't my barrette\npretty?\pOh. A POKéMON\nbattle?$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_KimonoGirlZukiBeatenText:
	.string "I don't have any\nPOKéMON left…$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_KimonoGirlZukiAfterBattleText:
	.string "I put a different\nflower in my bar-\nrette every month.$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_KimonoGirlKuniSeenText:
	.string "Oh, you're a cute\ntrainer. Would you\nlike to battle?$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_KimonoGirlKuniBeatenText:
	.string "You're stronger\nthan you look.$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_KimonoGirlKuniAfterBattleText:
	.string "I trained a lot,\nso I thought I was\pa capable trainer.\nI guess I'm not.$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_KimonoGirlMikiSeenText:
	.string "Do you like my\ndancing? I'm good\nat POKéMON too.$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_KimonoGirlMikiBeatenText:
	.string "Ooh, you're good\nat POKéMON too.$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_KimonoGirlMikiAfterBattleText:
	.string "I can keep dancing\nbecause there are\ppeople who enjoy\nwhat I do.\pMy POKéMON keep my\nspirits up too.$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_SurfGuyNeverLeftAScratchText:
	.string "Not only are the\nKIMONO GIRLS great\pdancers, they're\nalso skilled at\nPOKéMON.\pI always challenge\nthem, but I've\pnever even left a\nscratch…$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_SurfGuyLadGiftText:
	.string "Lad! If you can\ndefeat all the\pKIMONO GIRLS, I'll\ngive you a gift.$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_SurfGuyLassieGiftText:
	.string "Lassie, if you can\ndefeat all the\pKIMONO GIRLS, I'll\ngive you a gift.$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_SurfGuyLikeADanceText:
	.string "The way you bat-\ntled, it was like\nwatching a dance.\pIt was a rare\ntreat to see!\pI want you to have\nthis. Don't worry\n--take it!$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_SurfGuySurfExplanationText:
	.string "That's SURF.\pIt's a move that\nlets POKéMON swim\nacross water.$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_SurfGuyElegantKimonoGirlsText:
	.string "I wish my POKéMON\nwere as elegant as\nthe KIMONO GIRLS…$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_RhydonText:
	.string "RHYDON: Gugooh\ngugogooh!$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_DanceTheaterCooltrainerMText:
	.string "That man's always\nwith his RHYDON.\pSays he wants a\nPOKéMON that can\nSURF and dance.\pIs he trying to\nmake a synchro-\nnized swimming\nPOKéMON?$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_DanceTheaterGrannyText:
	.string "The KIMONO GIRLS\nare so beautiful…\pBut they have to\ngo through rigor-\nous training.\pAnd they have to\nlearn to follow\pcustoms before ap-\npearing in public.\pBut if you love\nsomething, any-\nthing is possible.$"

Crystal_DanceTheater_DanceTheaterFancyPanelText:
	.string "It's a fancy panel\nthat's decorated\nwith flowers.$"

@ EcruteakCity <= EcruteakCity
Crystal_EcruteakCity_UnusedMissingDaughterText:
	.string "Oh, no. Oh, no…\pMy daughter is\nmissing.\pNo… She couldn't\nhave gone to the\nBURNED TOWER.\pI told her not to\ngo near it…\pPeople seem to\ndisappear there…\pOh, what should I\ndo…?$"

Crystal_EcruteakCity_EcruteakCityGramps1Text:
	.string "ECRUTEAK used to\nhave two towers:\pone each in the\neast and west.$"

Crystal_EcruteakCity_EcruteakCityGramps2Text:
	.string "Ah, child.\nHave you learned\pto dance like the\nKIMONO GIRLS?\pIf you go to their\nDANCE THEATER, an\podd old man will\ngive you something\nnice, I hear.$"

Crystal_EcruteakCity_EcruteakCityLass1Text:
	.string "I'm going to prac-\ntice at the DANCE\pTHEATER. Care to\njoin me?$"

Crystal_EcruteakCity_EcruteakCityLass2Text:
	.string "The tower that\nused to be here…\pMy grandma told me\nit used to be much\ntaller.$"

Crystal_EcruteakCity_EcruteakCityLass2Text_ReleasedBeasts:
	.string "Three big POKéMON\nran off in differ-\nent directions.\nWhat were they?$"

Crystal_EcruteakCity_EcruteakCityFisherText:
	.string "I heard a rumor\nabout OLIVINE\nLIGHTHOUSE.\pThe POKéMON that\nserves as the\pbeacon fell ill.\nSounds like they\nare in trouble.$"

Crystal_EcruteakCity_EcruteakCityFisherText_JasmineReturned:
	.string "The POKéMON at\nOLIVINE LIGHTHOUSE\nhas been cured.\pBoats can safely\nsail out to sea at\nnight again.$"

Crystal_EcruteakCity_EcruteakCityYoungsterText:
	.string "I hear POKéMON are\nrampaging at the\pLAKE OF RAGE. I'd\nlike to see that.$"

Crystal_EcruteakCity_EcruteakCityGramps3Text:
	.string "In the distant\npast…\pThis tower burned\nin a fire. Three\pnameless POKéMON\nperished in it.\pA rainbow-colored\nPOKéMON descended\pfrom the sky and\nresurrected them…\pIt's a legend that\nhas been passed\pdown by ECRUTEAK\nGYM LEADERS.\pMe?\pI was a trainer\nway back when.\nHohoho!$"

Crystal_EcruteakCity_EcruteakCitySignText:
	.string "ECRUTEAK CITY\nA Historical City\pWhere the Past\nMeets the Present$"

Crystal_EcruteakCity_TinTowerSignText:
	.string "TIN TOWER\pA legendary POKé-\nMON is said to\nroost here.$"

Crystal_EcruteakCity_EcruteakGymSignText:
	.string "ECRUTEAK CITY\nPOKéMON GYM\nLEADER: MORTY\pThe Mystic Seer of\nthe Future$"

Crystal_EcruteakCity_EcruteakDanceTheaterSignText:
	.string "ECRUTEAK DANCE\nTHEATER$"

Crystal_EcruteakCity_BurnedTowerSignText:
	.string "BURNED TOWER\pIt was destroyed\nby a mysterious\nfire.\pPlease stay away,\nas it is unsafe.$"

@ EcruteakGym <= EcruteakGym
Crystal_EcruteakGym_MortyIntroText:
	.string "Good of you to\nhave come.\pHere in ECRUTEAK,\nPOKéMON have been\nrevered.\pIt's said that a\nrainbow-colored\pPOKéMON will come\ndown to appear\pbefore a truly\npowerful trainer.\pI believed that\ntale, so I have\psecretly trained\nhere all my life.\pAs a result, I can\nnow see what\nothers cannot.\pJust a bit more…\pWith a little\nmore, I could see\pa future in which\nI meet the POKéMON\nof rainbow colors.\pYou're going to\nhelp me reach that\nlevel!$"

Crystal_EcruteakGym_MortyWinLossText:
	.string "I'm not good\nenough yet…\pAll right. This\nBADGE is yours.$"

Crystal_EcruteakGym_Text_ReceivedFogBadge:
	.string "{PLAYER} received\nFOGBADGE.$"

Crystal_EcruteakGym_MortyText_FogBadgeSpeech:
	.string "By having FOG-\nBADGE, POKéMON up\pto L50 will obey\nyou.\pAlso, POKéMON that\nknow SURF will be\pable to use that\nmove anytime.\pI want you to have\nthis too.$"

Crystal_EcruteakGym_MortyText_ShadowBallSpeech:
	.string "It's SHADOW BALL.\nIt causes damage\pand may reduce\nSPCL.DEF.\pUse it if it\nappeals to you.$"

Crystal_EcruteakGym_MortyFightDoneText:
	.string "I see…\pYour journey has\ntaken you to far-\naway places.\pAnd you have wit-\nnessed much more\nthan I.\pI envy you for\nthat…$"

Crystal_EcruteakGym_SageJeffreySeenText:
	.string "I spent the spring\nwith my POKéMON.\pThen summer, fall\nand winter…\pThen spring came\nagain. We have\plived together\nfor a long time.$"

Crystal_EcruteakGym_SageJeffreyBeatenText:
	.string "Wins and losses, I\nexperienced both.$"

Crystal_EcruteakGym_SageJeffreyAfterBattleText:
	.string "Where did POKéMON\ncome from?$"

Crystal_EcruteakGym_SagePingSeenText:
	.string "Can you inflict\nany damage on our\nPOKéMON?$"

Crystal_EcruteakGym_SagePingBeatenText:
	.string "Ah! Well done!$"

Crystal_EcruteakGym_SagePingAfterBattleText:
	.string "We use only ghost-\ntype POKéMON.\pNo normal-type\nattack can harm\nthem!$"

Crystal_EcruteakGym_MediumMarthaSeenText:
	.string "I shall win!$"

Crystal_EcruteakGym_MediumMarthaBeatenText:
	.string "I, I, I lost!$"

Crystal_EcruteakGym_MediumMarthaAfterBattleText:
	.string "The one who wants\nto win most--will!$"

Crystal_EcruteakGym_MediumGraceSeenText:
	.string "Stumped by our in-\nvisible floor?\pDefeat me if you\nwant a hint!$"

Crystal_EcruteakGym_MediumGraceBeatenText:
	.string "Wha-what?$"

Crystal_EcruteakGym_MediumGraceAfterBattleText:
	.string "Fine. I shall tell\nyou the secret of\pthe invisible\nfloor.\pThe path is right\nbefore our eyes!$"

Crystal_EcruteakGym_EcruteakGymGuideText:
	.string "The trainers here\nhave secret mo-\ntives.\pIf you win, they\nmay tell you some\pdeep secrets about\nECRUTEAK.$"

Crystal_EcruteakGym_EcruteakGymGuideWinText:
	.string "Whew, {PLAYER}.\nYou did great!\pI was cowering in\nthe corner out of\npure terror!$"

Crystal_EcruteakGym_EcruteakGymClosedText:
	.string "MORTY, the GYM\nLEADER, is absent.\pSorry, but you'll\nhave to leave.\pHohohoho.$"

Crystal_EcruteakGym_EcruteakGymPlayerStepUpMovement:
	walk_up
	step_end

Crystal_EcruteakGym_EcruteakGymPlayerSlowStepDownMovement:
	lock_facing_direction
	walk_slow_down
	unlock_facing_direction
	step_end

Crystal_EcruteakGym_EcruteakGymGrampsSlowStepDownMovement:
	walk_slow_down
	step_end

@ EcruteakItemfinderHouse <= EcruteakItemfinderHouse
Crystal_EcruteakItemfinderHouse_EcruteakItemfinderAdventureText:
	.string "Ah. You're on an\nadventure with\nyour POKéMON?\pWell, what's an\nadventure without\ntreasure hunting?\pAm I right, or am\nI right?$"

Crystal_EcruteakItemfinderHouse_EcruteakItemfinderTrueSpiritText:
	.string "Good! You under-\nstand the true\pspirit of adven-\nture.\pI like that! Take\nthis with you.$"

Crystal_EcruteakItemfinderHouse_ItemfinderExplanationText:
	.string "There are many\nitems lying about\pthat aren't ob-\nvious.\pUse ITEMFINDER to\ncheck if there is\pan item on the\nground near you.\pIt doesn't show\nthe exact spot,\pso you'll have to\nlook yourself.\pOh yeah--I heard\nthere are items\pin ECRUTEAK's\nBURNED TOWER.$"

Crystal_EcruteakItemfinderHouse_EcruteakItemfinderToEachHisOwnText:
	.string "Oh… To each his\nown, I suppose…$"

Crystal_EcruteakItemfinderHouse_EcruteakHistoryBookText:
	.string "HISTORY OF\nECRUTEAK\pWant to read it?$"

Crystal_EcruteakItemfinderHouse_EcruteakTwoTowersText:
	.string "In ECRUTEAK, there\nwere two towers.\pEach tower was the\nroost of powerful\nflying POKéMON.\pBut one of the\ntowers burned to\nthe ground.\pThe two POKéMON\nhaven't been seen\nsince…\pKeep reading?$"

Crystal_EcruteakItemfinderHouse_EcruteakThreeMonText:
	.string "ECRUTEAK was also\nhome to three\pPOKéMON that raced\naround the town.\pThey were said to\nhave been born of\pwater, lightning\nand fire.\pBut they could not\ncontain their\nexcessive power.\pSo they say the\nthree ran like the\pwind off into the\ngrassland.$"

@ EcruteakLugiaSpeechHouse <= EcruteakLugiaSpeechHouse
Crystal_EcruteakLugiaSpeechHouse_EcruteakLugiaSpeechHouseGrampsText:
	.string "This happened when\nI was young.\pThe sky suddenly\nturned black. A\pgiant flying POKé-\nMON was blocking\nout the sun.\pI wonder what that\nPOKéMON was? \pIt was like a bird\nand a dragon.$"

Crystal_EcruteakLugiaSpeechHouse_EcruteakLugiaSpeechHouseYoungsterText:
	.string "Is there really a\nPOKéMON that big?\pIf it exists, it\nmust be powerful.$"

@ EcruteakMart <= EcruteakMart
Crystal_EcruteakMart_EcruteakMartSuperNerdText:
	.string "My EEVEE evolved\ninto an ESPEON.\pBut my friend's\nEEVEE turned into\nan UMBREON.\pI wonder why? We\nboth were raising\pour EEVEE in the\nsame way…$"

Crystal_EcruteakMart_EcruteakMartGrannyText:
	.string "If you use REVIVE,\na POKéMON that's\pfainted will wake\nright up.$"

@ EcruteakPokecenter1F <= EcruteakPokecenter1F
Crystal_EcruteakPokecenter1F_EcruteakPokecenter1F_BillText1:
	.string "Hi, I'm BILL. And\nwho are you?\pHmm, {PLAYER}, huh?\nYou've come at the\nright time.$"

Crystal_EcruteakPokecenter1F_EcruteakPokecenter1F_BillText2:
	.string "I just finished\nadjustments on my\nTIME CAPSULE.\pYou know that\nPOKéMON can be\ntraded, right?\pMy TIME CAPSULE\nwas developed to\penable trades with\nthe past.\pBut you can't send\nanything that\pdidn't exist in\nthe past.\pIf you did, the PC\nin the past would\nhave a breakdown.\pSo you have to\nremove anything\pthat wasn't around\nin the past.\pPut simply, no\nsending new moves\por new POKéMON in\nthe TIME CAPSULE.\pDon't you worry.\nI'm done with the\nadjustments.\pTomorrow, TIME\nCAPSULES will be\prunning at all\nPOKéMON CENTERS.\pI have to hurry on\nback to GOLDENROD\nand see my folks.\pBuh-bye!$"

Crystal_EcruteakPokecenter1F_EcruteakPokecenter1FPokefanMText:
	.string "The way the KIMONO\nGIRLS dance is\pmarvelous. Just\nlike the way they\nuse their POKéMON.$"

Crystal_EcruteakPokecenter1F_EcruteakPokecenter1FPokefanMTextMobile:
	.string "You must be hoping\nto battle more\ppeople, right?\nThere's apparently\psome place where\ntrainers gather.\pWhere, you ask?\pIt's a little past\nOLIVINE CITY.$"

Crystal_EcruteakPokecenter1F_EcruteakPokecenter1FCooltrainerFText:
	.string "MORTY, the GYM\nLEADER, is soooo\ncool.\pHis POKéMON are\nreally tough too.$"

Crystal_EcruteakPokecenter1F_EcruteakPokecenter1FGymGuideText:
	.string "LAKE OF RAGE…\pThe appearance of\na GYARADOS swarm…\pI smell a conspir-\nacy. I know it!$"

Crystal_EcruteakPokecenter1F_EcruteakPokecenter1FBillMovement1:
	walk_up
	walk_up
	walk_up
	walk_up
	walk_right
	walk_right
	walk_right
	face_up
	step_end

Crystal_EcruteakPokecenter1F_EcruteakPokecenter1FBillMovement2:
	walk_right
	walk_down
	walk_down
	walk_down
	walk_down
	step_end

Crystal_EcruteakPokecenter1F_EcruteakPokecenter1FPlayerMovement1:
	walk_up
	walk_up
	walk_up
	step_end

@ EcruteakTinTowerEntrance <= EcruteakTinTowerEntrance
Crystal_EcruteakTinTowerEntrance_EcruteakTinTowerEntranceSageText:
	.string "TIN TOWER is off\nlimits to anyone\pwithout ECRUTEAK\nGYM's BADGE.\pSorry, but you'll\nhave to leave.$"

Crystal_EcruteakTinTowerEntrance_EcruteakTinTowerEntranceSageText_GotFogBadge:
	.string "TIN TOWER is off\nlimits to anyone\pwithout ECRUTEAK\nGYM's BADGE.\pAh!\pECRUTEAK's GYM\nBADGE! Please, go\nright through.$"

Crystal_EcruteakTinTowerEntrance_EcruteakTinTowerEntranceSageText_NoClearBell:
	.string "A momentous event\nhas occurred.\pI beg your pardon,\nbut I must ask you\nto leave.\p…What soothes the\nsoul…\pThe WISE TRIO say\nthings that are so\pvery difficult to\nunderstand…$"

Crystal_EcruteakTinTowerEntrance_EcruteakTinTowerEntranceSageText_HearsClearBell:
	.string "A momentous event\nhas occurred.\pI beg your pardon,\nbut I must ask you\nto leave.\p<……><……><……>\pAh!\pThe sound of that\nCLEAR BELL!\pIt… It's sublime!\pI've never heard\nso beautiful a\nsound before!\pThat bell's chime\nis indicative of\nthe bearer's soul.\pYou…\pYou may be able to\nmake it through\nTIN TOWER.\pPlease, do go on.$"

Crystal_EcruteakTinTowerEntrance_EcruteakTinTowerEntranceSageText_PleaseDoGoOn:
	.string "Please, do go on.$"

Crystal_EcruteakTinTowerEntrance_EcruteakTinTowerEntranceSageText_HeardClearBell:
	.string "That bell's chime\nis indicative of\nthe bearer's soul.\pYou…\pYou may be able to\nmake it through\nTIN TOWER.\pPlease, do go on.$"

Crystal_EcruteakTinTowerEntrance_EcruteakTinTowerEntranceWanderingSageText:
	.string "The TIN TOWER\nahead is a nine-\ptier tower of\ndivine beauty.\pIt soothes the\nsoul of all who\nsee it.$"

Crystal_EcruteakTinTowerEntrance_EcruteakTinTowerEntranceWanderingSageText_GotClearBell:
	.string "The TIN TOWER\nshook! A POKéMON\pmust have returned\nto the top!$"

Crystal_EcruteakTinTowerEntrance_EcruteakTinTowerEntranceGrampsText:
	.string "Two towers…\nTwo POKéMON…\pBut when one\nburned down, both\pPOKéMON flew away,\nnever to return.$"

Crystal_EcruteakTinTowerEntrance_EcruteakTinTowerEntranceSageBlocksLeftMovement:
	lock_facing_direction
	walk_fast_left
	unlock_facing_direction
	face_down
	step_end

Crystal_EcruteakTinTowerEntrance_EcruteakTinTowerEntranceSageBlocksRightMovement:
	lock_facing_direction
	walk_fast_right
	unlock_facing_direction
	face_down
