@ ManiasHouse <= ManiasHouse
Crystal_ManiasHouse_ManiaText_AskLookAfterShuckle:
	.string "I, I'm in shock!\pA guy about your\nage with piercing\peyes and long hair\ncame in.\pHe scared me into\ngiving him my\nprized POKéMON!\pI still have one\nleft, but what if\nhe comes back?\pYou look strong.\nCould you look\pafter my POKéMON\nfor a while?$"

Crystal_ManiasHouse_ManiaText_TakeCareOfShuckle:
	.string "Oh, thank you!\pTake good care of\nit, please!$"

Crystal_ManiasHouse_ManiaText_GotShuckle:
	.string "{PLAYER} received a\nPOKéMON.$"

Crystal_ManiasHouse_ManiaText_PartyFull:
	.string "Your POKéMON party\nis full.$"

Crystal_ManiasHouse_ManiaText_IfHeComesBack:
	.string "Oh, no… What'll\nI do if he comes\nback?$"

Crystal_ManiasHouse_ManiaText_CanIHaveMyMonBack:
	.string "Hi! How's my POKé-\nMON?\pI think I'm safe\nnow, so may I have\nit back?$"

Crystal_ManiasHouse_ManiaText_ThankYou:
	.string "Thank you!$"

Crystal_ManiasHouse_ManiaText_ShuckleNotThere:
	.string "Hey, you don't\nhave my POKéMON\nwith you.$"

Crystal_ManiasHouse_ManiaText_ShuckleLikesYou:
	.string "My POKéMON has\ncome to like you.\pAll right, you\nshould keep it.\pBut promise to\nbe good to it!$"

Crystal_ManiasHouse_ManiaText_SameAsBeingRobbed:
	.string "Oh, no, no… That's\nthe same as being\nrobbed.$"

Crystal_ManiasHouse_ManiaText_HappinessSpeech:
	.string "For POKéMON, hap-\npiness is being\pwith a person who\ntreats them well.$"

Crystal_ManiasHouse_ManiaText_ShuckleIsYourLastMon:
	.string "If I take my POKé-\nMON back, what are\pyou going to use\nin battle?$"

@ MountMortar1FInside <= MountMortar1FInside
Crystal_MountMortar1FInside_PokemaniacMillerSeenText:
	.string "I'm not losing\nthis time!$"

Crystal_MountMortar1FInside_PokemaniacMillerBeatenText:
	.string "I lost to some\nkid…?$"

Crystal_MountMortar1FInside_PokemaniacMillerAfterBattleText:
	.string "A while back, this\nkarate dude wanted\pto battle. He was\nridiculously good.\pHe just thrashed\nus silly.\pHe went in deeper\nsaying it was for\phis training. I\nwonder how he is?$"

Crystal_MountMortar1FInside_SupernerdMarkusSeenText:
	.string "Hey! HUGH!$"

Crystal_MountMortar1FInside_SupernerdMarkusBeatenText:
	.string "I mistook you for\nsomeone else…$"

Crystal_MountMortar1FInside_SupernerdMarkusAfterBattleText:
	.string "I came to explore\nMT.MORTAR, but I\pgot separated from\nmy partner…\pDid you run into a\ntrainer who uses a\pSEADRA that knows\nWATERFALL?$"

@ MountMortar2FInside <= MountMortar2FInside
Crystal_MountMortar2FInside_SupernerdHughSeenText:
	.string "Yo! MARKUS!$"

Crystal_MountMortar2FInside_SupernerdHughBeatenText:
	.string "Sorry, my mistake.$"

Crystal_MountMortar2FInside_SupernerdHughAfterBattleText:
	.string "I'm investigating\nMT.MORTAR, but my\npal's gone AWOL.\pHave you seen a\ntrainer who has a\pSLOWPOKE that can\nuse STRENGTH?$"

@ MountMortarB1F <= MountMortarB1F
Crystal_MountMortarB1F_MountMortarB1FKiyoIntroText:
	.string "Hey!\pI am the KARATE\nKING!\pI train alone here\nin the dark!\pYou!\nBattle with me!\pHwaaarggh!$"

Crystal_MountMortarB1F_MountMortarB1FKiyoWinText:
	.string "Waaaarggh!\nI'm beaten!$"

Crystal_MountMortarB1F_MountMortarB1FTyrogueRewardText:
	.string "I… I'm crushed…\pMy training is\nstill not enough…\pBut a loss is a\nloss. I admit it.\pAs proof that you\ndefeated me, I'll\pgive you a rare\nfighting POKéMON.$"

Crystal_MountMortarB1F_MountMortarB1FReceiveMonText:
	.string "{PLAYER} received\nTYROGUE.$"

Crystal_MountMortarB1F_MountMortarB1FKiyoGotTyrogueText:
	.string "TYROGUE is a\nfighting-type.\pIt evolves into a\ntougher POKéMON.\pKeep up the hard\nwork. I'll keep\ntraining too.\pFarewell!$"

Crystal_MountMortarB1F_MountMortarB1FKiyoFullPartyText:
	.string "You have no room\nin your party!$"

@ NationalPark <= NationalPark
Crystal_NationalPark_NationalParkLassText:
	.string "Look! Check out my\nbag!\pI printed out my\nfavorites from my\pPOKéDEX and stuck\nthem on my bag.$"

Crystal_NationalPark_NationalParkPokefanFText:
	.string "This is MAIL I got\nfrom my daughter.\nIt cheers me up.$"

Crystal_NationalPark_NationalParkTeacher1Text:
	.string "Pay attention,\nplease!\p…Oops, I have to\nquit thinking like\pa teacher all the\ntime.\pYou must be a\nPOKéMON trainer.\pSince you're work-\ning so hard, I\pwant you to have\nthis.$"

Crystal_NationalPark_NationalParkTeacher1Text_GotQuickClaw:
	.string "Let a POKéMON hold\nthat QUICK CLAW.\pSometimes it will\nstrike first\nduring battle.$"

Crystal_NationalPark_NationalParkYoungster1Text:
	.string "I'm playing with\nstickers I printed\nfrom my POKéDEX.$"

Crystal_NationalPark_NationalParkYoungster2Text:
	.string "I get the other\nguy's POKéDEX\nsticker if I win.$"

Crystal_NationalPark_NationalParkTeacher2Text:
	.string "I take walks in\nthe PARK, but I\pnever go into the\ngrass.\pTrainers always\nwant to battle…$"

Crystal_NationalPark_NationalParkPersianText:
	.string "PERSIAN: Fufushaa!$"

Crystal_NationalPark_NationalParkGameboyKidText:
	.string "I'm printing out\nmy POKéDEX.\pYou can also print\nout stuff like\pMAIL and your PC\nBOXES.$"

Crystal_NationalPark_SchoolboyJack1SeenText:
	.string "The world of\nPOKéMON is deep.\pThere are still\nlots of things we\ndon't know.\pBut I know more\nthan you do!$"

Crystal_NationalPark_SchoolboyJack1BeatenText:
	.string "Wha-wha-what?$"

Crystal_NationalPark_SchoolboyJackTradeMonText:
	.string "There is a lot\nto learn.\pFor example…\pThere are 50 kinds\nof TMs.\pTraded POKéMON\nlevel up faster.$"

Crystal_NationalPark_PokefanfBeverly1SeenText:
	.string "My POKéMON are\nsimply darling.\pLet me tell you\nhow proud my\ndarlings make me.$"

Crystal_NationalPark_PokefanfBeverly1BeatenText:
	.string "I can beat you in\npride, but…$"

Crystal_NationalPark_PokefanBeverlyCuteMonText:
	.string "I must say, your\nPOKéMON are quite\ncute, too.$"

Crystal_NationalPark_PokefanmWilliamSeenText:
	.string "We adore our POKé-\nMON, even if they\ndislike us.\pThat's what being\na FAN is about.$"

Crystal_NationalPark_PokefanmWilliamBeatenText:
	.string "M-my POKéMON!$"

Crystal_NationalPark_PokefanmWilliamAfterBattleText:
	.string "I lost the battle,\nbut my POKéMON win\pthe prize for\nbeing most lovely.$"

Crystal_NationalPark_PokefanFBeverlyMarillFriendText:
	.string "My friend keeps a\nMARILL!\pI find them very\nendearing.\pOh, I wish for a\nMARILL of my own…$"

Crystal_NationalPark_LassKriseSeenText:
	.string "Hello? Why are you\nstaring at me?\pOh, a battle?$"

Crystal_NationalPark_LassKriseBeatenText:
	.string "…Hmmm…$"

