@ OlivineCity <= OlivineCity
Crystal_OlivineCity_OlivineCityRivalText:
	.string "…\pYou again?\pThere's no need to\npanic. I don't\pbother with wimps\nlike you.\pSpeaking of weak-\nlings, the city's\pGYM LEADER isn't\nhere.\pSupposedly taking\ncare of a sick\pPOKéMON at the\nLIGHTHOUSE.\pHumph! Boo-hoo!\nJust let sick\nPOKéMON go!\pA POKéMON that\ncan't battle is\nworthless!\pWhy don't you go\ntrain at the\nLIGHTHOUSE?\pWho knows. It may\nmake you a bit\nless weak!$"

Crystal_OlivineCity_OlivineCitySailor1Text:
	.string "Dark roads are\ndangerous at\nnight.\pBut in the pitch-\nblack of night,\pthe sea is even\nmore treacherous!\pWithout the beacon\nof the LIGHTHOUSE\pto guide it, no\nship can sail.$"

Crystal_OlivineCity_OlivineCityStandingYoungsterPokegearText:
	.string "That thing you\nhave--it's a POKé-\nGEAR, right? Wow,\nthat's cool.$"

Crystal_OlivineCity_OlivineCityStandingYoungsterPokedexText:
	.string "Wow, you have a\nPOKéDEX!\pThat is just so\nawesome.$"

Crystal_OlivineCity_OlivineCitySailor2Text:
	.string "The sea is sweet!\pSunsets on the sea\nare marvelous!\pSing with me! \nYo-ho! Blow the\nman down!…$"

