@ OlivineGoodRodHouse <= OlivineGoodRodHouse
Crystal_OlivineGoodRodHouse_OfferGoodRodText:
	.string "OLIVINE is on the\nsea!\pAnd if it's on the\nsea, there are\nbound to be fish!\pI've fished here\nfor 30 years.\pWould you like to\nface the sea and\nfish?$"

Crystal_OlivineGoodRodHouse_GiveGoodRodText:
	.string "Ah, hahah!\nWe have ourselves\na new angler!$"

Crystal_OlivineGoodRodHouse_GaveGoodRodText:
	.string "Fish aren't found\nin the sea alone.\pThey go wherever\nthere is water.$"

Crystal_OlivineGoodRodHouse_DontWantGoodRodText:
	.string "Whaaat? You don't\nlike to fish!?\nIncomprehensible!$"

Crystal_OlivineGoodRodHouse_HaveGoodRodText:
	.string "How are things?\nLand the big one?$"

@ OlivineGym <= OlivineGym
Crystal_OlivineGym_Jasmine_SteelTypeIntro:
	.string "…Thank you for\nyour help at the\nLIGHTHOUSE…\pBut this is dif-\nferent. Please\pallow me to intro-\nduce myself.\pI am JASMINE, a\nGYM LEADER. I use\nthe steel-type.\p…Do you know about\nthe steel-type?\pIt's a type that\nwas only recently\ndiscovered.\p…Um… May I begin?$"

Crystal_OlivineGym_Jasmine_BetterTrainer:
	.string "…You are a better\ntrainer than me,\pin both skill and\nkindness.\pIn accordance with\nLEAGUE rules, I\pconfer upon you\nthis BADGE.$"

Crystal_OlivineGym_Text_ReceivedMineralBadge:
	.string "{PLAYER} received\nMINERALBADGE.$"

Crystal_OlivineGym_Jasmine_BadgeSpeech:
	.string "MINERALBADGE\nraises POKéMON's\nDEFENSE.\p…Um… Please take\nthis too…$"

Crystal_OlivineGym_Text_ReceivedTM09:
	.string "{PLAYER} received\nTM09.$"

Crystal_OlivineGym_Jasmine_IronTailSpeech:
	.string "…You could use\nthat TM to teach\nIRON TAIL.$"

Crystal_OlivineGym_Jasmine_GoodLuck:
	.string "Um… I don't know\nhow to say this,\nbut good luck…$"

Crystal_OlivineGym_OlivineGymGuideText:
	.string "JASMINE uses the\nnewly discovered\nsteel-type.\pI don't know very\nmuch about it.$"

Crystal_OlivineGym_OlivineGymGuideWinText:
	.string "That was awesome.\pThe steel-type,\nhuh?\pThat was a close\nencounter of an\nunknown kind!$"

Crystal_OlivineGym_OlivineGymGuidePreText:
	.string "JASMINE, the GYM\nLEADER, is at the\nLIGHTHOUSE.\pShe's been tending\nto a sick POKéMON.\pA strong trainer\nhas to be compas-\nsionate.$"

@ OlivineHouseBeta <= OlivineHouseBeta
Crystal_OlivineHouseBeta_OlivineHouseBetaTeacherText:
	.string "When my POKéMON\ngot sick, the\pPHARMACIST in\nECRUTEAK made some\nmedicine for me.$"

Crystal_OlivineHouseBeta_OlivineHouseBetaRhydonText:
	.string "RHYDON: Gugooh!$"

@ OlivineLighthouse1F <= OlivineLighthouse1F
Crystal_OlivineLighthouse1F_OlivineLighthouse1FSailorText:
	.string "People train at\nthis LIGHTHOUSE.\pIt's not easy to\nclimb because of\nall the trainers.$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse1F_OlivineLighthouse1FPokefanFText:
	.string "In the past, POKé-\nMON used to light\pthe sea around\nOLIVINE at night.\pThe LIGHTHOUSE was\nmade in honor of\nthose POKéMON.$"

@ OlivineLighthouse2F <= OlivineLighthouse2F
Crystal_OlivineLighthouse2F_SailorHueySeenText:
	.string "Men of the sea are\nalways spoiling\nfor a good fight!$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse2F_SailorHueyBeatenText:
	.string "Urf!\nI lose!$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse2F_SailorHueyUnusedText:
	.string "What power!\nHow would you like\pto sail the seas\nwith me?$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse2F_GentlemanAlfredSeenText:
	.string "Hm? This is no\nplace for playing.$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse2F_GentlemanAlfredBeatenText:
	.string "Ah! I can see that\nyou're serious.$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse2F_GentlemanAlfredAfterBattleText:
	.string "Up top is a POKé-\nMON that keeps the\nLIGHTHOUSE lit.\pBut I hear that\nit's sick now and\pcan't be cured by\nordinary medicine.$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse2F_SailorHueyGiveProteinText:
	.string "Man! You're as\ntough as ever!\pAnyway, here's\nthat medicine from\nbefore.$"

@ OlivineLighthouse3F <= OlivineLighthouse3F
Crystal_OlivineLighthouse3F_BirdKeeperTheoSeenText:
	.string "Why are you here?\nAre you just going\pto gawk? I suggest\nthat you leave!$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse3F_BirdKeeperTheoBeatenText:
	.string "You really are\nconcerned…$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse3F_BirdKeeperTheoAfterBattleText:
	.string "How the heck do\nyou go up?\pI want to visit\nthe sick POKéMON,\pbut I can't get up\nthere…$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse3F_SailorTerrellSeenText:
	.string "Sailors are both\nkind and strong.\nHow about you?$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse3F_SailorTerrellBeatenText:
	.string "You are both kind\nand strong…$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse3F_SailorTerrellAfterBattleText:
	.string "Every time I come\nback to OLIVINE, I\nvisit the GYM.\pThe GYM LEADER's\nPOKéMON type has\pchanged without me\nnoticing.$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse3F_GentlemanPrestonSeenText:
	.string "I travel the world\nto train my POKé-\nMON. I wish to\nbattle with you.$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse3F_GentlemanPrestonBeatenText:
	.string "…sigh… I must\ntrain some more…$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse3F_GentlemanPrestonAfterBattleText:
	.string "JASMINE used to\nuse rock POKéMON\nlike ONIX.$"

@ OlivineLighthouse4F <= OlivineLighthouse4F
Crystal_OlivineLighthouse4F_SailorKentSeenText:
	.string "JASMINE must be\nworried sick about\nthe POKéMON here.\pShe won't even\nsmile these days.$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse4F_SailorKentBeatenText:
	.string "I can't manage a\nsmile either…$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse4F_SailorKentAfterBattleText:
	.string "Speaking of sick,\nI've heard there's\pa good PHARMACY in\nCIANWOOD.$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse4F_LassConnie1SeenText:
	.string "JASMINE is this\ncity's GYM LEADER.\pI mean to bring\nher back with me.\pNobody had better\nget in my way!$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse4F_LassConnie1BeatenText:
	.string "Aaack! My POKéMON!$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse4F_LassConnie1AfterBattleText:
	.string "Right. Anybody\nwould be worried\nif his or her own\nPOKéMON were hurt.\pI'll pray for the\nPOKéMON here, so\pJASMINE can come\nback to the GYM.$"

@ OlivineLighthouse5F <= OlivineLighthouse5F
Crystal_OlivineLighthouse5F_SailorErnestSeenText:
	.string "I wanted to battle\nJASMINE, but she's\pnot up to it now.\nSo, how about you?$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse5F_SailorErnestBeatenText:
	.string "Whoa, whoa. You're\noverwhelming!$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse5F_SailorErnestAfterBattleText:
	.string "A GYM LEADER isn't\njust about being\pstrong. A LEADER\nalso needs to be\ncompassionate.$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse5F_BirdKeeperDenisSeenText:
	.string "We're pretty high\nup here. My bird\pPOKéMON are in\nprime form.$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse5F_BirdKeeperDenisBeatenText:
	.string "Oops…They crashed…$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse5F_BirdKeeperDenisAfterBattleText:
	.string "My POKéMON learned\nhow to use FLY in\nCIANWOOD.\pWell, since I'm a\nloser, I'll FLY\nacross the sea…$"

@ OlivineLighthouse6F <= OlivineLighthouse6F
Crystal_OlivineLighthouse6F_JasmineCianwoodPharmacyText:
	.string "JASMINE: … This\nPOKéMON always\pkept the sea lit\nat night.\p…But it suddenly\ngot sick… It's\ngasping for air…\p…I understand\nthat there is a\pwonderful PHARMACY\nin CIANWOOD…\pBut that's across\nthe sea…\pAnd I can't leave\nAMPHY unattended…$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse6F_JasmineGetSomeMedicineText:
	.string "…May I ask you to\nget some medicine\nfor me? Please?$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse6F_JasmineCureAmphyText:
	.string "JASMINE: …Will\nthat medicine cure\nAMPHY?$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse6F_PlayerHandedSecretpotionText:
	.string "{PLAYER} handed the\nSECRETPOTION to\nJASMINE.$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse6F_JasmineDontBeOffendedText:
	.string "JASMINE: …Um,\nplease don't be\noffended…\p…AMPHY will not\ntake anything from\nanyone but me…$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse6F_JasmineAmphyHowAreYouFeelingText:
	.string "JASMINE: …\pAMPHY, how are you\nfeeling?$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse6F_JasmineThankYouText:
	.string "JASMINE: …Oh, I'm\nso relieved…\pThis is just so\nwonderful…\pThank you so very,\nvery much.\p…I will return to\nthe GYM…$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse6F_JasmineISeeText:
	.string "JASMINE: …I see…$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse6F_JasmineAmphyHangOnText:
	.string "…AMPHY, hang on!$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse6F_AmphyPalPalooText:
	.string "AMPHY: …\n…Pa… paloo…$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse6F_AmphyBreathingLaboredText:
	.string "Its breathing is\nterribly labored…$"

Crystal_OlivineLighthouse6F_AmphyPaluPaluluText:
	.string "AMPHY: Palu!\nPalulu!$"

