Crystal_Route35_JugglerIrwinAfterBattleText:
	.string "I was going to\ndazzle you with my\nprize POKéMON.\pBut your prowess\nelectrified me!$"

Crystal_Route35_BugCatcherArnieSeenText:
	.string "I'll go anywhere\nif bug POKéMON\nappear there.$"

Crystal_Route35_BugCatcherArnieBeatenText:
	.string "Huh? I shouldn't\nhave lost that…$"

Crystal_Route35_BugCatcherArnieAfterBattleText:
	.string "My VENONAT won me\nthe Bug-Catching\pContest at the\nNATIONAL PARK.$"

Crystal_Route35_BugCatcherArnieYanmaText:
	.string "Wow… Look at all\nthose YANMA!\pI'm so blown away,\nI can't move.$"

Crystal_Route35_FirebreatherWaltSeenText:
	.string "I'm practicing my\nfire breathing.$"

Crystal_Route35_FirebreatherWaltBeatenText:
	.string "Ow! I scorched the\ntip of my nose!$"

Crystal_Route35_FirebreatherWaltAfterBattleText:
	.string "The POKéMON March\non the radio lures\nwild POKéMON.$"

Crystal_Route35_OfficerDirkSeenText:
	.string "Danger lurks in\nthe night!$"

Crystal_Route35_OfficerDirkBeatenText:
	.string "Whoops!$"

Crystal_Route35_OfficerDirkAfterBattleText:
	.string "You know, night-\ntime is fun in its\nown ways.\pBut don't overdo\nit, OK?$"

Crystal_Route35_OfficerDirkPrettyToughText:
	.string "Your POKéMON look\npretty tough.\pYou could go any-\nwhere safely.$"

Crystal_Route35_Route35SignText:
	.string "ROUTE 35$"

@ Route35GoldenrodGate <= Route35GoldenrodGate
Crystal_Route35GoldenrodGate_Route35GoldenrodGateRandyAskTakeThisMonToMyFriendText:
	.string "Excuse me, kid!\nCan you do a guy\na favor?\pCan you take this\nPOKéMON with MAIL\nto my friend?\pHe's on ROUTE 31.$"

Crystal_Route35GoldenrodGate_Route35GoldenrodGateRandyThanksText:
	.string "You will? Perfect!\nThanks, kid!\pMy pal's a chubby\nguy who snoozes\nall the time.\pYou'll recognize\nhim right away!$"

Crystal_Route35GoldenrodGate_Route35GoldenrodGatePlayerReceivedAMonWithMailText:
	.string "{PLAYER} received a\nPOKéMON with MAIL.$"

Crystal_Route35GoldenrodGate_Route35GoldenrodGateRandyWeirdTreeBlockingRoadText:
	.string "You can read it,\nbut don't lose it!\nROUTE 31!\pOh, yeah. There\nwas a weird tree\nblocking the road.\pI wonder if it's\nbeen cleared?$"

Crystal_Route35GoldenrodGate_Route35GoldenrodGateRandyCantCarryAnotherMonText:
	.string "You can't carry\nanother POKéMON…$"

Crystal_Route35GoldenrodGate_Route35GoldenrodGateRandyOhNeverMindThenText:
	.string "Oh… Never mind,\nthen…$"

Crystal_Route35GoldenrodGate_Route35GoldenrodGateRandySomethingForYourTroubleText:
	.string "Thanks, kid! You\nmade the delivery\nfor me!\pHere's something\nfor your trouble!$"

Crystal_Route35GoldenrodGate_Route35GoldenrodGateRandyMyPalWasSnoozingRightText:
	.string "My pal was snooz-\ning, right? Heh,\nwhat'd I say?$"

Crystal_Route35GoldenrodGate_Route35GoldenrodGatePokefanFText:
	.string "A strange tree is\nblocking the road.\pIt wriggles around\nif you talk to it.\pI heard it became\nwild when someone\pwatered it with a\nSQUIRTBOTTLE.$"

Crystal_Route35GoldenrodGate_Route35GoldenrodGatePokefanFText_FoughtSudowoodo:
	.string "I like the POKéMON\nLullaby they play\non the radio.$"

Crystal_Route35GoldenrodGate_Route35GoldenrodGateFisherText:
	.string "I wonder how many\nkinds of POKéMON\pthere are in the\nworld.\pThree years ago,\nPROF.OAK said that\pthere were 150\ndifferent kinds.$"

@ Route35NationalParkGate <= Route35NationalParkGate
Crystal_Route35NationalParkGate_Route35NationalParkGateOfficer1AskToParticipateText:
	.string "Today's {STR_VAR_3}.\nThat means the\pBug-Catching Con-\ntest is on today.\pThe rules are sim-\nple.\pUsing one of your\nPOKéMON, catch a\pbug POKéMON to be\njudged.\pWould you like to\ngive it a try?$"

Crystal_Route35NationalParkGate_Route35NationalParkGateOfficer1GiveParkBallsText:
	.string "Here are the PARK\nBALLS for the\nContest.$"

Crystal_Route35NationalParkGate_Route35NationalParkGatePlayerReceivedParkBallsText:
	.string "{PLAYER} received\n20 PARK BALLS.$"

Crystal_Route35NationalParkGate_Route35NationalParkGateOfficer1ExplainsRulesText:
	.string "The person who\ngets the strong-\nest bug POKéMON\nis the winner.\pYou have 20\nminutes.\pIf you run out of\nPARK BALLS, you're\ndone.\pYou can keep the\nlast POKéMON you\ncatch as your own.\pGo out and catch\nthe strongest bug\pPOKéMON you can\nfind!$"

Crystal_Route35NationalParkGate_Route35NationalParkGateOfficer1AskToUseFirstMonText:
	.string "Uh-oh…\pYou have more than\none POKéMON.\pYou'll have to use\n{STR_VAR_3}, the\pfirst POKéMON in\nyour party.\pIs that OK with\nyou?$"

Crystal_Route35NationalParkGate_Route35NationalParkGateOfficer1WellHoldYourMonText:
	.string "Fine, we'll hold\nyour other POKéMON\nwhile you compete.$"

Crystal_Route35NationalParkGate_Route35NationalParkGatePlayersMonLeftWithHelperText:
	.string "{PLAYER}'s POKéMON\nwere left with the\nCONTEST HELPER.$"

Crystal_Route35NationalParkGate_Route35NationalParkGateOfficer1ChooseMonAndComeBackText:
	.string "Please choose the\nPOKéMON to be used\pin the Contest,\nthen come see me.$"

Crystal_Route35NationalParkGate_Route35NationalParkGateOfficer1TakePartInFutureText:
	.string "OK. We hope you'll\ntake part in the\nfuture.$"

Crystal_Route35NationalParkGate_Route35NationalParkGateOfficer1FirstMonCantBattleText:
	.string "Uh-oh…\nThe first POKéMON\pin your party\ncan't battle.\pPlease switch it\nwith the POKéMON\pyou want to use,\nthen come see me.$"

Crystal_Route35NationalParkGate_Route35NationalParkGateOfficer1MakeRoomText:
	.string "Uh-oh…\nBoth your party\pand your PC BOX\nare full.\pYou have no room\nto put the bug\nPOKéMON you catch.\pPlease make room\nin your party or\pyour PC BOX, then\ncome see me.$"

Crystal_Route35NationalParkGate_Route35NationalParkGateOfficer1EggAsFirstMonText:
	.string "Uh-oh…\nYou have an EGG as\pthe first POKéMON\nin your party.\pPlease switch it\nwith the POKéMON\pyou want to use,\nthen come see me.$"

Crystal_Route35NationalParkGate_Route35NationalParkGateOfficer1WantToFinishText:
	.string "You still have {STR_VAR_3}\nminute(s) left.\pDo you want to\nfinish now?$"

Crystal_Route35NationalParkGate_Route35NationalParkGateOfficer1WaitAtNorthGateText:
	.string "OK. Please wait at\nthe North Gate for\pthe announcement\nof the winners.$"

Crystal_Route35NationalParkGate_Route35NationalParkGateOfficer1OkGoFinishText:
	.string "OK. Please get\nback outside and\nfinish up.$"

Crystal_Route35NationalParkGate_Route35NationalParkGateOfficer1ContestIsOverText:
	.string "Today's Contest is\nover. We hope you\pwill participate\nin the future.$"

Crystal_Route35NationalParkGate_Route35NationalParkGateOfficer1WeHoldContestsText:
	.string "We hold Contests\nregularly in the\pPARK. You should\ngive it a shot.$"

Crystal_Route35NationalParkGate_Route35NationalParkGateYoungsterText:
	.string "When is the next\nBug-Catching Con-\ntest going to be?$"

Crystal_Route35NationalParkGate_BugCatchingContestExplanationText:
	.string "The Bug-Catching\nContest is held on\pTuesday, Thursday\nand Saturday.\pNot only do you\nearn a prize just\pfor participating,\nyou also get to\pkeep the bug\nPOKéMON you may\phave at the end of\nthe contest.$"

