Crystal_Route36NationalParkGate_BugCatchingContestant1BText:
	.string "DON: Wow, you beat\nme. You're pretty\ngood.$"

Crystal_Route36NationalParkGate_BugCatchingContestant1BStillCompetingText:
	.string "DON: Luck plays a\nbig part in this.\pYou never know\nwhat POKéMON will\nappear.$"

Crystal_Route36NationalParkGate_BugCatchingContestant2BText:
	.string "ED: I envy you.\nI just couldn't\ndo it this time.$"

Crystal_Route36NationalParkGate_BugCatchingContestant2BStillCompetingText:
	.string "ED: Maybe you win\nwith big POKéMON?$"

Crystal_Route36NationalParkGate_BugCatchingContestant3BText:
	.string "NICK: Well done!\nI'm going to raise\nmy POKéMON better.$"

Crystal_Route36NationalParkGate_BugCatchingContestant3BStillCompetingText:
	.string "NICK: Maybe you\nget a higher score\pfor a POKéMON of\nan unusual color.$"

Crystal_Route36NationalParkGate_BugCatchingContestant4BText:
	.string "WILLIAM: You're\nthe winner? What\ndid you catch?$"

Crystal_Route36NationalParkGate_BugCatchingContestant4BStillCompetingText:
	.string "WILLIAM: Well, I'm\nsatisfied because\pI caught a POKéMON\nthat I wanted.$"

Crystal_Route36NationalParkGate_BugCatchingContestant5BText:
	.string "BENNY: Congrats!\nYou have earned my\nrespect!$"

Crystal_Route36NationalParkGate_BugCatchingContestant5BStillCompetingText:
	.string "BENNY: I caught a\nSCYTHER before,\nbut I didn't win.$"

Crystal_Route36NationalParkGate_BugCatchingContestant6BText:
	.string "BARRY: That POKé-\nMON you caught…\nit's awesome!$"

Crystal_Route36NationalParkGate_BugCatchingContestant6BStillCompetingText:
	.string "BARRY: It's easier\nto win if you get\pa high-level bug\nPOKéMON.\pBut I think they\nalso consider some\nother points.$"

Crystal_Route36NationalParkGate_BugCatchingContestant7BText:
	.string "CINDY: You won?\nThat's great!\pDo you feel like\nlooking for bug\nPOKéMON with me?$"

Crystal_Route36NationalParkGate_BugCatchingContestant7BStillCompetingText:
	.string "CINDY: I really\nlove bug POKéMON!$"

Crystal_Route36NationalParkGate_BugCatchingContestant8BText:
	.string "JOSH: I… I can't\nbelieve I lost at\nbug-catching…$"

Crystal_Route36NationalParkGate_BugCatchingContestant8BStillCompetingText:
	.string "JOSH: I heard that\nsomebody won with\na CATERPIE!$"

Crystal_Route36NationalParkGate_BugCatchingContestant9BText:
	.string "SAMUEL: Next time,\nI'm going to win.$"

Crystal_Route36NationalParkGate_BugCatchingContestant9BStillCompetingText:
	.string "SAMUEL: Darn.\nI thought I would\nscore higher…$"

Crystal_Route36NationalParkGate_BugCatchingContestant10BText:
	.string "KIPP: Could you\ngive me some tips?\pI want to study\nyour style.$"

Crystal_Route36NationalParkGate_BugCatchingContestant10BStillCompetingText:
	.string "KIPP: I study a\nlot, but that's\pnot good enough to\nwin.$"

Crystal_Route36NationalParkGate_UnusedSilphScope2Text:
	.string "I hear there's a\nPOKéMON that looks\njust like a tree.\pYou can reveal its\nidentity using a\nSILPHSCOPE 2.$"

