Crystal_Route37_SunnyGaveGiftText:
	.string "SUNNY: That thing…\pUm…\p… What was it now…\p…\pOh! I remember\nnow!\pA POKéMON that\nknows electric\pmoves should hold\nit.\pMy sis MONICA said\nit powers up\nelectric moves!$"

Crystal_Route37_SunnySundayText:
