	.string "I know something\ngood!\pMOOMOO FARM's milk\nis famous for its\nflavor.$"

Crystal_Route38_BeautyValerieSeenText:
	.string "Hi! Aren't you a\ncute trainer!\pMay I see your\nPOKéMON?$"

Crystal_Route38_BeautyValerieBeatenText:
