	.string "See those islands\nthat are blocked\nby whirlpools?\pThere just has to\nbe a secret!$"

Crystal_Route41_SwimmermBerkeBeatenText:
	.string "What's the secret\nto your strength?$"

Crystal_Route41_SwimmermBerkeAfterBattleText:
	.string "It was a dark and\nstormy night…\pI saw this giant\nPOKéMON flying\nfrom the islands.\pIt was scattering\nfeathers from its\nsilver wings.$"

Crystal_Route41_SwimmermKirkSeenText:
