Crystal_Route41_SwimmerfDeniseAfterBattleText:
	.string "A sunburn is the\nworst for skin.\pBut I don't use a\nsunblock.\pI won't pollute\nthe water.$"

Crystal_Route41_SwimmerfKaraSeenText:
