@ WiseTriosRoom <= WiseTriosRoom
Crystal_WiseTriosRoom_WiseTriosRoomSage1Text:
	.string "Astounding…\pSUICUNE, ENTEI and\nRAIKOU have arisen\nfrom their sleep…\pIs the legend\ncoming true?$"

Crystal_WiseTriosRoom_WiseTriosRoomSage2Text:
	.string "We train at the\nBURNED TOWER, but\pwe've never heard\nof a hole opening\pup there before.\nIt must have been\pdeliberately made\nby someone.$"

Crystal_WiseTriosRoom_WiseTriosRoomSage3BlocksExitText:
	.string "TIN TOWER may be\nentered by those\pbearing ECRUTEAK's\nGYM BADGE.\pHowever, now that\nSUICUNE, RAIKOU\pand ENTEI have\narisen, I ask you\pto refrain from\nentering!$"

Crystal_WiseTriosRoom_WiseTriosRoomSage3Text:
	.string "We, the WISE TRIO,\nare the protectors\pof the legendary\nPOKéMON.$"

Crystal_WiseTriosRoom_SageGakuSeenText:
	.string "Legend has it that\nupon the emergence\pof a trainer who\nhas the ability to\ptouch the souls of\nPOKéMON, a POKéMON\pwill come forth to\nput that trainer\pto test at the TIN\nTOWER.\pThe legend has\ncome true!\pThe legendary\nPOKéMON SUICUNE\nhas arrived!\pWe, the WISE TRIO,\nshall test your\pworthiness to go\ninside!$"

Crystal_WiseTriosRoom_SageGakuBeatenText:
	.string "Stronger than we\nthought? Perhaps…$"

Crystal_WiseTriosRoom_SageGakuAfterBattleText:
	.string "Ah, so it is you\nwho claim to have\pseen SUICUNE,\nENTEI and RAIKOU\nwhile they slept?\pUnbelievable!\pLegend has it that\nthey can't be seen\nwhile they sleep…$"

Crystal_WiseTriosRoom_SageMasaSeenText:
	.string "Can you be trusted\nwith the truth?\pI must ascertain\nyour worthiness.$"

Crystal_WiseTriosRoom_SageMasaBeatenText:
	.string "…I will tell you\nthe truth…$"

Crystal_WiseTriosRoom_SageMasaAfterBattleText:
	.string "In the past, there\nwere two nine-tier\ntowers here.\pThe BRASS TOWER,\nwhich was said to\pawaken POKéMON,\nand the TIN TOWER,\pwhere POKéMON were\nsaid to rest.\pThe view from the\ntops of the TOWERS\pmust have been\nmagnificent.\pAt the time, an\nimmense, silver-\pcolored POKéMON\nwas said to make\pits roost atop the\nBRASS TOWER.\pHowever…\pAbout 150 years\nago, a lightning\pbolt struck one of\nthe TOWERS.\pIt was engulfed in\nflames that raged\nfor three days.\pA sudden downpour\nfinally put out\nthe blaze.\pAnd that is how\nthe BURNED TOWER\ncame to be.$"

Crystal_WiseTriosRoom_SageKojiSeenText:
	.string "Let me see your\npower!$"

Crystal_WiseTriosRoom_SageKojiBeatenText:
	.string "Too strong!\nWhy?$"

Crystal_WiseTriosRoom_SageKojiAfterBattleQuestionText:
	.string "You… Are you the\ntrainer who is\pawaited by the\nlegendary POKéMON?$"

Crystal_WiseTriosRoom_SageKojiAfterBattleSpeechText:
	.string "I see…\pWe, the WISE TRIO,\nhave been given \pthe responsibility\nof protecting the\plegendary POKéMON.\nWe are to allow\ppassage only to\nthose people who\ppossess the power\nand soul of truth.\pPlease, do go on\nand enter the TIN\nTOWER ahead.\pSUICUNE will put\nyou to the test.$"

Crystal_WiseTriosRoom_SageKojiAfterBattleFinalText:
	.string "Please, do go on.\pSUICUNE will put\nyou to the test.$"

